; ***************************************************************************;;                                 PBBrowser; ;                           By Zapman - Nov. 2026;                    created with PureBasic 6.0 -> 6.40;                              For Windows only.                    Global PBB_NumVersion$ = "2.0 beta23";; ***************************************************************************;; A special thank you to 'Cage' from the French PureBasic forum for his help and; support during testing of the first beta versions.; Additional thanks to the English PureBasic forum members for their help during; debugging: highend, Axolotl, le_magn, AZJIO, Michael Vogel, Denis, Blue and all others.;;  TODO:;; - Improved handling of "IncludeFile": currently, PBBrowser correctly manages Include/XInclude directives located, for example,;   at the beginning of a file (even when enclosed within a CompilerIf block). However, Include/XInclude directives located;   inside an element (such as within a macro or a procedure) are not handled properly,;   even though PureBasic supports this syntax.;; - Spanish and German versions.; - Mac OS and Linux versions.;;; *********************** CHANGES FROM VERSION 1.0: ************************;; 1.01: • ProcedureC, ProcedureDLL and ProcedureCDLL are now recognized the same way;         as "Procedure".; 1.1:  • The file list now strictly respects the declaration order of the files.;       • When several elements begin with the same letters, the search box now displays;         a menu allowing the user to choose which specific element to look for.;       • If several elements share the same name (e.g., an ElementContentListing and a procedure;         having the same name):;         -> The element search examines the context to decide which element;            to display.;         -> The results presented in the "Found in..." panel are restricted;            to the corresponding type of element.;       • When a Macro name is the same as a PureBasic function name (overriding Macro),;         the search results in the "Details" panel now depend on where the search;         is performed (before or after the macro declaration).;       • "*MyVar" and "MyVar" are no longer confused in the results of the "Found in..." panel.;       • Fixed bugs in variable recognition when analyzing procedures in the "Details" panel.;       • In the 'Files' panel, files included by a project but not appearing in;         any 'IncludeFile' or 'XIncludeFile' directive are now distinguished.;         Furthermore, files included by this type of file are no longer included;         in the file list.;       • Code parsing is 10% faster.;       • The "CompilerIf" instruction is now taken into account when examining the list;         of included files.;       • Added "Module" and "Import"/"ImportC" to the list of elements.;       • Adaptation of the whole code to version 6.40 of PureBasic, in particular regarding system structures;         which are now already declared in resident files.; 1.11: • When initializing, if PBBrowser is unable to find the disk path of PureBasic, it explores the open;         windows to see if an instance of PureBasic is running and then (if so) retrieves and uses its file location.; 1.12: • Fixed: Parsing got stuck in an infinite loop when a .pbp project included a non-existent file.;       • Fixed: Analysis encountered a bug when some .PB files were saved with "LineFeed" as "EndOfLine" (Linux file format).; 1.13: • Fixed: Enumerations declared in multiple parts were not taken into account in their entirety.; 1.14: • Fixed: Some element types were not correctly recognized when the user clicked on them inside some PBBrowser panels.;       • Fixed: The tool "Create or Update a project file" had an occasional bug due to the way PureBasic 6.4 manages strings.; 1.15: • Fixed: 'Labels' were not recognized when followed by a comment.;       • Added "Threaded" as a possible variable type.;       • Optimized partial update speed (when a file's content is partially modified and requires re-analysis).;       • Code analysis logic is approximately 5% faster.;       • Revised comments to eliminate spelling errors and certain awkward phrasings resulting from my imperfect command of English.; 1.16: • Added "Define" as a variable type.;       • Fixed: Many small bugs in the way elements are identified as 'used' or not.;       • The second phase of exploration is 10% faster.;       • Updating PBBrowser when a file is modified inside the PB IDE is more reliable and 10% faster.;       • The code included between `CompilerIf #PB_Compiler_IsMainFile` and `CompilerEndIf` is excluded from processing;         for files that are not the main file. This can speed up the analysis of large projects containing many files with that test.;       • The tools from the menu and/or the "Help and Tools" window now offer to make a backup of the user's project files before;         modifying them (applies to 'Cosmetic Enhancer', 'Check procedure declarations' and 'Erase comments from the code').;       • The tools now preserve the original file format (Windows, Unix or Mac) when saving their modified versions.;       • The "Cosmetic Enhancer" tool was slow. It has been completely rewritten. It is vastly faster and free of the minor bugs;         found in the previous version.;       • The "Erase Comments" tool was slow. It has been completely rewritten. It is vastly faster and free of the minor bugs;         found in the previous version.;; *********************** CHANGES FROM VERSION 1.16: ************************;; 2.0 betaxx:;;   --- Blazing-Fast Engine & Compiler-Accurate Analysis ---;       • Near-complete engine rewrite: every operation has been drastically accelerated so you can work;         effortlessly on massive codebases. Code parsing and element indexing (procedures, macros, variables,;         structures, etc.) are now over 20 times faster than in version 1.16!;       • True compiler-order analysis: projects are now scanned following PureBasic's exact IncludeFile and;         XIncludeFile sequence. Search results appear in real execution order, letting you track at a glance;         where a variable is initialized, modified, and tested.;       • Full PureBasic syntax & scope mastery:;         - Modules and threads (including module isolation and edge cases).;         - All variable scopes (Global, Shared, Threaded, Static, Define, Protected), with only implicit;           local variables not yet listed in the Variables panel.;         - Structure and interface fields treated as first-class searchable elements.;         - Clean homonym resolution (e.g., a variable, a structure, and an enumeration sharing the same name).;         - Full support for "Import" / "Imported" blocks (even inside modules) and "CompilerIf" / "CompilerSelect";           directives (with inactive code zones clearly flagged).;;   --- Context-Aware Search & Surgical Refactoring ---;       • Smart semantic search: PBBrowser identifies the exact nature and scope of an element and acts;         exclusively on it. Whenever homonyms exist, a disambiguation popup lets you pick the exact target;         (element type, module, or even a specific procedure's local variable).;       • Safe project-wide or per-procedure Search & Replace: rename a variable across your entire codebase;         without false positives—even typed variables like MyVar.MyStruct are accurately renamed everywhere;         they are used, whether the type suffix is repeated or omitted!;       • Beyond the PureBasic IDE's search limits:;         - Multi-line and complex expression searches (e.g., "MyVar = 10"), completely whitespace-insensitive;           ("Procedure MyProc" seamlessly matches "Procedure    MyProc").;         - Dedicated options to include or ignore comments and string literals, plus a live total match counter.;;   --- Upgraded & Brand-New Built-In Tools ---;       • Overhauled toolset: all existing tools have been reviewed, debugged, and significantly sped up.;       • NEW — "Export Standalone Single-File .pb" (Code Flattener & Dead-Code Pruner): merges a multi-file;         project and all its external .pbi libraries in exact compilation order into a single, ready-to-compile;         .pb file (automatically rewriting IncludeBinary and icon paths). With optional surgical pruning of;         unused procedures, structures, macros, constants, and globals—even on a single-file project!—it is;         the ultimate tool to share compact code on forums, strip dead code in one click, freeze a self-contained;         project backup, or feed clean context to an AI. Designed and developed by Gemini Carbon (and it's great!).;       • NEW — "Procedure Signature & Declaration Generator": builds ready-to-use "Declare" headers or extracts;         annotated procedure signatures (including call graphs: "who calls whom?") to get a bird's-eye view of;         your architecture or share a lightweight blueprint with a co-developer or an AI. Developed with;         Gemini Carbon, and I think it's great.;;   --- Under the Hood ---;       • Countless UI, dark-mode, and quality-of-life refinements—I'm certainly forgetting a few!;       • Because almost everything was rebuilt from the ground up, all known (and unknown) bugs from v1.16 should be gone.;         New ones have almost certainly crept in! :) That said, a line-by-line review of every procedure;         alongside Gemini Carbon should make this release rock-solid.;       • The only trade-off for this leap forward: PBBrowser has put on a bit of muscle—roughly 6,000 extra;         lines of code (a fair share of which comes from detailed English documentation comments)!;;EnableExplicit;#NomProg = "PBBrowser";#PBB_MaxNbrOfFound = 1000#PBB_MaxNbrOfPopupLines = 49;;If #PB_Compiler_64Bit  PBB_NumVersion$ + " x64"ElseIf #PB_Compiler_32Bit  PBB_NumVersion$ + " x86"EndIf;CompilerIf #PB_Compiler_Unicode  PBB_NumVersion$ + " - Unicode"CompilerElse  PBB_NumVersion$ + " - NonUnicode"CompilerEndIf;; **********************************************************************************;;                         MODULAR ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW; UPSTREAM CORE INCLUDES:;   • PBB_Declarations.pb     - Global constants, structures, arrays, and DataSections.;   • PBB_Initialize.pb       - Startup CLI/IPC, preferences, catalogs, and PB maps.;   • PBB_Helpers.pb          - File paths, parsing primitives, sequences, ElementList().;   • PBB_CodeExploration.pb  - Semantic resolution, OnePass AST indexing, partial updates.;   • PBB_SearchAndContext.pb - BuildLayout AST, scope deduction, homonym disambiguation.;; MAIN FILE SECTIONS (PBBrowser.pb):;   • Panel Tabs & RichEdit Setup               - Tab selection, RichEdit subclassing, history UI.;   • Panel Syntax Coloring & Link Registration - TOM stream/list highlighters and link tables.;   • Panel Content Population                  - Formatters for Files, Lists, Details, FoundIn.;   • Memory Synchronization & Cache Reset      - Disk-change polling and global cache invalidation.;   • Hyperlink Clicks, History & IDE Dispatch  - Link/button clicks, page history, IDE launcher.;   • Main Window GUI Layout & Theming          - Menus, localization, theme colors, resizing.;   • Background Scheduler, IPC & Event Loop    - Cooperative timeslicing, pipes, PBBrowserMainProc.;; DOWNSTREAM FEATURE & TOOL INCLUDES (before PBBrowserMainProc):;   • PBB_SearchReplaceWindow.pb, PBB_NativeTools.pb, PBB_CustomTools.pb, PBB_SignatureTool.pb.;; **********************************************************************************;IncludePath "PBBrowser resources\Source Codes"IncludeFile "PBB_Declarations.pb"IncludeFile "PBB_Initialize.pb"IncludeFile "PBB_Helpers.pb"IncludeFile "PBB_CodeExploration.pb"IncludeFile "PBB_SearchAndContext.pb"; ; **********************************************************************************;;-                         Panel tabs & RichEdit setup;; **********************************************************************************;Procedure GetActivePBBPanel()  ;  ; Role: Examines the state of the two nested panels (MainPanelGadget and ListsPGadget)  ; and returns the 'PBBPanels' enumeration value corresponding to the currently active panel.  ;  Protected NoPBBPanel  ;  For NoPBBPanel = 0 To #EndEnumPBBPanels - 1    ; #ListPBBPanel is a parent panel that contains other sub-panels,    ; so continue the exploration if it is encountered.    If GetGadgetState(NoGadgetPBBPanel(NoPBBPanel)) = NoPBBPanel(NoPBBPanel) And NoPBBPanel <> #ListPBBPanel      ProcedureReturn NoPBBPanel    EndIf  NextEndProcedure;; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;            ---- RichEdit subclassing, styling & history buttons ----; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;Define OldREProc, PBBRichEditMessage, RangeOfClic.CHARRANGE, PBBREGadgetID;Procedure GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()  ;  ; Role: Examines the state of the two nested panels (MainPanelGadget and ListsPGadget)  ; and returns the gadget number of the corresponding RichEditGadget (EditorGadget)  ; for the currently active panel.  ;  ProcedureReturn NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(GetActivePBBPanel())EndProcedure;Procedure SetActivePBBPanel(NoPBBPanel)  ;  ; Role: Switches the UI view to the specified panel (#FilePBBPanel, #ListPBBPanel,  ;       #DetailPBBPanel, #FoundInFilesPBBPanel, #ProcPBBPanel, etc.) in O(1).  ;  If NoPBBPanel >= 0 And NoPBBPanel < #EndEnumPBBPanels And NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(NoPBBPanel)    If NoPBBPanel >= #ProcPBBPanel      ; Nested sub-panel inside ListsPGadget: select #ListPBBPanel on MainPanelGadget first      SetGadgetState(NoGadgetPBBPanel(#ListPBBPanel), NoPBBPanel(#ListPBBPanel))    EndIf    SetGadgetState(NoGadgetPBBPanel(NoPBBPanel), NoPBBPanel(NoPBBPanel))  EndIfEndProcedure;Procedure   PBBRichEditCallback(hWnd, Msg, wParam, lParam)  ;  ; Role: Intercepts events for a RichEdit gadget and replaces the text  ; cursor with a standard arrow cursor.  ; #WM_LBUTTONUP and #WM_RBUTTONUP events are intercepted  ; to update the variables 'PBBRichEditMessage', 'PBBREGadgetID',  ; and 'RangeOfClic'.  ; #WM_LBUTTONDBLCLK events are canceled because double-click  ; handling is performed in the main loop of 'PBBrowserMainProc()'.  ; Other events are left unmodified, but this procedure also hides  ; the gadget's blinking caret.  ;  Shared OldREProc, PBBRichEditMessage, RangeOfClic.CHARRANGE, PBBREGadgetID  ;  Protected txtrange.CHARRANGE  ;  If Msg = #WM_LBUTTONUP Or Msg = #WM_RBUTTONUP    If Msg = #WM_RBUTTONUP      CallWindowProc_(OldREProc, hWnd, #WM_RBUTTONUP, wParam, lParam)      CallWindowProc_(OldREProc, hWnd, #WM_RBUTTONDOWN, wParam, lParam)    EndIf    CallWindowProc_(OldREProc, hWnd, #WM_LBUTTONUP, wParam, lParam)    SendMessage_(hWnd, #EM_EXGETSEL, 0, @RangeOfClic)    ;    PBBRichEditMessage = Msg    PBBREGadgetID = hWnd    ProcedureReturn #True  ElseIf Msg = #WM_LBUTTONDOWN Or Msg = #WM_RBUTTONDOWN    SendMessage_(hWnd, #EM_HIDESELECTION, #False, 0)    ;  ElseIf Msg = #WM_LBUTTONDBLCLK Or Msg = #WM_RBUTTONDBLCLK    PBBRichEditMessage = #WM_LBUTTONDBLCLK    PBBREGadgetID = hWnd    ProcedureReturn #True    ;  ElseIf Msg = #WM_SETCURSOR    SetCursor_(PBBDefaultCursor)    SendMessage_(hWnd, #EM_EXGETSEL, 0, @txtrange)    If txtrange\cpMin = txtrange\cpMax      SendMessage_(hWnd, #EM_HIDESELECTION, #True, 0)    Else      SendMessage_(hWnd, #EM_HIDESELECTION, #False, 0)    EndIf    ProcedureReturn #True    ;  EndIf  ProcedureReturn CallWindowProc_(OldREProc, hWnd, Msg, wParam, lParam)EndProcedure;Procedure   SetREGadgetParam(NoREGadget)  ;  ; Role: Defines the attributes and behavior of the RichEdit gadgets for the various panels.  ;  Shared OldREProc  ;  SetGadgetColorEx(NoREGadget, #PB_Gadget_BackColor, GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("BackgroundColor"))  SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #EM_SETTARGETDEVICE, #Null, 0)  SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #EM_LIMITTEXT, -1, 0)  SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #EM_SETTEXTMODE, #TM_RICHTEXT, 0)  OldREProc = SetWindowLongPtr_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #GWL_WNDPROC, @PBBRichEditCallback())  ;EndProcedure;Procedure   ReSizeREMenu()  ;  ; Role: (Re)positions the hamburger menu button for the active RichEdit panel.  ;  Protected REGadget  Protected REMenuX = GadgetX(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget) + GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget) - 27  ;  REGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()  If REGadget    If GetWindowLong_(GadgetID(REGadget), #GWL_STYLE) & #WS_VSCROLL      REMenuX - 18    EndIf  EndIf  Protected REMenuY = GadgetY(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget) + 26  If GetActivePBBPanel() >= #ProcPBBPanel    REMenuX - 4    REMenuY + 24  EndIf  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BREMenu, REMenuX, REMenuY, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore)EndProcedure;Procedure   PBBResetContentAndStyles(GadgetID)  ;  ; Role: Resets content, clears styling, and applies default fonts to the target RichEdit gadget.  ;  PBB_SuspendRedraw(GadgetID, #True)  TOM_InsertText(GadgetID, "", 0, #EndOfText)  TOM_ResetFontStyles(GadgetID, 0, #EndOfText)  PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$ = AddNormalColorToTextStyle(GetPBBStringParameter("PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle"))  PBBCodeFontStyle$ = AddNormalColorToTextStyle(GetPBBStringParameter("PBBCodeFontStyle"))  TOM_SetFontStyles(GadgetID, PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$, 0, #EndOfText)EndProcedure;Define SearchNavigationIndex;Procedure   DrawSearchHistoryButtons(*LastSearch.SearchDetails, NoREGadget)  ;  ; Role: Updates the search history navigation index and renders back/forward navigation buttons  ; into the top section of the specified RichEdit gadget.  ;  Shared SearchNavigationIndex  ;  Protected DarkPrefix$, IButton$, BMarker$  Protected TotLen, BtnIdx, IsActiveBtn, Found  ;  ; 1. Check active slot first (preventing jumps to earlier duplicate slots), then scan ListOfSearches()  For BtnIdx = 1 To 2    If BtnIdx = 1      If SearchNavigationIndex < 1 Or SearchNavigationIndex > ListSize(ListOfSearches()) : Continue : EndIf      SelectElement(ListOfSearches(), SearchNavigationIndex - 1)    Else      ResetList(ListOfSearches())    EndIf    While BtnIdx = 1 Or NextElement(ListOfSearches())      If ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\ElementPurifiedName$ = *LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$ And         ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\DontCheckPosition = *LastSearch\DontCheckPosition And         ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\SearchInCom = *LastSearch\SearchInCom And         ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\SearchInQuotes = *LastSearch\SearchInQuotes And         ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\SearchInDeadZones = *LastSearch\SearchInDeadZones And         InheritStrongSearchTraits(*LastSearch, @ListOfSearches()\Search_Details)        SearchNavigationIndex = ListIndex(ListOfSearches()) + 1        Found                 = #True        Break 2      EndIf      If BtnIdx = 1 : Break : EndIf    Wend  Next  ;  ; 2. Append a new history entry when *LastSearch represents a distinct search or scope  If Found = #False And *LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$ <> ""    LastElement(ListOfSearches())    AddElement(ListOfSearches())    SearchNavigationIndex = ListSize(ListOfSearches())    CopyStructure(*LastSearch, @ListOfSearches()\Search_Details, SearchDetails)  EndIf  ;  PBBResetContentAndStyles(NoREGadget)  If Lightness(GetGadgetColorEx(NoREGadget, #PB_Gadget_BackColor)) < 128    DarkPrefix$ = "Dark"  EndIf  ;  ; 3. Render Left ('Previous') and Right ('Next') navigation buttons  For BtnIdx = 0 To 1    If BtnIdx = 0      IsActiveBtn = Bool(SearchNavigationIndex > 1)      IButton$    = "Previous"    Else      IsActiveBtn = Bool(SearchNavigationIndex < ListSize(ListOfSearches()))      IButton$    = "Next"    EndIf    If CharButtons      If BtnIdx = 0 : TOM_InsertText(NoREGadget, #PBBLeftArrow$, #EndOfText) : Else : TOM_InsertText(NoREGadget, #PBBRightArrow$, #EndOfText) : EndIf    Else      If IsActiveBtn        BMarker$ = #PBBRTFMarker$ + IButton$      Else        IButton$ = "No" + IButton$        BMarker$ = #PBBRTFMarker$ + "none"      EndIf      TOM_InsertTaggedJPGImageFromFile(NoREGadget, MyAppDataFolder$ + DarkPrefix$ + IButton$ + ".jpg", BMarker$, #EndOfText)    EndIf    TOM_InsertText(NoREGadget, "  ", #EndOfText)  Next  ;  TotLen = TOM_GetRealPos(NoREGadget, #EndOfText)  If CharButtons    TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, #PBBArrowsFontStyle$, 0, TotLen - 1)  EndIf  TOM_SetParaStyles(NoREGadget, "LeftIndent(40), FirstLineIndent(-40), RightIndent(20)", 0, 1)  ;  ProcedureReturn TotLenEndProcedure;; **********************************************************************************;;-                 Panel syntax coloring & link registration;; **********************************************************************************;Define PBBCustomLinks$;Enumeration DetailIntroLineModes  #IntroLine_None = 0  #IntroLine_Title  #IntroLine_Container  #IntroLine_UsedBy  #IntroLine_ProcVariables  #IntroLine_CalledProcedures  #IntroLine_CalledMacrosEndEnumeration;Procedure ResolveLocalVarScope(*Elem.Elements, *Search.SearchDetails = 0, ContainerID = 0, *OutCED.CED_Structure = 0)  ;  ; Role: Evaluates the usage state of '*Elem' (and populates '*OutCED' with the targeted declaration  ;       when '*Search' is provided). For non-Shared local variables (#PBBVariable with LocalVarContainer > 0),  ;       isolates the exact procedure/macro scope matching '*Search' or 'ContainerID' and checks whether  ;       that specific container is active and references '*Elem' in '\UsageParents'.  ; Output: Returns #True when '*Elem' is used in the evaluated scope, #False otherwise.  ;  Protected *Proc.Elements  Protected ExpectedParent$  Protected NewList CEDList.CED_Structure()  ;  If *Elem = 0 : ProcedureReturn #False : EndIf  If *OutCED    *OutCED\Filename        = *Elem\FileName    *OutCED\StartingPos     = *Elem\StartingPos    *OutCED\EndingPos       = *Elem\EndingPos    *OutCED\Declaration     = *Elem\Declaration    *OutCED\DirectContainer = *Elem\LocalVarContainer  EndIf  If *Elem\Type <> #PBBVariable Or *Elem\LocalVarContainer <= 0 Or *Elem\VariableSpecie = "Shared" Or     (*Search <> 0 And *Search\DontCheckPosition)    ProcedureReturn Bool(*Elem\Used Or ExplorationState < #ExplorationState_Completed)  EndIf  ;  If *Search    ContainerID = *Elem\LocalVarContainer    If *Elem\Continued <> "" And       Not (*Search\ElementFile$ = *Elem\FileName And *Search\EndingContextLimit > 0 And            *Elem\StartingPos >= *Search\StartingContextLimit And *Elem\StartingPos <= *Search\EndingContextLimit)      ExpectedParent$= LCase(*Search\ParentTypeAndName$)      CED_StringToList(*Elem\Continued, CEDList())      ForEach CEDList()        *Proc = ElementFixedIndexes(CEDList()\DirectContainer)        If (CEDList()\Filename = *Search\ElementFile$ And *Search\EndingContextLimit > 0 And            CEDList()\StartingPos >= *Search\StartingContextLimit And CEDList()\StartingPos <= *Search\EndingContextLimit) Or           (*Proc And ExpectedParent$ <> "" And LCase(PBBTypeNames$(*Proc\Type) + #Space$+ *Proc\Name) = ExpectedParent$)          ContainerID = CEDList()\DirectContainer          If *OutCED : CopyStructure(@CEDList(), *OutCED, CED_Structure) : EndIf          Break        EndIf      Next    EndIf  EndIf  ;  If ExplorationState < #ExplorationState_Completed : ProcedureReturn #True : EndIf  If ContainerID <= 0 : ProcedureReturn Bool(*Elem\Used) : EndIf  *Proc = ElementFixedIndexes(ContainerID)  ProcedureReturn Bool(*Proc And *Proc\Used And FindString(*Elem\UsageParents, "/" + Str(ContainerID) + "/"))EndProcedure;Procedure GetElementDisplayColor(FixedID, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor, ForceUnused = #False)  ;  ; Role: Returns the syntax highlighting color for 'FixedID' in O(1) via 'ElementFixedIndexes()'  ; without moving the current 'ElementList()' cursor, or 'NormalTextColor' if 'FixedID' is invalid.  ;  Protected *Element.Elements  ;  If FixedID > 0 And FixedID < NextElementID    *Element = ElementFixedIndexes(FixedID)    If *Element      If ForceUnused        ProcedureReturn PBBUnusedElementColor      ElseIf *Element\Used Or ExplorationState < #ExplorationState_Completed        If *Element\Type < #EndEnumPBBElementTypes          ProcedureReturn ListOfAllElementsColor(*Element\Type)        Else          ProcedureReturn NormalTextColor        EndIf      Else        ProcedureReturn PBBUnusedElementColor      EndIf    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn NormalTextColorEndProcedure;Procedure ResolveProjectTokenColor(TokenLCase$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor,                                   ExpectedType = 0, ModulePrefix$ = "",                                   VarSpecies$ = "", VarSubSpecies$ = "",                                   StrictDetailBody = #False, HasParentheses = -1,                                   *OutMatchedID.Integer = 0)  ;  ; Role: Checks if 'TokenLCase$' exists in ElementMapIndex() and matches the active panel/scope  ; constraints in O(1) via ElementFixedIndexes() without moving ElementList().  ; Returns the display color via GetElementDisplayColor(), or -1 if unmatched.  ;  Protected CandidateIDs$, FirstID$  Protected IDIndex, CandType, IsCandidate, MatchedID  Protected *Elem.Elements  ;  If *OutMatchedID : *OutMatchedID\i = 0 : EndIf  If FindMapElement(ElementMapIndex(), TokenLCase$) = 0    ProcedureReturn -1  EndIf  ;  CandidateIDs$ = ElementMapIndex()  Repeat    IDIndex + 1    FirstID$ = StringField(CandidateIDs$, IDIndex, ",")    If FirstID$ = "" : Break : EndIf    ;    *Elem = ElementFixedIndexes(Val(FirstID$))    If *Elem And *Elem\StartingPos > 0      CandType    = *Elem\Type      IsCandidate = #False      ;      If HasParentheses <> -1 And *Elem\HasParentheses <> -1 And *Elem\HasParentheses <> HasParentheses        Continue      EndIf      If ModulePrefix$ <> "" And CandType <> #PBBModule And LCase(GetEnclosingModuleName(*Elem\EnclosingModuleID)) <> ModulePrefix$        Continue      EndIf      ;      If ExpectedType > 0        If ExpectedType = #PBBStructure          IsCandidate = Bool(CandType = #PBBStructure Or CandType = #PBBInterface)        ElseIf CandType = ExpectedType          IsCandidate = Bool(CandType <> #PBBVariable Or VarSpecies$ = "" Or                             (LCase(*Elem\VariableSpecie) = VarSpecies$ And LCase(*Elem\VariableSubSpecie) = VarSubSpecies$))        EndIf      ElseIf CandType = #PBBField        IsCandidate = Bool(StrictDetailBody And                           (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBStructure Or                            DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBInterface Or                            DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBField) And                           *Elem\FileName = DetailPanelContext\FileName$ And                           *Elem\StartingPos >= DetailPanelContext\ElementStartingPos And                           *Elem\EndingPos <= DetailPanelContext\ElementEndingPos)      ElseIf StrictDetailBody        Select DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement          Case #PBBStructure, #PBBInterface            IsCandidate = Bool(CandType = #PBBStructure Or CandType = #PBBInterface Or CandType = #PBBConstant Or CandType = #PBBMacro)          Case #PBBEnumeration            IsCandidate = Bool(CandType <> #PBBConstant Or VarSpecies$ = "rhs" Or *Elem\LocalVarContainer = DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID)          Case #PBBImport            If CandType = #PBBImported              IsCandidate = Bool(*Elem\LocalVarContainer = DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID)            Else              IsCandidate = Bool(CandType = #PBBStructure Or CandType = #PBBInterface Or CandType = #PBBConstant Or CandType = #PBBMacro)            EndIf          Default            IsCandidate = #True        EndSelect      Else        IsCandidate = #True      EndIf      ;      If IsCandidate        If MatchedID = 0 : MatchedID = *Elem\FixedID : EndIf        If *Elem\Used Or ExplorationState < #ExplorationState_Completed          MatchedID = *Elem\FixedID          Break        EndIf      EndIf    EndIf  ForEver  ;  If *OutMatchedID : *OutMatchedID\i = MatchedID : EndIf  If MatchedID = 0 : ProcedureReturn -1 : EndIf  ProcedureReturn GetElementDisplayColor(MatchedID, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor)EndProcedure;Procedure AddDetailPanelLink(StartOffset, EndOffset, FixedID, *CustomDetails.SearchDetails = 0, ForceUserChoice = #False)  ;  ; Role: Registers an interactive element link for the active #DetailPBBPanel at [StartOffset, EndOffset].  ; Pre-populates TargetDetails from FixedID (matching the active procedure's CED continuation when  ; a local/Shared variable is declared across multiple procedures) or copies *CustomDetails directly.  ;  Protected FoundCED = #False  Protected NewList CEDList.CED_Structure()  ;  AddElement(DetailPanelLinks())  DetailPanelLinks()\StartOffset     = StartOffset  DetailPanelLinks()\EndOffset       = EndOffset  DetailPanelLinks()\ForceUserChoice = ForceUserChoice  ;  If FixedID > 0    If SelectPBBElement(FixedID)      If ElementList()\Type = #PBBVariable And         (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro) And         DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID > 0 And         ElementList()\LocalVarContainer <> DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID And         ElementList()\Continued <> ""        CED_StringToList(ElementList()\Continued, CEDList())        ForEach CEDList()          If CEDList()\DirectContainer = DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID            FillSearchDetailsFromElement(@ElementList(), @DetailPanelLinks()\TargetDetails, @CEDList())            FoundCED = #True            Break          EndIf        Next      EndIf      If FoundCED = #False        FillSearchDetailsFromElement(@ElementList(), @DetailPanelLinks()\TargetDetails)      EndIf    EndIf  ElseIf *CustomDetails    CopyStructure(*CustomDetails, @DetailPanelLinks()\TargetDetails, SearchDetails)  EndIfEndProcedure;Procedure ResolveDetailPanelToken(TokenLCase$, HasParentheses, TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset,                                  *TokenStart.Character, *LineStart.Character, PosInFile,                                  ExpectedType, ActiveModulePrefix$, VarSide$, WithVar$,                                  IntroLineMode, DontUnderline$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor)  ;  ; Role: Resolves the exact semantic identity, usage color, and link target of a token inside #DetailPBBPanel.  ; - Step 1: Queries VList\CompleteList when displaying a Procedure or Macro:  ;   * Immediately rejects formal parameters ('Parameter') and implicit variables ('Unprotected') so they are  ;     never underlined or linked (and never collide with homonyms in other scopes).  ;   * Tracks whether an explicitly declared local variable is marked 'Unused' in this specific procedure.  ; - Step 2: Queries ElementMapIndex() and FindElementInList() using PosInFile to disambiguate homonymous  ;   structure fields (\Field), module scopes, and macros overriding native PureBasic functions.  ; - Step 3: Computes the display color via GetElementDisplayColor() and registers the link in DetailPanelLinks().  ;  Shared VList.VariableListings  ;  Protected LineIdx, VLine$, VDeclare$, VarWord$, VUsed$, Species$  Protected VarIsContainer, IsUnusedInVList, TokenColor, MatchedID, FallbackID, MacroProcID = -1  Protected CandidateIDs$, QualTokenLCase$, IDStr$, IDIndex, TargetStructID, EvalPos  ;  ; =========================================================================  ; 1. PROCEDURE / MACRO LOCAL VARIABLE & PARAMETER SHIELD (VList\CompleteList)  ; =========================================================================  If (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro) And VList\CompleteList <> ""    If IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_ProcVariables Or       (IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None And ExpectedType = 0 And ActiveModulePrefix$ = "" And TokenLCase$ <> DontUnderline$)      LineIdx = 0      Repeat        LineIdx + 1        VLine$ = StringField(VList\CompleteList, LineIdx, #CR$)        If VLine$ = "" : Break : EndIf        VarWord$ = StringField(VLine$, 2, #TAB$)        If PurifyElementName(VarWord$) = TokenLCase$          VDeclare$      = StringField(VLine$, 1, #TAB$)          VUsed$         = StringField(VLine$, 3, #TAB$)          VarIsContainer = Bool(FindString(VDeclare$, "List") Or FindString(VDeclare$, "Map") Or FindString(VDeclare$, "Array") Or Right(VarWord$, 2) = "()")          If IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_ProcVariables Or VarIsContainer = HasParentheses            Species$ = StringField(VDeclare$, 1, " ")            If Species$ = "Parameter" Or Species$ = "Unprotected"              ; Formal parameters and implicit ('Unprotected') variables are not in ElementList():              ; never underline them and block downstream homonym lookups in ElementMapIndex().              ProcedureReturn -1            EndIf            If VUsed$ = "Unused"              IsUnusedInVList = #True            EndIf            Break          EndIf        EndIf      ForEver    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ; =========================================================================  ; 2. FILTER OUT RESERVED BASIC KEYWORDS IN CODE BODY BEFORE ELEMENT LOOKUP  ; =========================================================================  If (IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None Or IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_Title) And ExpectedType = 0 And ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""    If FindMapElement(PBBasicKeywordMap(), TokenLCase$)      ProcedureReturn -1    EndIf  EndIf  ;  If FindMapElement(ElementMapIndex(), TokenLCase$) = 0    ProcedureReturn -1  EndIf  CandidateIDs$ = ElementMapIndex()  ;  If ActiveModulePrefix$ <> ""    If GetModuleID(ActiveModulePrefix$) = 0 : ProcedureReturn -1 : EndIf    QualTokenLCase$ = LCase(ActiveModulePrefix$) + "::" + TokenLCase$  Else    QualTokenLCase$= TokenLCase$  EndIf  ;  ; Establish active procedural container ID (for Procedures, Macros, or local Variables)  If DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro    MacroProcID = DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID  ElseIf DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable And DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID > 0    If SelectPBBElement(DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID) And ElementList()\LocalVarContainer > 0      MacroProcID = ElementList()\LocalVarContainer    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ; =========================================================================  ; 3. UNIFIED ELEMENT RESOLUTION IN CODE BODY & INTRO HEADER  ; =========================================================================  If IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_CalledProcedures    ExpectedType   = #PBBProcedure    HasParentheses = 1  ElseIf IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_CalledMacros    ExpectedType   = #PBBMacro    HasParentheses = -1  ElseIf IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_ProcVariables    ExpectedType   = #PBBVariable    HasParentheses = -1  EndIf  ;  If IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None And ExpectedType = #PBBField    ; Structure or Interface field preceded by '\' in the code body    TargetStructID = ResolveFieldTargetStructID(CandidateIDs$, *TokenStart - SizeOf(Character), *LineStart,                                                WithVar$, DetailPanelContext\FileName$, PosInFile,                                                DetailPanelContext\ElementStartingPos, MacroProcID, "",                                                DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID)    MatchedID      = FindElementInList(QualTokenLCase$, #PBBField, PosInFile, DetailPanelContext\FileName$, MacroProcID, HasParentheses, "", TargetStructID, DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID)    If MatchedID = 0      MatchedID = FindElementInList(QualTokenLCase$, #PBBField, 0, DetailPanelContext\FileName$, MacroProcID, HasParentheses, "", 0, DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID)    EndIf    ;  ElseIf IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None And         (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBStructure Or DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBInterface Or          DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBEnumeration Or DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBImport) And         ExpectedType <> #PBBStructure And ExpectedType <> #PBBModule And ExpectedType <> #PBBLabel    ; Declarative body of a Structure, Interface, or Enumeration    ResolveProjectTokenColor(TokenLCase$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor, 0, ActiveModulePrefix$, VarSide$, "", #True, HasParentheses, @MatchedID)    ;  ElseIf (IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None And ExpectedType = 0) Or         ((IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_ProcVariables Or (IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_Title And ExpectedType = 0)) And MacroProcID > 0)    ; Single-pass procedural and module scope resolution (local variables prioritized over outer elements)    If IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None      EvalPos = PosInFile    Else      EvalPos = DetailPanelContext\ElementEndingPos    EndIf    MatchedID = FindElementInList(QualTokenLCase$, 0, EvalPos, DetailPanelContext\FileName$, MacroProcID, HasParentheses, "", 0, DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID)    If MatchedID = 0 And IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None And (TokenLCase$ = DontUnderline$ Or FindMapElement(PBNativeFunctions(), TokenLCase$) = 0)      ; Allow forward references (e.g. labels downstream in the procedure) and self-declarations,      ; while strictly forbidding macros defined downstream from overriding prior native PB function calls:      MatchedID = FindElementInList(QualTokenLCase$, 0, 0, DetailPanelContext\FileName$, MacroProcID, HasParentheses, "", 0, DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID)    EndIf    ;  ElseIf IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_UsedBy Or IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_Container    ; Intro header caller list ('usedBy') or enclosing container ('defined in File.pb (Container)')    IDIndex = 0    Repeat      IDIndex + 1      IDStr$ = StringField(CandidateIDs$, IDIndex, ",")      If IDStr$ = "" : Break : EndIf      If SelectPBBElement(Val(IDStr$))        If IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_Container          If (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBConstant And ElementList()\Type = #PBBEnumeration) Or             (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBField And (ElementList()\Type = #PBBStructure Or ElementList()\Type = #PBBInterface)) Or             (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBImported And ElementList()\Type = #PBBImport) Or             (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable And (ElementList()\Type = #PBBProcedure Or ElementList()\Type = #PBBMacro))            If FallbackID = 0 : FallbackID = ElementList()\FixedID : EndIf            If ElementList()\EnclosingModuleID = DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID              MatchedID = ElementList()\FixedID              Break            EndIf          EndIf        Else          If HasParentheses = -1 Or ElementList()\HasParentheses = -1 Or ElementList()\HasParentheses = HasParentheses            If FallbackID = 0 : FallbackID = ElementList()\FixedID : EndIf            If FindString(ElementList()\UsageChildren, "/" + Str(DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID) + "/")              MatchedID = ElementList()\FixedID              Break            EndIf          EndIf        EndIf      EndIf    ForEver    If MatchedID = 0 : MatchedID = FallbackID : EndIf    ;  Else    ; Explicit type lookups (#PBBStructure, #PBBModule, #PBBLabel, #PBBProcedure, #PBBMacro)    ResolveProjectTokenColor(TokenLCase$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor, ExpectedType, ActiveModulePrefix$, "", "", #False, HasParentheses, @MatchedID)  EndIf  ;  ; =========================================================================  ; 4. COLOR COMPUTATION & LINK REGISTRATION  ; =========================================================================  If MatchedID <= 0    ProcedureReturn -1  EndIf  IsUnusedInVList = Bool(IsUnusedInVList Or (MacroProcID > 0 And ResolveLocalVarScope(ElementFixedIndexes(MatchedID), 0, MacroProcID) = #False))  TokenColor      = GetElementDisplayColor(MatchedID, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor, IsUnusedInVList)  If TokenLCase$<> DontUnderline$    AddDetailPanelLink(TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset, MatchedID)  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn TokenColorEndProcedure;Procedure HighlightLinksAndFilesInRE(NoREGadget, NormalTextColor, *REContent.String = 0,                                     posdep = 1, SearchLimit = 0, IncludeCustomLinks = #True)  ;  ; Role: Underlines and colors custom interactive UI phrases (PBBCustomLinks$), project  ; filenames (including filenames with spaces), and inactive CompilerIf zone notices in the target RichEdit gadget.  ; Executed after token parsing so filenames and UI markers cleanly override any token styles.  ;  Protected REContent.String, *StringStart  Protected SourceList$, LinkItem$  Protected Pass, nl, PosInCode, PrevChar, NextChar, FreezeLocally  ;  Shared PBBCustomLinks$, PBBCurrentProject$  Shared PBB_FileListing(), PBB_BinaryFileListing()  ;  If *REContent = 0    *REContent    = @REContent    *REContent\s  = LCase(ReplaceString(TOM_GetText(NoREGadget, "", 0, #EndOfText), #LF$, "") + #CR$)    FreezeLocally = #True  EndIf  If *REContent\s = "" : ProcedureReturn : EndIf  If posdep < 1 : posdep = 1 : EndIf  If SearchLimit <= 0 : SearchLimit = Len(*REContent\s) : EndIf  ;  If FreezeLocally : TOM_Freeze(NoREGadget) : EndIf  *StringStart = @*REContent\s  ;  For Pass = 1 To 3    If Pass = 1      If IncludeCustomLinks = #False Or PBBCustomLinks$ = "" : Continue : EndIf      SourceList$ = LCase(PBBCustomLinks$)    ElseIf Pass = 2      SourceList$ = ""      If PBBCurrentProject$ : SourceList$ = LCase(GetFilePart(PBBCurrentProject$)) + #CR$ : EndIf      ForEach PBB_FileListing()       : SourceList$ + LCase(GetFilePart(PBB_FileListing()\FileName$)) + #CR$       : Next      ForEach PBB_BinaryFileListing() : SourceList$ + LCase(GetFilePart(PBB_BinaryFileListing()\FileName$)) + #CR$ : Next    Else      LinkItem$   = LCase(GetTextFromCatalogPB("inactiveCompilerZone"))      SourceList$ = LinkItem$ + #CR$      If FindString(LinkItem$, " ")        SourceList$ + ReplaceString(LinkItem$, " ", #NonBreakableSpace$) + #CR$      EndIf    EndIf    ;    nl = 0    Repeat      nl + 1      LinkItem$ = StringField(SourceList$, nl, #CR$)      If LinkItem$ = "" : Break : EndIf      PosInCode = posdep - 1      Repeat        PosInCode = FindString(*REContent\s, LinkItem$, PosInCode + 1)        If PosInCode = 0 Or PosInCode + Len(LinkItem$) - 1 > SearchLimit : Break : EndIf        If Pass = 2          If PosInCode > 1 : PrevChar = PeekC(*StringStart + (PosInCode - 2) * SizeOf(Character)) : Else : PrevChar = 0 : EndIf          NextChar = PeekC(*StringStart + (PosInCode + Len(LinkItem$) - 1) * SizeOf(Character))          ; Verify left/right boundaries and do not overwrite anonymous enumeration names ("UnNamed - File.pb/Line X")          If Not ((PrevChar = 0 Or PrevChar = #CR Or PrevChar = ' ' Or PrevChar = #NonBreakableSpace Or PrevChar = '(') And                  Not ((NextChar >= 'a' And NextChar <= 'z') Or (NextChar >= '0' And NextChar <= '9') Or NextChar = '_') And                  Not (NextChar = '/' And PosInCode > 10 And FastMid(*REContent\s, PosInCode - 10, 10) = "unnamed - "))            Continue          EndIf        EndIf        If Pass = 3          TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold(0),ForeColor(" + Str(#PBB_InactiveZoneColor) + ")", PosInCode - 1, PosInCode + Len(LinkItem$) - 1)        Else          TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold(0),Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(NormalTextColor) + ")", PosInCode - 1, PosInCode + Len(LinkItem$) - 1)        EndIf      ForEver    ForEver  Next  ;  If FreezeLocally : TOM_UnFreeze(NoREGadget) : EndIfEndProcedure;Macro ApplyResolvedTokenStyle  ;  ; Role: Styles a resolved project element (and any active 'In <Container>' header in FoundInFiles)  ;       using 'TokenColor', preserving unused gray styling on unreferenced containers.  ;  If TokenLCase$ <> DontUnderline$    TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(TokenColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)  ElseIf *TokenStart >= *IntroLimit Or IntroLineMode <> #IntroLine_Title    If TokenColor = PBBUnusedElementColor      TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(PBBUnusedElementColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)    Else      TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(TitleColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)    EndIf  EndIf  If IsContainerCandidate    TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(TokenColor) + ")", ContainerStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)    If TypeKeywordStartOffset > 0      TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold,ForeColor(" + Str(BasicKeywordColor) + ")", TypeKeywordStartOffset, TypeKeywordEndOffset)    EndIf    If TokenLCase$ <> DontUnderline$      TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline()", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)    EndIf    IsContainerCandidate = #False  EndIfEndMacro;Procedure Colorize_REContent(NoREGadget, PanelID, posdep = 0, EndIntroPos = 0,                                     TitleColor = 0, *REContent.String = 0,                                     DontUnderline$ = "", AllowProgressiveFlush = #False)  ;  ; ROLE & ARCHITECTURAL OVERVIEW:  ; Forward O(N) stream parser and syntax highlighter dedicated to #DetailPBBPanel and #FoundInFilesPBBPanel.  ; Reuses the central parsing helpers (ExtractOrSkipNextToken, ExtractOrSkipNextString, GoToEOL_AndExtractComment),  ; skips natural-language labels in the Details header, resolves project tokens via ResolveDetailPanelToken()  ; (for #DetailPBBPanel, populating DetailPanelLinks()) or ResolveProjectTokenColor() (for #FoundInFilesPBBPanel),  ; and delegates custom UI links and project filenames to HighlightLinksAndFilesInRE() in a final pass.  ;  Protected REContent.String, *DetailFileString.String  Protected *StringStart, *Char.Character, *TokenStart.Character, *LookAhead.Character, *IntroLimit.Character  Protected *ColonPtr.Character, *CommaPtr.Character, *OpenParenPtr.Character, *LineStart.Character  Protected TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset, ContainerStartOffset, TypeKeywordStartOffset, TypeKeywordEndOffset  Protected DetailFileLinePos, DetailGadgetLineOffset, DetailBodyLineCount, PosInFile, IntroLineMode, NextTokenExpectedType  Protected TokenLCase$, ActiveModulePrefix$, OutOfElementsName$, InactiveZone$, InactiveZoneNBSP$, VarSide$, TOMCommand$, DetailWithVar$, IntroPrefix$  Protected UnusedPrefix$, UnprotectedPrefix$, MissingPrefix$, CalledProcsPrefix$, CalledMacrosPrefix$  Protected IsContainerCandidate.b, StopAtClosingParen.b, HasParen.b  Protected TokenColor, ContainerElementType.l, ExpectedType, OutOfElementsLen, InactiveZoneLen, BulletChar, SearchLimit, ct, IAQ, PrevChar  ;  Protected BasicKeywordColor     = GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("BasicKeywordColor")  Protected PureKeywordColor      = GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("PureKeywordColor")  Protected ConstantColor         = GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("ConstantColor")  Protected CommentColor          = GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("CommentColor")  Protected StringColor           = GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("StringColor")  Protected NormalTextColor       = GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("NormalTextColor")  Protected PBBSetValueColor      = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBSetValueColor")  Protected PBBUnusedElementColor = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBUnusedElementColor")  ;  If PanelID = #ListPBBPanel Or PanelID = #FilePBBPanel    ProcedureReturn 0  EndIf  ;  If *REContent = 0    *REContent   = @REContent.String    *REContent\s = LCase(ReplaceString(TOM_GetText(NoREGadget, "", 0, #EndOfText), #LF$, "") + #CR$)  EndIf  ;  If *REContent\s = "" : ProcedureReturn 0 : EndIf  ;  TOM_Freeze(NoREGadget)  ;  DontUnderline$      = PurifyElementName(DontUnderline$)  OutOfElementsName$  = LCase(GetTextFromCatalogPB(#OutOfElementsName))  OutOfElementsLen    = Len(OutOfElementsName$)  InactiveZone$       = LCase(GetTextFromCatalogPB("inactiveCompilerZone"))  InactiveZoneNBSP$   = ReplaceString(InactiveZone$, " ", #NonBreakableSpace$)  InactiveZoneLen     = Len(InactiveZone$)  BulletChar          = Asc(GetPBBStringParameter("PBB_Bullet"))  UnusedPrefix$       = LCase(Trim(StringField(GetTextFromCatalogPB("UnusedVariables:"), 1, ":")))  UnprotectedPrefix$  = LCase(Trim(StringField(GetTextFromCatalogPB("UnprotectedVariables:"), 1, ":")))  MissingPrefix$      = LCase(Trim(StringField(GetTextFromCatalogPB("MissingElements:"), 1, ":")))  CalledProcsPrefix$  = LCase(Trim(StringField(GetTextFromCatalogPB("CalledProcedures"), 1, ":")))  CalledMacrosPrefix$ = LCase(Trim(StringField(GetTextFromCatalogPB("CalledMacros"), 1, ":")))  ;  If posdep < 1 : posdep = 1 : EndIf  *StringStart       = @*REContent\s  *Char              = PosToChar(*StringStart, posdep)  *LineStart         = *Char  ;  If EndIntroPos > 0    *IntroLimit = PosToChar(*StringStart, EndIntroPos)  Else    *IntroLimit = *StringStart  EndIf  ;  If PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel    If *Char < *IntroLimit      IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_Title    EndIf    If DetailPanelContext\FileName$ <> "" And DetailPanelContext\ElementStartingPos > 0      *DetailFileString = GetPointedCodeFromFile(DetailPanelContext\FileName$)    EndIf  EndIf  ;  CompilerIf #PBBReport    Protected SavedOPDTokenLine$ = OPDTokenLine$  CompilerEndIf  ;  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  ; 1. FORWARD STREAM PARSER (#DetailPBBPanel AND #FoundInFilesPBBPanel)  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  While *Char\c <> 0    ;    ; Reset line-level tracking states upon encountering a line break    If *Char\c = #CR      IsContainerCandidate  = #False      ContainerElementType  = #PBBProcedure      ActiveModulePrefix$   = ""      StopAtClosingParen    = #False      NextTokenExpectedType = 0      GoNextChar(*Char)      *LineStart            = *Char      ;      ; In the Details panel intro (after the title line), skip natural-language prefixes      If PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel And *Char < *IntroLimit        IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None        SkipSpaces(*Char)        If *Char < *IntroLimit And *Char\c <> #CR And *Char\c <> 0          If *Char\c = BulletChar            GoNextChar(*Char)            SkipSpaces(*Char)            ; Scan current bullet line to distinguish colon-lists from definition locations            *LookAhead    = *Char            *ColonPtr     = 0            *CommaPtr     = 0            *OpenParenPtr = 0            While *LookAhead\c <> 0 And *LookAhead\c <> #CR              If *LookAhead\c = ':' And *ColonPtr = 0                *ColonPtr = *LookAhead              ElseIf *LookAhead\c = ',' And *CommaPtr = 0                *CommaPtr = *LookAhead              ElseIf *LookAhead\c = '(' And *OpenParenPtr = 0                *OpenParenPtr = *LookAhead              EndIf              GoNextChar(*LookAhead)            Wend            ;            If *ColonPtr And (*CommaPtr = 0 Or *ColonPtr < *CommaPtr)              ; Colon-list intro line (usedBy, CalledProcedures, CalledMacros, UnusedVariables, UnprotectedVariables):              ; identify which list is on this line and jump directly past ':'              IntroPrefix$ = Trim(PeekS(*Char, ComputeLenFromChars(*Char, *ColonPtr)))              If MissingPrefix$ <> "" And FindString(IntroPrefix$, MissingPrefix$)                ; Missing elements do not exist in the project: skip to EOL so homonyms in other modules are not underlined                *Char = *LookAhead              ElseIf (UnusedPrefix$ <> "" And FindString(IntroPrefix$, UnusedPrefix$)) Or                     (UnprotectedPrefix$ <> "" And FindString(IntroPrefix$, UnprotectedPrefix$))                IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_ProcVariables              ElseIf CalledProcsPrefix$ <> "" And FindString(IntroPrefix$, CalledProcsPrefix$)                IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_CalledProcedures              ElseIf CalledMacrosPrefix$ <> "" And FindString(IntroPrefix$, CalledMacrosPrefix$)                IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_CalledMacros              Else                IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_UsedBy              EndIf              *Char = *ColonPtr + SizeOf(Character)            Else              ; Definition location line ("defined in File.pb (Proc), at line X") or "Unused"              IAQ = Bool(PeekS(*Char, 7) = "shared ") * 6 + Bool(PeekS(*Char, 10) = "usemodule ") * 9 + Bool(PeekS(*Char, 12) = "unusemodule ") * 11              If IAQ                TokenStartOffset = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char)                TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold,ForeColor(" + Str(BasicKeywordColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenStartOffset + IAQ)              EndIf              If *OpenParenPtr                *Char              = *OpenParenPtr + SizeOf(Character)                StopAtClosingParen = #True                IntroLineMode      = #IntroLine_Container              Else                *Char = *LookAhead              EndIf            EndIf          Else            ; Non-bullet intro line (e.g., "SeeVariablesList"): skip to EOL for post-pass link underlining            While *Char\c <> 0 And *Char\c <> #CR : GoNextChar(*Char) : Wend          EndIf        EndIf      ElseIf PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel And *IntroLimit > *StringStart And *Char > *IntroLimit And *DetailFileString        ; Entering or advancing a line in the code body of #DetailPBBPanel: update O(1) source file line anchor        IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_None        DetailBodyLineCount + 1        If AllowProgressiveFlush And DetailBodyLineCount % 300 = 0          ; Flush syntax highlighting every 300 lines so large procedures display progressively          TOM_UnFreeze(NoREGadget)          PBB_SuspendRedraw(NoREGadget, #False)          UpdateWindow_(GadgetID(NoREGadget))          PBB_SuspendRedraw(NoREGadget, #True)          TOM_Freeze(NoREGadget)        EndIf        If DetailFileLinePos = 0          DetailFileLinePos = DetailPanelContext\ElementStartingPos        Else          DetailFileLinePos = FindString(*DetailFileString\s, #CR$, DetailFileLinePos)          If DetailFileLinePos > 0            DetailFileLinePos + 1          EndIf        EndIf        If DetailFileLinePos > 0          While PeekC(@*DetailFileString\s + (DetailFileLinePos - 1) * SizeOf(Character)) = #Space            DetailFileLinePos + 1          Wend        EndIf        DetailGadgetLineOffset = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char)      EndIf      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; In a definition location line, skip trailing "at line X" text once the '(Proc)' parenthesis closes    If StopAtClosingParen And *Char\c = ')'      StopAtClosingParen = #False      While *Char\c <> 0 And *Char\c <> #CR : GoNextChar(*Char) : Wend      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; Skip whitespace    If *Char\c = #Space Or *Char\c = #NonBreakableSpace      ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""      GoNextChar(*Char)      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; Preserve ActiveModulePrefix$ when advancing across '::'    If *Char\c = ':'      If PeekC(*Char + SizeOf(Character)) = ':'        *Char + 2 * SizeOf(Character)      Else        ActiveModulePrefix$   = ""        NextTokenExpectedType = 0        GoNextChar(*Char)      EndIf      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; Colorize full-line/trailing comments in Details, or the standalone ';' marker in FoundInFiles    If *Char\c = ';'      ActiveModulePrefix$   = ""      NextTokenExpectedType = 0      TokenStartOffset      = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char)      If PanelID = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel        GoNextChar(*Char)        TOMCommand$ = "Bold(1),Forecolor(" + Str(CommentColor) + ")"      Else        GoToEOL_AndExtractComment(@*Char)        TOMCommand$ = "Forecolor(" + Str(CommentColor) + ")"      EndIf      TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, TOMCommand$, TokenStartOffset, ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char))      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; Colorize standard, escaped (~"..."), and character literals via ExtractOrSkipNextString(),    ; or resolve quoted '#PBBImport' library targets ("kernel32.lib") as interactive links:    If *Char\c = #DOUBLEQUOTE Or *Char\c = #SIMPLEQUOTE Or       (*Char\c = '~' And PeekC(*Char + SizeOf(Character)) = #DOUBLEQUOTE)      *TokenStart      = *Char      ExtractOrSkipNextString(@*Char, *Char\c, #True)      TokenStartOffset = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *TokenStart)      TokenEndOffset   = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char)      TokenLCase$      = PeekS(*TokenStart, TokenEndOffset - TokenStartOffset)      If NextTokenExpectedType = #PBBImport Or (PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel And IntroLineMode = #IntroLine_Container)        NextTokenExpectedType = 0        If PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel          TokenColor = ResolveDetailPanelToken(TokenLCase$, #False, TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset,                                               *TokenStart, *LineStart, 0, #PBBImport,                                               ActiveModulePrefix$, "lhs", "", IntroLineMode,                                               DontUnderline$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor)        Else          TokenColor = ResolveProjectTokenColor(TokenLCase$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor,                                                #PBBImport, ActiveModulePrefix$)        EndIf        ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""        If TokenColor <> -1          ApplyResolvedTokenStyle          Continue        EndIf      EndIf      ActiveModulePrefix$   = ""      NextTokenExpectedType = 0      If *TokenStart >= *IntroLimit        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Forecolor(" + Str(StringColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)      EndIf      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; Underline bracketed line numbers "[123]" in the Found in Files panel    If PanelID = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel And *Char\c = '['      ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""      TokenStartOffset    = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char) + 1      While *Char\c <> 0 And *Char\c <> #CR And *Char\c <> ']' : GoNextChar(*Char) : Wend      TokenEndOffset = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char)      If *Char\c = ']'        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline()", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)        GoNextChar(*Char)      EndIf      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; Skip multi-word OutOfElementsName$ ("Code hors procédure" / "Out-of-procedure code")    If OutOfElementsLen > 0 And PeekS(*Char, OutOfElementsLen) = OutOfElementsName$      ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""      *Char + OutOfElementsLen * SizeOf(Character)      If PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel And *Char < *IntroLimit        While *Char\c <> 0 And *Char\c <> #CR And *Char\c <> ',' : GoNextChar(*Char) : Wend      EndIf      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; Skip inactive CompilerIf zone notices so 'CompilerIf' or homonyms are not styled/underlined as code    If InactiveZoneLen > 0 And *Char\c = Asc(InactiveZone$) And       (PeekS(*Char, InactiveZoneLen) = InactiveZone$ Or PeekS(*Char, InactiveZoneLen) = InactiveZoneNBSP$)      ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""      *Char + InactiveZoneLen * SizeOf(Character)      Continue    EndIf    ;    ; Extract candidate token using the shared ExtractOrSkipNextToken() helper    *TokenStart = *Char    TokenLCase$ = ExtractOrSkipNextToken(*StringStart, @*Char)    ;    If TokenLCase$ <> ""      ; Skip hexadecimal literals ($00FF...)      If PeekC(*TokenStart) = '$'        ActiveModulePrefix$   = ""        NextTokenExpectedType = 0        Continue      EndIf      ;      ; Expand anonymous enumeration names ("UnNamed - File.pb/Line X") into a single token      If TokenLCase$ = "unnamed" And PeekS(*Char, 3) = " - "        While *Char\c <> 0 And *Char\c <> #CR And *Char\c <> ')' And *Char\c <> ',' And *Char\c <> Asc(#SpecialPoint$)          GoNextChar(*Char)        Wend        TokenLCase$ = PeekS(*TokenStart, ComputeLenFromChars(*TokenStart, *Char))      EndIf      ;      TokenStartOffset = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *TokenStart)      TokenEndOffset   = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char)      ;      If *TokenStart > *StringStart        PrevChar = PeekC(*TokenStart - SizeOf(Character))      Else        PrevChar = 0      EndIf      ;      ; Absorb empty parameter parentheses if present and detect whether '(' follows the token      ; (or follows its '.Type' suffix, e.g. 'PBB_ModuleUsageEvents.PBB_ModuleUsageEvent()')      HasParen = #False      If PrevChar <> '.'        If *Char\c = '(' And PeekC(*Char + SizeOf(Character)) = ')'          *Char + 2 * SizeOf(Character)          TokenEndOffset = ComputeLenFromChars(*StringStart, *Char)          HasParen       = #True        ElseIf CheckForParenthesis(@*Char)          HasParen       = #True        ElseIf *Char\c = '.'          *LookAhead = *Char + SizeOf(Character)          SkipSpaces(*LookAhead)          While IsPBSeparator(*LookAhead\c) = #False : GoNextChar(*LookAhead) : Wend          If CheckForParenthesis(@*LookAhead)            HasParen = #True          EndIf        EndIf      EndIf      ;      ; Track active 'With ... EndWith' target expression inside the code body of #DetailPBBPanel      If PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel And *TokenStart >= *IntroLimit        If TokenLCase$ = "with"          DetailWithVar$ = ExtractWithTarget(*Char)        ElseIf TokenLCase$ = "endwith"          DetailWithVar$ = ""        EndIf      EndIf      ;      ; -------------------------------------------------------------------      ; A. FOUND IN FILES ACTION QUALIFIERS & CONTAINER HEADER ("In ...")      ; -------------------------------------------------------------------      If PanelID = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel        IAQ = 0        If TokenLCase$ = "set" Or TokenLCase$ = "read" Or TokenLCase$ = "param" Or           TokenLCase$ = "return" Or Left(TokenLCase$, 4) = "poke" Or TokenLCase$ = "clear" Or TokenLCase$ = "freememory"          IAQ = 1        ElseIf Left(TokenLCase$, 4) = "peek" Or TokenLCase$ = "test"          IAQ = 2        EndIf        ;        If IAQ          *LookAhead = *Char          SkipSpaces(*LookAhead)          If *LookAhead\c = Asc(#ThisPlaceChar$) Or *LookAhead\c = '&'            If IAQ = 1              TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(PBBSetValueColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)            EndIf            ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""            Continue          EndIf        EndIf        ;        If TokenLCase$ = "in" And *Char\c = #NonBreakableSpace          IsContainerCandidate   = #True          ContainerStartOffset   = TokenStartOffset          TypeKeywordStartOffset = 0          ActiveModulePrefix$    = ""          Continue        EndIf      EndIf      ;      ; -------------------------------------------------------------------      ; B. PROJECT ELEMENT RESOLUTION & STYLING      ; -------------------------------------------------------------------      ExpectedType = NextTokenExpectedType      NextTokenExpectedType = 0      If *Char\c = ':' And PeekC(*Char + SizeOf(Character)) = ':'        ExpectedType = #PBBModule      ElseIf PrevChar = '.'        ExpectedType = #PBBStructure      ElseIf PrevChar = '\'        ExpectedType = #PBBField      ElseIf PrevChar = '?' Or (*TokenStart = *LineStart And IsStandaloneLabel(TokenLCase$, *Char))        ExpectedType = #PBBLabel      EndIf      ;      If PrevChar = '=' Or PrevChar = ' '        VarSide$ = "rhs"      Else        VarSide$ = "lhs"      EndIf      ;      If PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel        If *TokenStart >= *IntroLimit And DetailFileLinePos > 0          PosInFile = DetailFileLinePos + (TokenStartOffset - DetailGadgetLineOffset)        Else          PosInFile = 0        EndIf        TokenColor = ResolveDetailPanelToken(TokenLCase$, HasParen, TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset,                                             *TokenStart, *LineStart, PosInFile, ExpectedType,                                             ActiveModulePrefix$, VarSide$, DetailWithVar$,                                             IntroLineMode, DontUnderline$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor)      Else        TokenColor = ResolveProjectTokenColor(TokenLCase$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor,                                              ExpectedType, ActiveModulePrefix$, VarSide$, "", #False,                                              Bool(HasParen))      EndIf      ;      If ExpectedType = #PBBModule        ActiveModulePrefix$ = TokenLCase$      Else        ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""      EndIf      ;      If TokenColor <> -1        ApplyResolvedTokenStyle        Continue      EndIf      ;      ; -------------------------------------------------------------------      ; C. PUREBASIC KEYWORDS, NATIVE FUNCTIONS & CONSTANTS      ; -------------------------------------------------------------------      If FindMapElement(PBBasicKeywordMap(), TokenLCase$)        If TokenLCase$ = "goto" Or TokenLCase$ = "gosub" Or TokenLCase$ = "restore"          NextTokenExpectedType = #PBBLabel        ElseIf TokenLCase$ = "import" Or TokenLCase$ = "importc"          NextTokenExpectedType = #PBBImport        ElseIf TokenLCase$ = "enumeration" Or TokenLCase$ = "enumerationbinary"          NextTokenExpectedType = #PBBEnumeration        ElseIf TokenLCase$ = "usemodule" Or TokenLCase$ = "unusemodule"          NextTokenExpectedType = #PBBModule        EndIf        If IsContainerCandidate          If TokenLCase$ = "declaremodule"            ContainerElementType = #PBBModule          Else            For ct = #PBBProcedure To (#EndEnumPBBTypes - 1)              If LCase(PBBTypeNames$(ct)) = TokenLCase$                ContainerElementType = ct                Break              EndIf            Next          EndIf          TypeKeywordStartOffset = TokenStartOffset          TypeKeywordEndOffset   = TokenEndOffset        EndIf        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold,ForeColor(" + Str(BasicKeywordColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)        Continue      EndIf      ;      If PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel And *TokenStart >= *IntroLimit        If FindMapElement(PBNativeFunctions(), TokenLCase$)          TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(PureKeywordColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)          Continue        ElseIf PeekC(*TokenStart) = '#'          TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(ConstantColor) + ")", TokenStartOffset, TokenEndOffset)          Continue        EndIf      EndIf    Else      ActiveModulePrefix$ = ""      GoNextChar(*Char)    EndIf  Wend  ;  CompilerIf #PBBReport    OPDTokenLine$ = SavedOPDTokenLine$  CompilerEndIf  ;  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  ; 2. POST-PARSING PASS: CUSTOM UI LINKS & PROJECT FILE NAMES  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  If PanelID = #DetailPBBPanel And EndIntroPos > 0    SearchLimit = EndIntroPos  Else    SearchLimit = Len(*REContent\s)  EndIf  If posdep <= SearchLimit    HighlightLinksAndFilesInRE(NoREGadget, NormalTextColor, *REContent, posdep, SearchLimit, #True)  EndIf  ;  TOM_UnFreeze(NoREGadget)  ProcedureReturn 0EndProcedure;Global Dim ListUnusedOnly.b(#EndEnumPBBElementTypes - 1)Global NewMap VarPanelExpanded.b();Procedure ColorizeListREContent(NoREGadget, TypeOfElement)  ;  ; Role: Line-by-line syntax highlighter and link formatter dedicated to element list panels (#ListPBBPanel).  ; Styles the Line-1 'All / Unused' filter bar, underlines collapsible '►'/'▼' Species and SubSpecies headers  ; in the Variables panel, and colors each listed element (and custom '.Struct' suffixes) by usage state.  ;  Protected REContent$, Line$, ModName$, LineElement$, Purified$, ActiveVarSpecies$, ActiveVarSubSpecies$, StructMod$, StructToken$  Protected LineLen, TotalLen, LineStartPos = 1, CRPos, BulletPos, UnusedOffset  Protected ColonPos, HighlightLen, ElemStartOffset, TokenColor, ModColor, MatchedVarID, DotPos, StructLen, StructColor  Protected NormalTextColor       = GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("NormalTextColor")  Protected TitleColor            = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBTitleColor")  Protected DetailsColor          = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBElementDetailsColor")  Protected PBBUnusedElementColor = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBUnusedElementColor")  Protected BulletSep$            = "  " + LCase(GetPBBStringParameter("PBB_Bullet")) + "  "  ;  REContent$ = LCase(ReplaceString(TOM_GetText(NoREGadget, "", 0, #EndOfText), #LF$, "") + #CR$)  TotalLen   = Len(REContent$)  If TotalLen <= 1 : ProcedureReturn : EndIf  ;  TOM_Freeze(NoREGadget)  ;  ; 1. Style the Line-1 'All (N)  •  Unused (M)' filter bar across all element list panels  CRPos = FindString(REContent$, #CR$, 1)  If CRPos > 1    Line$     = FastLeft(REContent$, CRPos - 1)    BulletPos = FindString(Line$, BulletSep$)    If BulletPos > 1      UnusedOffset = BulletPos + Len(BulletSep$) - 1      If ListUnusedOnly(TypeOfElement)        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(NormalTextColor) + ")", 0, BulletPos - 1)        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold,ForeColor(" + Str(TitleColor) + ")", UnusedOffset, CRPos - 1)      Else        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold,ForeColor(" + Str(TitleColor) + ")", 0, BulletPos - 1)        If Right(Line$, 3) = "(0)"          TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(PBBUnusedElementColor) + ")", UnusedOffset, CRPos - 1)        Else          TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(NormalTextColor) + ")", UnusedOffset, CRPos - 1)        EndIf      EndIf      LineStartPos = CRPos + 1    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ; 2. Style collapsible headers (in Variables) and individual element entries  While LineStartPos <= TotalLen    CRPos = FindString(REContent$, #CR$, LineStartPos)    If CRPos = 0 : Break : EndIf    LineLen = CRPos - LineStartPos    ;    If LineLen > 0      Line$ = FastMid(REContent$, LineStartPos, LineLen)      ;      If TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable And (Left(Line$, 1) = #PBBFoldClosed$ Or Left(Line$, 1) = #PBBFoldOpen$)        ; Unindented collapsible variable Species header (e.g., "▼ Global (64)")        ActiveVarSpecies$ = StringField(Mid(Line$, 3), 1, " ")        DotPos            = FindString(Line$, " (")        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold,Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(NormalTextColor) + ")", LineStartPos - 1, LineStartPos + DotPos - 2)        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(DetailsColor) + ")", LineStartPos + DotPos - 2, CRPos - 1)        ;      ElseIf TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable And (Left(Line$, 3) = "  " + #PBBFoldClosed$ Or Left(Line$, 3) = "  " + #PBBFoldOpen$)        ; Indented collapsible variable SubSpecies header (e.g., "  ▼ List (5)")        ActiveVarSubSpecies$ = StringField(Mid(Line$, 5), 1, " ")        DotPos               = FindString(Line$, " (")        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Bold,Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(NormalTextColor) + ")", LineStartPos + 1, LineStartPos + DotPos - 2)        TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(DetailsColor) + ")", LineStartPos + DotPos - 2, CRPos - 1)        ;      Else        ; Standard element line: skip leading indentation spaces        ElemStartOffset = LineStartPos - 1        While Left(Line$, 1) = " "          Line$ = Mid(Line$, 2)          ElemStartOffset + 1        Wend        ;        If Line$ <> ""          ; Highlight optional 'ModuleName::' prefix separately before the element name          ColonPos = FindString(Line$, "::")          If ColonPos > 0            ModName$ = Left(Line$, ColonPos - 1)            ModColor = ResolveProjectTokenColor(ModName$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor, #PBBModule)            If ModColor <> -1              TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(ModColor) + ")", ElemStartOffset, ElemStartOffset + ColonPos - 1)            EndIf            ElemStartOffset + ColonPos + 1            LineElement$ = Mid(Line$, ColonPos + 2)          Else            ModName$     = ""            LineElement$ = Line$          EndIf          ;          Purified$    = PurifyElementName(LineElement$)          HighlightLen = Len(Purified$)          If Mid(LineElement$, HighlightLen + 1, 2) = "()"            HighlightLen + 2          EndIf          ;          TokenColor = ResolveProjectTokenColor(Purified$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor,                                                TypeOfElement, ModName$, ActiveVarSpecies$, ActiveVarSubSpecies$,                                                #False, -1, @MatchedVarID)          If TokenColor <> -1 And HighlightLen > 0            TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(TokenColor) + ")", ElemStartOffset, ElemStartOffset + HighlightLen)          EndIf          ;          ; In the Variables panel, underline and colorize any custom '.Structure' / '.Interface' suffix          If TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable            DotPos = FindString(LineElement$, ".")            If DotPos > 0              StructToken$ = StringField(Mid(LineElement$, DotPos + 1), 1, "(")              StructLen    = Len(StructToken$)              If StructLen > 0 And FindMapElement(PBBasicNativeTypes(), StructToken$) = 0                StructMod$ = ModName$                If MatchedVarID > 0 And SelectPBBElement(MatchedVarID) And FindString(ElementList()\VarDotType_LCase, "::")                  StructMod$ = StringField(ElementList()\VarDotType_LCase, 1, ":")                EndIf                StructColor = ResolveProjectTokenColor(StructToken$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor, #PBBStructure, StructMod$)                If StructColor = -1 And StructMod$ <> ""                  StructColor = ResolveProjectTokenColor(StructToken$, NormalTextColor, PBBUnusedElementColor, #PBBStructure)                EndIf                If StructColor <> -1                  TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(StructColor) + ")",                                    ElemStartOffset + DotPos, ElemStartOffset + DotPos + StructLen)                EndIf              EndIf            EndIf          EndIf        EndIf      EndIf    EndIf    ;    LineStartPos = CRPos + 1  Wend  ;  TOM_UnFreeze(NoREGadget)EndProcedure;; **********************************************************************************;;-                           Panel content population;; **********************************************************************************;; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;                              ---- Files panel ----; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;Procedure.s ProcessFileListing(List TargetList.FileListingStruct(), IsBinaryFile = #False)  ;  ; Role: Iterates through the provided list (source or binary) and constructs  ; the formatted string block for the UI.  ;  Shared PBB_FileListing()  ;  Protected Result$, ContainerFile$, ParentFilePath$, NoLine$, IncludedBy$  Protected PosInParent  ;  If ListSize(TargetList()) > 0    IncludedBy$ = ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("includedBy"), " ", #NonBreakableSpace$) + #NonBreakableSpace$    ForEach TargetList()      ParentFilePath$ = TargetList()\ParentFileName      ContainerFile$  = GetFilePart(ParentFilePath$)      PosInParent     = TargetList()\PosInParent      ;      If ContainerFile$ = ""        ContainerFile$ = "(" + GetTextFromCatalogPB("mainFile") + ")"      ElseIf PosInParent = -1        If IsBinaryFile          If LCase(GetExtensionPart(ContainerFile$)) = "pbp" : Continue : EndIf          ContainerFile$ + #NonBreakableSpace$ + "(" + GetTextFromCatalogPB("project") + ")."        Else          ContainerFile$ = IncludedBy$ + ContainerFile$ + #NonBreakableSpace$ + "(" + GetTextFromCatalogPB("project") + ")"        EndIf      ElseIf PosInParent > 0        NoLine$ = "?"        PushListPosition(PBB_FileListing())        If IsFileInMemory(ParentFilePath$) And PBB_FileListing()\FileContentInList          NoLine$ = Str(GetNoLineFromStrAndPos(PBB_FileListing()\FileContentInList, PosInParent))        EndIf        PopListPosition(PBB_FileListing())        ContainerFile$ = IncludedBy$ + ContainerFile$ + "," + #NonBreakableSpace$ +                         ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("AtLine"), " ", #NonBreakableSpace$) +                         #NonBreakableSpace$ + NoLine$ + "."      EndIf      ;      If TargetList()\ExcludedByCompilerIf        ContainerFile$ + #NonBreakableSpace$ + ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("inactiveCompilerZone"), " ", #NonBreakableSpace$)      EndIf      Result$ + GetFilePart(TargetList()\FileName$) + " " + ContainerFile$ + #CR$    Next  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn Result$EndProcedure;Procedure   FillFileREGadget()  ;  ; Role: Populates the project files RichEdit gadget with the formatted list of source files  ; and binary assets registered in 'PBB_FileListing()' and 'PBB_BinaryFileListing()'.  ;  Shared PBB_FileListing(), PBB_BinaryFileListing()  ;  Protected Result$, Result2$, FileREGadget  Protected Intro$, Intro2$, posbin  ;  Result$ = ProcessFileListing(PBB_FileListing(), #False)  If Result$    Intro$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("IncludedFilesIntro")    Result$ = Intro$ + #CR$ + Result$  EndIf  ;  Result2$ = ProcessFileListing(PBB_BinaryFileListing(), #True)  If Result2$    posbin = Len(Result$) + 1    Intro2$ = #CR$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("IncludedBinaries")    Result$ + Intro2$ + #CR$ + Result2$  EndIf  ;  FileREGadget = NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(#FilePBBPanel)  ;  PBBResetContentAndStyles(FileREGadget)  ;  TOM_InsertText(FileREGadget, Result$, #EndOfText)  ;  TOM_SetFontStyles(FileREGadget, "Bold, ForeColor(" + GetPBBStringParameter("PBBTitleColor") + ")", 0, Len(Intro$))  TOM_SetParaStyles(FileREGadget, "SpaceAfter(10)", 0, Len(Intro$))  ;  If posbin    TOM_SetFontStyles(FileREGadget, "Bold, ForeColor(" + GetPBBStringParameter("PBBTitleColor") + ")", posbin, posbin + Len(Intro2$))    TOM_SetParaStyles(FileREGadget, "SpaceAfter(10)", posbin, posbin + Len(Intro2$))  EndIf  ;  HighlightLinksAndFilesInRE(FileREGadget, GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("NormalTextColor"), 0, 1, 0, #False)  PBB_SuspendRedraw(FileREGadget, #False)  ReSizeREMenu()  ;EndProcedure;; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;                          ---- Element lists panels ----; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;Procedure   FillElementREGadget(TypeOfElement)  ;  ; Role: Populates the target element list RichEdit gadget with a clickable 'All / Unused' filter bar  ;       and sorted elements (grouped by logical scope order with collapsible Species and SubSpecies  ;       headers and item counts when TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable).  ;  Protected TotalAll, TotalUnused, tnl, PosInElementList, NoREGadget, TOE, Pos, SpCollapsed, SubCollapsed  Protected Result$, EName$, MSpecies$, MSubSpecies$, Species$, SubSpecies$, SpRank$, SubKey$, Chevron$  Protected scrollPos.POINT  Protected NewMap SectionCounts.i()  ;  If ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Completed    For TOE = 0 To (#EndEnumPBBPanels - 1)      If TypeElementOfPBBPanel(TOE) = TypeOfElement        NoREGadget = NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(TOE)        Break      EndIf    Next    ;    If NoREGadget = 0      AlertInPBBWindow(GetTextFromCatalogPB("UnfoundGadgetNumber") + PBBTypeNames$(TypeOfElement))      ProcedureReturn    EndIf    SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #EM_GETSCROLLPOS, 0, @scrollPos)    ;    ForEach ElementList()      If ElementList()\Type = TypeOfElement And ElementList()\StartingPos > 0        TotalAll + 1        If ElementList()\Used = #False : TotalUnused + 1 : EndIf      EndIf    Next    ;    If TotalUnused = 0      ListUnusedOnly(TypeOfElement) = #False    EndIf    If ListUnusedOnly(TypeOfElement)      tnl = TotalUnused    Else      tnl = TotalAll    EndIf    ;    If tnl      Protected Dim pLine$(tnl)      ForEach ElementList()        If ElementList()\Type = TypeOfElement And ElementList()\StartingPos > 0 And           (ListUnusedOnly(TypeOfElement) = #False Or ElementList()\Used = #False)          PosInElementList + 1          EName$ = QualifyWithModule(GetEnclosingModuleName(), ElementList()\Name)          If TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable            ; Prefix 1..6 to sort Species in logical scope order (Global, Threaded, Shared, Define, Static, Protected)            SpRank$ = Str(1 + FindString("Global   Threaded Shared   Define   Static   Protected", LSet(ElementList()\VariableSpecie, 9)) / 9)            pLine$(PosInElementList) = SpRank$ + ElementList()\VariableSpecie + " " + ElementList()\VariableSubSpecie + " " + EName$            SectionCounts(LCase(ElementList()\VariableSpecie)) + 1            SectionCounts(LCase(ElementList()\VariableSpecie + "/" + ElementList()\VariableSubSpecie)) + 1          ElseIf TypeOfElement = #PBBLabel            pLine$(PosInElementList) = EName$ + ":"          Else            pLine$(PosInElementList) = EName$          EndIf        EndIf      Next      ;      SortArray(pLine$(), #PB_Sort_NoCase)      Result$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("All") + " (" + Str(TotalAll) + ")  " +                GetPBBStringParameter("PBB_Bullet") + "  " +                GetTextFromCatalogPB("Unused") + " (" + Str(TotalUnused) + ")" + #CR$ + #CR$      ;      For Pos = 1 To tnl        If TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable          Species$    = Mid(StringField(pLine$(Pos), 1, " "), 2)          SubSpecies$ = StringField(pLine$(Pos), 2, " ")          If Species$ <> MSpecies$            If MSpecies$ <> "" And SpCollapsed = #False : Result$ + #CR$ : EndIf            MSpecies$    = Species$            MSubSpecies$ = ""            SpCollapsed  = Bool(FindMapElement(VarPanelExpanded(), LCase(Species$)) = 0 Or VarPanelExpanded() = #False)            If SpCollapsed : Chevron$ = #PBBFoldClosed$ : Else : Chevron$ = #PBBFoldOpen$ : EndIf            Result$ + Chevron$ + " " + Species$ + " (" + Str(SectionCounts(LCase(Species$))) + ")" + #CR$          EndIf          If SpCollapsed : Continue : EndIf          ;          If SubSpecies$ <> MSubSpecies$            If MSubSpecies$ <> "" And SubCollapsed = #False : Result$ + #CR$ : EndIf            MSubSpecies$ = SubSpecies$            SubKey$      = LCase(Species$ + "/" + SubSpecies$)            SubCollapsed = Bool(FindMapElement(VarPanelExpanded(), SubKey$) = 0 Or VarPanelExpanded() = #False)            If SubCollapsed : Chevron$ = #PBBFoldClosed$ : Else : Chevron$ = #PBBFoldOpen$ : EndIf            Result$ + "  " + Chevron$ + " " + SubSpecies$ + " (" + Str(SectionCounts(SubKey$)) + ")" + #CR$          EndIf          If SubCollapsed : Continue : EndIf          ;          Result$ + "    " + StringField(pLine$(Pos), 3, " ") + #CR$        Else          Result$ + pLine$(Pos) + #CR$        EndIf      Next      Result$ = RTrim(Result$, #CR$)      ;      PBBResetContentAndStyles(NoREGadget)      TOM_InsertText(NoREGadget, Result$, #EndOfText)      ColorizeListREContent(NoREGadget, TypeOfElement)      ;      If scrollPos\y < 0 : scrollPos\y = 0 : EndIf      SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #EM_SETSCROLLPOS, 0, @scrollPos)      PBB_SuspendRedraw(NoREGadget, #False)    Else      SetGadgetText(NoREGadget, GetTextFromCatalogPB("NoElementFound"))      TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("NormalTextColor")) + ")", 0, #EndOfText)    EndIf    ;    ListCompletion(TypeOfElement) = #ListCompletion_Printed    ReSizeREMenu()  EndIfEndProcedure;; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;                             ---- Details panel ----; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;Procedure.s FillDetail_PrintSingleDefinition(Filename$, StartingPos, DirectContainer,                                           SharedDotType$ = "", IntroName$ = "definedIn")  ;  ; Role: Formats a single definition location record (file, container procedure, and line number).  ;  Protected Result$, DProc$, NoLine  Protected PBB_Bullet$ = GetPBBStringParameter("PBB_Bullet") + #NonBreakableSpace$  ;  If SharedDotType$    Result$ + PBB_Bullet$ + "Shared " + GetTextFromCatalogPB("in") + " "  ElseIf IntroName$ = "UseModule" Or IntroName$ = "UnuseModule"    Result$ + PBB_Bullet$ + IntroName$ + " " + GetTextFromCatalogPB("in") + " "  Else    Result$ + PBB_Bullet$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB(IntroName$) + " "  EndIf  ;  DProc$ = ""  If DirectContainer <> -1 And SelectPBBElement(DirectContainer)    DProc$ = " (" + ElementList()\Name + ")"  EndIf  ;  NoLine = GetNoLineFromFilenameAndPos(Filename$, StartingPos)  ;  Result$ + GetFilePart(Filename$) + DProc$ + ", " +            GetTextFromCatalogPB("AtLine") + " " +            Str(NoLine) + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$  ;  ProcedureReturn Result$  ;EndProcedure;Procedure.s FillDetail_PrintMultipleDefinitions(Continued$, IntroName$ = "definedIn")  ;  ; Role: Formats multiple definition locations from a serialized continuation string.  ;  Protected Result$  Protected NewList CEDList.CED_Structure()  ;  If Continued$    CED_StringToList(Continued$, CEDList())    ForEach CEDList()      Result$ + FillDetail_PrintSingleDefinition(CEDList()\Filename, CEDList()\StartingPos,                                                CEDList()\DirectContainer, CEDList()\SharedDotType, IntroName$)    Next  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn Result$EndProcedure;Procedure.s FillDetail_GetCalledElementsList(UsageChildren$, TargetType)  ;  ; Role: Reconstructs on the fly a comma-separated list of all child elements matching 'TargetType'  ; (#PBBProcedure or #PBBMacro, including recursive self-calls) referenced in 'UsageChildren$'  ; in O(1) via ElementFixedIndexes() without moving ElementList().  ;  Protected Result$, ChildIDStr$  Protected ChildIndex = 1  Protected *Elem.Elements  ;  If UsageChildren$ <> ""    Repeat      ChildIndex + 1      ChildIDStr$ = StringField(UsageChildren$, ChildIndex, "/")      If ChildIDStr$ = "" : Break : EndIf      *Elem = ElementFixedIndexes(Val(ChildIDStr$))      If *Elem And *Elem\StartingPos > 0 And *Elem\Type = TargetType        AddStringElement(Result$, *Elem\Name, ", ")      EndIf    ForEver  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn Result$EndProcedure;Procedure   FillDetailREGadget(*LastSearch.SearchDetails)  ;  ; Role: Populates the detail RichEdit gadget with complete information regarding an element  ; (declaration, definition sites, usage references, local variables, called macros, and full code body),  ; applying appropriate syntax highlighting and styling, and records DetailPanelContext and DetailPanelLinks()  ; for ClickOverREGadget().  ;  Shared VList.VariableListings, ListOfMacro$  Shared PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()  ;  Protected REContentString.string  ;  Protected *CurrentElement.Elements ; Displayed element.  Protected ScopedDecl.CED_Structure ; Resolved declaration coordinates (isolated for non-Shared local variables).  Protected *CommentScan.Character  Protected OOE_UsagePos$, OOE_UsageExtract$, NoLine, TFilename$, PosInCode  Protected ElementTitle$, TargetComment$  ;  Protected EndIntroPos, posa, posb, LenButtonsIntro                               ; Positions in the text for coloring.  Protected *EContent.String, NEContent$  Protected CurrentDecal, ListDecal$, pEnd, pR, pRef, pRet, Decal, mDecal, nl      ; For managing indentations.  Protected UseByMention$                                                          ; For the "used by..." mention.  Protected scrollPos.POINT                                                        ; Scroll position before redisplaying the content.  ;  Protected EndDeclarPos, IParentPos, SubParentPos, pEqual, LenToDelete, mp, NoDetail = #True, IsScopedLocalVar, IsElementUsed  Protected IParent$, SubParent$, ParentsList$, UnusedCallers$, IsShared$, DeclareOrDefine$, Line$, ext$, Introtext$, PValue$  Protected ConcatContent.String, *AddContent.String  ;  Protected DetailREGadget = NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(#DetailPBBPanel)  ;  Protected SExpression$           = *LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$  Protected TypeOfElement          = *LastSearch\TypeOfElement  Protected PBBUnusedElementColor  = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBUnusedElementColor")  Protected PBBElementNameColor    = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBElementNameColor")  Protected PBBElementDetailsColor = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBElementDetailsColor")  Protected PBB_Bullet$            = GetPBBStringParameter("PBB_Bullet") + #NonBreakableSpace$  Protected NewList CEDList.CED_Structure()  Protected ResolvedString$ ; For macro AddUniqueListItem()  ;  ; =========================================================================  ; 1. INITIALIZATION, HISTORY BUTTONS & CONTEXT SETUP  ; =========================================================================  ClearStructure(@DetailPanelContext, DetailPanelContextStruct)  ClearList(DetailPanelLinks())  DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement     = TypeOfElement  DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID    = -1  DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID = -1  DetailPanelContext\ModuleName$       = *LastSearch\ModuleName$  ;  If TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure    SetGadgetColorEx(DetailREGadget, #PB_Gadget_BackColor, GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("ProcedureBackColor"))  Else    SetGadgetColorEx(DetailREGadget, #PB_Gadget_BackColor, GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("BackgroundColor"))  EndIf  ;  LenButtonsIntro = DrawSearchHistoryButtons(*LastSearch, DetailREGadget)  ;  If SExpression$    ;    If ExplorationState < #ExplorationState_Completed      OnePassSetElements(#FinishCompletionNow)    EndIf    ;    If (TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro) And       *LastSearch\SearchPurifiedOnly = #False And *LastSearch\DontCheckPosition = #False      ListVariables(SExpression$, VList, TypeOfElement, *LastSearch\ModuleName$)    EndIf    ;    If TypeOfElement > 0 And TypeOfElement < #EndEnumPBBTypes      ;      ; =====================================================================      ; 2. ELEMENT LOOKUP & INTRO HEADER GENERATION      ; =====================================================================      ; Resolve the target element via ResolveSearchDetailsElement() (in O(1) when FixedID is set):      If (TypeOfElement < #EndEnumPBBElementTypes Or TypeOfElement = #PBBField) And         ResolveSearchDetailsElement(*LastSearch)        ;{        *CurrentElement  = @ElementList()        OOE_UsagePos$    = *CurrentElement\OOE_UsagePos        IsScopedLocalVar = Bool(TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable And *CurrentElement\LocalVarContainer > 0 And                                *CurrentElement\VariableSpecie <> "Shared" And *LastSearch\DontCheckPosition = #False)        IsElementUsed    = ResolveLocalVarScope(*CurrentElement, *LastSearch, 0, @ScopedDecl)        If ScopedDecl\Filename = *CurrentElement\FileName And ScopedDecl\StartingPos = *CurrentElement\StartingPos          TargetComment$ = *CurrentElement\Comment        Else          *AddContent = GetPointedCodeFromFile(ScopedDecl\Filename)          If *AddContent And ScopedDecl\EndingPos < Len(*AddContent\s)            *CommentScan   = PosToChar(@*AddContent\s, ScopedDecl\EndingPos + 1)            TargetComment$ = GoToEOL_AndExtractComment(@*CommentScan)            If Trim(TargetComment$) = ";" : TargetComment$ = "" : EndIf          EndIf        EndIf        ;        DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID    = *CurrentElement\FixedID        DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID = *CurrentElement\EnclosingModuleID        ;        If DetailPanelContext\ModuleName$ = "" And TypeOfElement <> #PBBModule          DetailPanelContext\ModuleName$ = GetEnclosingModuleName(DetailPanelContext\EnclosingModuleID)        EndIf        ;        ; Build the main declaration title line        ElementTitle$       = ScopedDecl\Declaration        If (TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro) And FindString(ElementTitle$, "(")          ; Strip formal parameters from the title as the full signature is displayed in the code body below          ElementTitle$     = Trim(StringField(ElementTitle$, 1, "(")) + "()"        Else          If TypeOfElement = #PBBImported            ElementTitle$   = GetTextFromCatalogPB(PBBTypeNames$(TypeOfElement)) + ": " + ElementTitle$          ElseIf ElementTitle$ = *CurrentElement\Name Or ElementTitle$ = *CurrentElement\Name + ":" Or TypeOfElement = #PBBConstant Or TypeOfElement = #PBBField            ElementTitle$   = GetTextFromCatalogPB(PBBTypeNames$(TypeOfElement)) + " " + ElementTitle$          EndIf          ElementTitle$     = ReplaceString(ElementTitle$, "(", " (")        EndIf        While FindString(ElementTitle$, "  ")          ElementTitle$     = ReplaceString(ElementTitle$, "  ", " ")        Wend        ElementTitle$       = Trim(ElementTitle$)        ;        ; Append evaluated constant value and enclosing Enumeration name when displaying a constant        If TypeOfElement = #PBBConstant          If *CurrentElement\Value            pEqual = FindString(ElementTitle$, "=")            If pEqual = 0              ElementTitle$ + " = " + *CurrentElement\Value            Else              PValue$ = Trim(FastMid(ElementTitle$, pEqual + 1))              If *CurrentElement\Value = "UnResolved"                ElementTitle$ + " (" + *CurrentElement\Value + ")"              ElseIf PValue$ <> *CurrentElement\Value And (Val(PValue$) <> Val(*CurrentElement\Value) Or FindString(PValue$, "#"))                ElementTitle$ + " (=" + *CurrentElement\Value + ")"              EndIf            EndIf          EndIf          EndDeclarPos = Len(ElementTitle$)          ;          If *CurrentElement\LocalVarContainer > 0 And SelectPBBElement(*CurrentElement\LocalVarContainer)            ; Append the enclosing Enumeration name stored in LocalVarContainer            ElementTitle$ + " (" + PBBTypeNames$(#PBBEnumeration) + " " + ElementList()\Name + ")"          EndIf          ;        Else          EndDeclarPos = Len(ElementTitle$)        EndIf        ;        REContentString\s = ElementTitle$        ;        If TypeOfElement > #PBBInterface And TypeOfElement <> #PBBImport          AddStringElement(REContentString\s, TargetComment$, " ")        EndIf        ;        If Right(REContentString\s, 1) <> #CR$          REContentString\s + #CR$        EndIf        ;        ; Append declaration and definition file/line locations        If (TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or TypeOfElement = #PBBModule) And *CurrentElement\Continued          REContentString\s + FillDetail_PrintMultipleDefinitions(*CurrentElement\Continued, "declaredIn")        EndIf        ;        If *CurrentElement\VariableSpecie = "Shared" : IsShared$ = "Shared" : EndIf        If TypeOfElement = #PBBModule And *CurrentElement\IsDeclareModule          DeclareOrDefine$ = "declaredIn"        Else          DeclareOrDefine$ = "definedIn"        EndIf        REContentString\s + FillDetail_PrintSingleDefinition(ScopedDecl\Filename, ScopedDecl\StartingPos, ScopedDecl\DirectContainer, IsShared$, DeclareOrDefine$)        ;        If IsScopedLocalVar = #False And TypeOfElement <> #PBBProcedure And TypeOfElement <> #PBBModule And *CurrentElement\Continued          REContentString\s + FillDetail_PrintMultipleDefinitions(*CurrentElement\Continued, "definedIn")        EndIf        ;        If TypeOfElement = #PBBModule And *CurrentElement\HasUseModule          ; List all UseModule and UnuseModule occurrences targeting this module          If PBB_ModuleCacheState = 0            PopulateModuleCaches()          EndIf          ForEach PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()            If PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()\ModuleName$ = *CurrentElement\PurifiedName              If PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()\IsUnuse                REContentString\s + FillDetail_PrintSingleDefinition(PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()\FileName$, PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()\PosInCode, -1, "", "UnuseModule")              Else                REContentString\s + FillDetail_PrintSingleDefinition(PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()\FileName$, PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()\PosInCode, -1, "", "UseModule")              EndIf            EndIf          Next        EndIf        ;        ; Build the 'usedBy' caller list (or 'Unused' notice), isolating the active scope for local variables        If IsScopedLocalVar          If FindString(*CurrentElement\UsageParents, "/" + Str(ScopedDecl\DirectContainer) + "/")            ParentsList$ = "/" + Str(ScopedDecl\DirectContainer) + "/"          EndIf        Else          ParentsList$ = *CurrentElement\UsageParents        EndIf        If Trim(ParentsList$, "/") <> ""          IParentPos = 1 ; Skip the leading "/" so newly appended parent IDs are visited in the same pass          Repeat            IParentPos + 1            IParent$ = StringField(ParentsList$, IParentPos, "/")            If IParent$              If Val(IParent$) <> -1                If SelectPBBElement(Val(IParent$))                  If (ElementList()\Type = #PBBField Or ElementList()\Type = #PBBConstant Or ElementList()\Type = #PBBImported) And                     ElementList()\LocalVarContainer = *CurrentElement\FixedID                    ; Promote callers of child fields, constants, or imports into the local ParentsList$                    If OOE_UsagePos$ = "" And ElementList()\OOE_UsagePos <> ""                      OOE_UsagePos$ = ElementList()\OOE_UsagePos                    EndIf                    If ElementList()\UsageParents <> ""                      SubParentPos = 1                      Repeat                        SubParentPos + 1                        SubParent$ = StringField(ElementList()\UsageParents, SubParentPos, "/")                        If SubParent$ = "" : Break : EndIf                        If Val(SubParent$) <> *CurrentElement\FixedID                          ParentsList$ = AddIndexToList(Val(SubParent$), ParentsList$)                        EndIf                      ForEver                    EndIf                  ElseIf ElementList()\Used Or ExplorationState <> #ExplorationState_Completed                    UseByMention$ + ElementList()\Name + ", "                  Else                    UnusedCallers$ + ElementList()\Name + ", "                  EndIf                EndIf              Else                UseByMention$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB(#OutOfElementsName)                If OOE_UsagePos$                  OOE_UsageExtract$ = StringField(OOE_UsagePos$, 1, #CR$)                  If OOE_UsageExtract$                    TFilename$ = StringField(OOE_UsageExtract$, 1, ",")                    PosInCode  = Val(StringField(OOE_UsageExtract$, 2, ","))                    NoLine     = GetNoLineFromFilenameAndPos(TFilename$, PosInCode)                    UseByMention$ + " (" + GetFilePart(TFilename$) + ") " +                                    GetTextFromCatalogPB("AtLine") + " " + Str(NoLine)                  EndIf                EndIf                UseByMention$ + ", "              EndIf            EndIf          Until IParent$ = ""          ;          If Right(UseByMention$, 2) = ", "            UseByMention$ = FastLeft(UseByMention$, Len(UseByMention$) - 2)          EndIf          If Right(UnusedCallers$, 2) = ", "            UnusedCallers$ = FastLeft(UnusedCallers$, Len(UnusedCallers$) - 2)          EndIf        EndIf        ;        If UseByMention$          REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("usedBy") + ": " + UseByMention$ + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$          If UnusedCallers$            REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("citedInUnused") + ": " + UnusedCallers$ + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$          EndIf        ElseIf UnusedCallers$          REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("citedOnlyInUnused") + ": " + UnusedCallers$ + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$        ElseIf IsElementUsed = #False And ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Completed          REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("Unused") + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$        EndIf        ;        ; Append called procedures (merging UsageChildren and forward-referenced VList\CalledProcedures) and macros right after 'usedBy'        If TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro          ListOfMacro$ = FillDetail_GetCalledElementsList(*CurrentElement\UsageChildren, #PBBProcedure)          If VList\CalledProcedures <> ""            If ListOfMacro$ <> "" : ListOfMacro$ + ", " : EndIf            nl = 0            Repeat              nl + 1              ext$ = Trim(StringField(VList\CalledProcedures, nl, ","))              If ext$ = "" : Break : EndIf              AddUniqueListItem(ListOfMacro$, ext$)            ForEver            If Right(ListOfMacro$, 2) = ", "              ListOfMacro$ = FastLeft(ListOfMacro$, Len(ListOfMacro$) - 2)            EndIf          EndIf          If ListOfMacro$            REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("CalledProcedures") + " " + ListOfMacro$ + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$          EndIf          ListOfMacro$ = FillDetail_GetCalledElementsList(*CurrentElement\UsageChildren, #PBBMacro)          If ListOfMacro$            REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("CalledMacros") + " " + ListOfMacro$ + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$          EndIf        EndIf        ;        ; Append the local variable and missing element lines grouped together at the end of the intro header        If TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure And VList\Unused          REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + VList\Unused + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$        EndIf        If TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure And VList\Unprotected          REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + VList\Unprotected + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$        EndIf        If (TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro) And VList\MissingElements          REContentString\s + PBB_Bullet$ + VList\MissingElements + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$        EndIf        If (TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro) And VList\CompleteList          REContentString\s + GetTextFromCatalogPB("SeeVariablesList") + #SpecialPoint$ + #CR$        EndIf        ;        REContentString\s + #CR$        ;        ; Insert the intro header into the RichEdit gadget and record EndIntroPos        TOM_InsertText(DetailREGadget, ReplaceString(REContentString\s, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)        ;        TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$, LenButtonsIntro, #EndOfText)        TOM_SetParaStyles(DetailREGadget, "LeftIndent(40), FirstLineIndent(0)", LenButtonsIntro + 1, #EndOfText)        ;        EndIntroPos = TOM_GetRealPos(DetailREGadget, #EndOfText)        ;        ; Store physical context boundaries so Colorize_REContent() and ClickOverREGadget() can resolve code tokens        DetailPanelContext\FileName$          = ScopedDecl\Filename        DetailPanelContext\ElementStartingPos = ScopedDecl\StartingPos        DetailPanelContext\ElementEndingPos   = ScopedDecl\EndingPos        DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos        = EndIntroPos        ;        REContentString\s = LCase(Space(LenButtonsIntro) + REContentString\s)        EndDeclarPos + LenButtonsIntro        ;        ; Style, colorize, and immediately paint the intro header before extracting and coloring the code body:        If IsElementUsed          TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, "SetForeColor(" + Str(PBBElementNameColor) + ")", LenButtonsIntro, EndDeclarPos)        Else          TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, "SetForeColor(" + Str(PBBUnusedElementColor) + ")", LenButtonsIntro, EndDeclarPos)        EndIf        TOM_SetParaStyles(DetailREGadget, "LeftIndent(40), FirstLineIndent(-40)", 0, EndDeclarPos)        ;        posa = FindInPBPointedCode(REContentString, *CurrentElement\PurifiedName) - 1        posb = FindString(REContentString\s, ".", posa)        If posb = 0 Or posb > posa + Len(*CurrentElement\PurifiedName)          posb = posa + Len(*CurrentElement\PurifiedName)        EndIf        If posa          TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, "Bold", posa, posb)        EndIf        ;        TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, "SetForeColor(" + Str(PBBElementDetailsColor) + ")", EndDeclarPos, EndIntroPos)        posa = FindString(REContentString\s, #CR$)        TOM_SetParaStyles(DetailREGadget, "LeftIndent(40)", posa, EndIntroPos)        ;        Colorize_REContent(DetailREGadget, #DetailPBBPanel, LenButtonsIntro + 1, EndIntroPos,                           PBBElementNameColor, REContentString, *CurrentElement\PurifiedName)        ;        If ListIndex(ListOfSearches()) < 0 Or ListOfSearches()\Search_DetailScrollPos\y = 0          PBB_SuspendRedraw(DetailREGadget, #False)          UpdateWindow_(GadgetID(DetailREGadget))          PBB_SuspendRedraw(DetailREGadget, #True)        EndIf        ;}        ;        ; =====================================================================        ; 3. CODE BODY EXTRACTION & INDENTATION NORMALIZATION        ; =====================================================================        ;{        NoDetail  = #False        *EContent = GetPointedElementContentFromFile(ScopedDecl\Filename, ScopedDecl\StartingPos, ScopedDecl\EndingPos, #False)        If (TypeOfElement = #PBBEnumeration Or TypeOfElement = #PBBImport) And *CurrentElement\Continued          ConcatContent\s = *EContent\s          CED_StringToList(*CurrentElement\Continued, CEDList())          ForEach CEDList()            *AddContent = GetPointedElementContentFromFile(CEDList()\Filename, CEDList()\StartingPos, CEDList()\EndingPos, #False)            ConcatContent\s + #CR$ + *AddContent\s          Next          *EContent = ConcatContent        EndIf        ;        If TypeOfElement <= #PBBModule Or TypeOfElement = #PBBImport          pEnd = ReverseFindString(*EContent\s, "End")        Else          pEnd = 0        EndIf        pRet = ReverseFindString(*EContent\s, #CR$, pEnd)        LenToDelete = pEnd - pRet - 1        ;        CurrentDecal = 0        ListDecal$ = ""        NEContent$ = ""        ;        If pEnd          pR = 0          pRef = 1          Repeat            PosInCode = pR + 1            If PosInCode < Len(*EContent\s)              pR = FindString(*EContent\s, #CR$, pR + 1)              If pR = 0 : pR = Len(*EContent\s) + 1 : EndIf              Decal = 0              While FastMid(*EContent\s, PosInCode, 1) = " " : PosInCode + 1 : Decal + 1 : Wend              Line$ = FastMid(*EContent\s, PosInCode, pR - PosInCode)              ;              If Decal >= LenToDelete                Decal - LenToDelete              EndIf              ;              Decal - CurrentDecal              CurrentDecal + Decal              If Decal                ListDecal$ + Str(pRef - 1) + #TAB$ + Str(Decal) + #TAB$              EndIf              pRef + (pR - PosInCode) + 1              NEContent$ + Line$ + #CR$            EndIf          Until PosInCode >= Len(*EContent\s)          ListDecal$ + Str(pRef - 1) + #TAB$ + Str(Decal) + #TAB$        EndIf        ;        REContentString\s + LCase(NEContent$)        ;}        ;        ; =====================================================================        ; 4. CODE INSERTION, PARAGRAPH INDENTATION & SYNTAX COLORIZATION        ; =====================================================================        ;{        If NEContent$ <> ""          TOM_InsertText(DetailREGadget, ReplaceString(#CR$ + NEContent$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)          ;          TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, PBBCodeFontStyle$, EndIntroPos, #EndOfText)          ;          TOM_SetParaStyles(DetailREGadget, "LeftIndent(5.5), FirstLineIndent(-5.5)", EndIntroPos + 1, #EndOfText)          ;          nl = 0          PosInCode = EndIntroPos + 1          Decal = 0          Repeat            nl + 1            ext$ = StringField(ListDecal$, nl, #TAB$)            If ext$              mp = PosInCode              PosInCode = Val(ext$) + EndIntroPos + 1              nl + 1              mDecal + Decal              Decal = Val(StringField(ListDecal$, nl, #TAB$))              TOM_SetParaStyles(DetailREGadget, "LeftIndent(" + Str(5.5 * (mDecal + 1)) + ")", mp, PosInCode - 1)            EndIf          Until ext$ = ""          ;          Colorize_REContent(DetailREGadget, #DetailPBBPanel, EndIntroPos + 1, EndIntroPos,                             PBBElementNameColor, REContentString, *CurrentElement\PurifiedName,                             Bool(ListIndex(ListOfSearches()) < 0 Or ListOfSearches()\Search_DetailScrollPos\y = 0))        EndIf        ;}      ElseIf TypeOfElement = #PBBNativeFunction Or TypeOfElement = #PBBBasicKeyword        ; =====================================================================        ; 5. NATIVE FUNCTIONS, BASIC KEYWORDS & "NO DETAIL" FALLBACK        ; =====================================================================        ;{        If TypeOfElement = #PBBNativeFunction          If FindMapElement(*PBNativeFunctions(), SExpression$) And *PBNativeFunctions()            ElementTitle$ = *PBNativeFunctions()\FunctionSignature            PValue$       = *PBNativeFunctions()\FunctionDescription          EndIf          If ElementTitle$ = ""            ElementTitle$ = *LastSearch\ElementName$            If FindString(ElementTitle$, "(") = 0              ElementTitle$ + "()"            EndIf          EndIf          ; Isolate the bare function name in the signature and build the 'Func()' label for the help line          posb = FindString(ElementTitle$, "(")          If posb > 1            EndDeclarPos = posb - 1            Line$        = Trim(Left(ElementTitle$, EndDeclarPos)) + "()"          Else            EndDeclarPos = Len(ElementTitle$)            Line$        = ElementTitle$ + "()"          EndIf          Introtext$ = ElementTitle$ + #CR$          If PValue$ <> ""            Introtext$ + PBB_Bullet$ + PValue$ + #CR$          EndIf          Introtext$ + #CR$          posa       = LenButtonsIntro + Len(Introtext$)          Introtext$ + Line$ + " " + GetTextFromCatalogPB("AboutNativeFunction")        Else          EndDeclarPos = Len(*LastSearch\ElementName$)          posa         = 0          Introtext$   = *LastSearch\ElementName$ + " " + GetTextFromCatalogPB("AboutBasicKeyword")        EndIf        ;        TOM_InsertText(DetailREGadget, ReplaceString(Introtext$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)        TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$, LenButtonsIntro, #EndOfText)        TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(PBBElementNameColor) + "), Underline(Single), Bold", LenButtonsIntro, LenButtonsIntro + EndDeclarPos)        AddDetailPanelLink(LenButtonsIntro, LenButtonsIntro + EndDeclarPos, 0, *LastSearch)        If posa > 0          TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(PBBElementNameColor) + "), Underline(Single), Bold", posa, posa + Len(Line$))          AddDetailPanelLink(posa, posa + Len(Line$), 0, *LastSearch)        EndIf        NoDetail  = #False        PosInCode = FindString(Introtext$, #CR$)        If PosInCode > 0 And PosInCode < Len(Introtext$)          TOM_SetParaStyles(DetailREGadget, "LeftIndent(40), FirstLineIndent(0), RightIndent(20)", LenButtonsIntro + PosInCode, #EndOfText)        EndIf        ;}      EndIf    EndIf  EndIf  ;  If NoDetail Or Len(GetGadgetText(DetailREGadget)) < 40    SExpression$ = *LastSearch\ElementName$    ;    If SExpression$      If (*LastSearch\SearchPurifiedOnly Or *LastSearch\DontCheckPosition) And *LastSearch\MultipleResults > 1        REContentString\s = ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("NoDetailChooseScope"), "%SExpression$%", "'" + SExpression$ + "'")        REContentString\s = ReplaceString(REContentString\s, "%LookUp%", GetTextFromCatalogPB("LookUp"))      Else        REContentString\s = ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("NoDetailFound"), "%SExpression$%", "'" + SExpression$ + "'")      EndIf      TOM_InsertText(DetailREGadget, ReplaceString(REContentString\s, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)      ;      PosInCode = FindString(REContentString\s, "'" + SExpression$ + "'")      If PosInCode        TOM_SetFontStyles(DetailREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(PBBElementNameColor) + "), Bold", LenButtonsIntro + PosInCode, LenButtonsIntro + PosInCode + Len(SExpression$))      EndIf    Else      REContentString\s = GetTextFromCatalogPB("NoDetailNoExpression")      TOM_InsertText(DetailREGadget, ReplaceString(REContentString\s, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)    EndIf    ;    PosInCode = FindString(REContentString\s, #CR$)    If PosInCode And PosInCode < Len(REContentString\s)      TOM_SetParaStyles(DetailREGadget, "LeftIndent(40), FirstLineIndent(0), RightIndent(20)", LenButtonsIntro + PosInCode + 1, #EndOfText)    EndIf    ;    If ListIndex(ListOfSearches()) >= 0      ListOfSearches()\Search_DetailScrollPos\x = 0      ListOfSearches()\Search_DetailScrollPos\y = 0    EndIf    ;  EndIf  ;  ; Restore saved scroll position only if a valid search history entry is selected  If ListIndex(ListOfSearches()) >= 0    scrollPos\x = ListOfSearches()\Search_DetailScrollPos\x    scrollPos\y = ListOfSearches()\Search_DetailScrollPos\y  EndIf  SendMessage_(GadgetID(DetailREGadget), #EM_SETSCROLLPOS, 0, @scrollPos)  ;  PBB_SuspendRedraw(DetailREGadget, #False)  ;  ReSizeREMenu()  ;EndProcedure;Procedure unusedproc()  Protected UseByMention$  UseByMention$ = "kk"EndProcedure;; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;                         ---- Found in files panel ----; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;Structure FoundInPanelState  SavedSearch.SearchDetails  REContentString.string  RemainingString$  scrollPos.POINT  EndTitleLinePos.i  FoundCount.i  IsHeaderDisplayed.i  IsSearchActive.i  NeedReset.i  LenButtonsIntro.iEndStructure;Global PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish;Procedure.s SetListFoundInFiles(*LastSearch.SearchDetails, *Status.Integer, Reset = 0, *FoundCount.Integer = 0)  ;  ; ROLE & ARCHITECTURAL OVERVIEW:  ; Incremental, time-sliced search engine traversing the project's chronological  ; compilation sequences via FindNextMatchInProject() to locate and format all  ; occurrences of a target expression within bounded 100 ms execution slices.  ;  Shared PBB_CompilationSequence()  ;  Static FIPS.FIPSPosStruct  Static IsSearchFinished.i  Static LastReportedFile$  Static NbrLimit  ;  Protected BatchListFoundInFiles$  Protected LayedOutDefinition.String  Protected StartTime, TimeLimit, FoundPos  ;  If *LastSearch = 0 Or *Status = 0 : ProcedureReturn "" : EndIf  ; Allow local snippet inspection even if no multi-file compilation project is loaded  If ListSize(PBB_CompilationSequence()) = 0 And (*LastSearch\ElementFile$ = "" Or *LastSearch\EndingContextLimit = 0)    *Status\i = #ExplorationState_Completed    ProcedureReturn ""  EndIf  ;  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  ; 1. STATE RESET  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  If Reset    NbrLimit          = 0    IsSearchFinished  = #False    LastReportedFile$ = ""  EndIf  ;  If IsSearchFinished    *Status\i = #ExplorationState_Completed    ProcedureReturn ""  EndIf  ;  BatchListFoundInFiles$ = ""  StartTime              = ElapsedMilliseconds()  TimeLimit              = StartTime + 100  ;  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  ; 2. INCREMENTAL SEARCH LOOP (100 ms Quota)  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  Repeat    FoundPos = FindNextMatchInProject(*LastSearch, @FIPS, Reset, @LayedOutDefinition, 0, TimeLimit)    Reset    = #False    ;    If FoundPos = 0      ; Traversal reached the absolute end of the compilation sequence      IsSearchFinished = #True      Break    ElseIf FoundPos = -1      ; 100 ms time slice expired while scanning candidate occurrences      Break    EndIf    ;    NbrLimit + 1    If NbrLimit > #PBB_MaxNbrOfFound      ; Flag the active search state so FillFoundInREGadget() appends the truncation notice      NbrLimit                    = #PBB_MaxNbrOfFound      *LastSearch\MultipleResults = #PBB_MaxNbrOfFound      IsSearchFinished            = #True      Break    EndIf    ;    ; Emit the file header only when a match in a new file has been validated    If FIPS\FileName$ <> LastReportedFile$      LastReportedFile$ = FIPS\FileName$      If Right(BatchListFoundInFiles$, 2) = ", "        BatchListFoundInFiles$ = FastLeft(BatchListFoundInFiles$, Len(BatchListFoundInFiles$) - 2)      EndIf      BatchListFoundInFiles$ + #CR$ + GetFilePart(FIPS\FileName$) + #NonBreakableSpace$    EndIf    BatchListFoundInFiles$ + LayedOutDefinition\s    ;  Until ElapsedMilliseconds() > TimeLimit  ;  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  ; 3. RETURN STATUS RESOLUTION  ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------  CompilerIf #PBBReport    If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming      OPDReport("IsSearchFinished = " + Str(IsSearchFinished) + " : " + Str(ElapsedMilliseconds() - StartTime))    EndIf  CompilerEndIf  ;  If *FoundCount    *FoundCount\i = NbrLimit  EndIf  ;  If IsSearchFinished = #False    *Status\i = #ExplorationState_Pending  Else    *Status\i = #ExplorationState_Completed  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn BatchListFoundInFiles$  ;EndProcedure;Procedure   FillFoundInREGadget(*LastSearch.SearchDetails, PriorityMode = #WorkInBackGround, Reset = #False)  ;  ; Role: Incremental, time-sliced population engine for the 'Found in...' RichEdit gadget.  ; Calls SetListFoundInFiles() in bounded slices and formats results into the gadget while  ; preserving all runtime metrics in a static FoundInPanelState structure across calls.  ;  ; Parameters:  ;   *LastSearch  - Target search criteria, or #Null to resume a pending time-sliced search  ;                  (when PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish = #True).  ;   PriorityMode - #WorkInBackGround yields control once the slice reaches 50 ms after  ;                  SetListFoundInFiles(); #FinishCompletionNow runs to completion in one call.  ;   Reset        - If #True, purges the internal static state and cancels any ongoing search.  ;  ; Output:  ;   Returns #False when execution pauses at the end of a time slice (caller must re-invoke),  ;   or #True when the search and UI formatting pipeline is fully completed.  ;  Static State.FoundInPanelState  Static UserHasScrolled.b  Static LastAppliedScrollPos.POINT  ;  Protected FoundInFilesREGadget = NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(#FoundInFilesPBBPanel)  Protected PBBElementNameColor = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBElementNameColor")  Protected PBB_Bullet$ = GetPBBStringParameter("PBB_Bullet") + #NonBreakableSpace$  Protected SliceStartTime = ElapsedMilliseconds()  Protected BatchListFoundInFiles$, PrintedExpression$, TargetScope$, LinkText$, ResultCountText$  Protected TitleStruct$, TitleStructMod$, ResolvedTitleStruct$  Protected PosInCode, mp, LastCRPos, StartPos, MovingPosStart, MovingPosEnd, SpeciesLen, Status, IsRefreshingSame  Protected TitleBoldEnd, TitleDotPos, TitleVarID, TitleColor, TitleStructColor = -1  Protected CurrentScrollPos.POINT  ;  If Reset    ; Invalidate active time-sliced search state when project files or AST caches are refreshed    ClearStructure(@State, FoundInPanelState)    PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish = #False    If *LastSearch = #Null      ProcedureReturn #True    EndIf  EndIf  ;  If *LastSearch = #Null And State\SavedSearch\ElementPurifiedName$ = ""    PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish = #False    ;    CompilerIf #PBBReport      If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming        OPDReport("FillFoundInREGadget aborts (empty parameters).")      EndIf    CompilerEndIf    ;    ProcedureReturn #True  EndIf  ;  If *LastSearch    If State\IsSearchActive = #False Or CompareStructure(*LastSearch, @State\SavedSearch, SearchDetails) = 0      ;      CompilerIf #PBBReport        If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming          OPDReport("************* FillFoundInREGadget ****************")          InitAllTimers()        EndIf      CompilerEndIf      ;      IsRefreshingSame = Bool(State\SavedSearch\ElementPurifiedName$ = *LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$)      ;      ClearStructure(@State, FoundInPanelState)      CopyStructure(*LastSearch, @State\SavedSearch, SearchDetails)      ;      State\IsSearchActive = #True      State\NeedReset      = #True      ;      State\LenButtonsIntro = DrawSearchHistoryButtons(*LastSearch, FoundInFilesREGadget)      ;      If *LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$        If IsRefreshingSame          SendMessage_(GadgetID(FoundInFilesREGadget), #EM_GETSCROLLPOS, 0, @State\scrollPos)        ElseIf ListIndex(ListOfSearches()) <> -1          State\scrollPos\x = ListOfSearches()\Search_FoundInScrollPos\x          State\scrollPos\y = ListOfSearches()\Search_FoundInScrollPos\y        Else          State\scrollPos\x = 0          State\scrollPos\y = 0        EndIf        ;        UserHasScrolled = #False        LastAppliedScrollPos\x = State\scrollPos\x        LastAppliedScrollPos\y = State\scrollPos\y      Else        TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("ShouldSearchForSomething"), #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)        PBB_SuspendRedraw(FoundInFilesREGadget, #False)        ReSizeREMenu()        State\IsSearchActive = #False        PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish = #False        ProcedureReturn #True      EndIf    EndIf  EndIf  ;  PBB_SuspendRedraw(FoundInFilesREGadget, #True)  ;  CompilerIf #PBBReport    If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming      StartTimer(10, "FillFoundInREGadget")    EndIf  CompilerEndIf  ;  Repeat    ;    CompilerIf #PBBReport      If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming        OPDReport("FillFoundInREGadget: starting SetListFoundInFiles.")        ReapTimer(10)        StartTimer(11, "SetListFoundInFiles")      EndIf    CompilerEndIf    ;    BatchListFoundInFiles$ = SetListFoundInFiles(State\SavedSearch, @Status, State\NeedReset, @State\FoundCount)    State\NeedReset = #False    ;    CompilerIf #PBBReport      If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming        OPDReport("FillFoundInREGadget: returned from SetListFoundInFiles.")        ReapTimer(11)        StartTimer(10)      EndIf    CompilerEndIf    ;    If BatchListFoundInFiles$ Or Status = #ExplorationState_Completed      ;      If State\IsHeaderDisplayed = #False        PrintedExpression$ = State\SavedSearch\ElementName$        AddStringElement(PrintedExpression$, ComputeExpressionDetails(State\SavedSearch), #SpecialSpace$)        PrintedExpression$ + #CR$        ;        TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(PrintedExpression$ + #CR$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)        State\REContentString\s = LCase(PrintedExpression$)        TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$, State\LenButtonsIntro, #EndOfText)        ;        State\REContentString\s = Space(State\LenButtonsIntro) + State\REContentString\s        State\EndTitleLinePos   = Len(State\REContentString\s) - 1        ;        MovingPosStart = State\LenButtonsIntro        MovingPosEnd   = MovingPosStart + Len(State\SavedSearch\ElementName$)        TitleBoldEnd     = MovingPosEnd        TitleDotPos      = FindString(State\SavedSearch\ElementName$, ".")        TitleStructColor = -1        If TitleDotPos > 1          TitleBoldEnd = MovingPosStart + TitleDotPos - 1        EndIf        If ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Completed          TitleVarID = ResolveSearchDetailsElement(@State\SavedSearch)          TitleColor = GetElementDisplayColor(TitleVarID, PBBElementNameColor, GetPBBNumParameter("PBBUnusedElementColor"),                                              Bool(TitleVarID > 0 And ResolveLocalVarScope(ElementFixedIndexes(TitleVarID), @State\SavedSearch) = #False))        Else          If State\SavedSearch\TypeOfElement < #EndEnumPBBElementTypes            TitleColor = ListOfAllElementsColor(State\SavedSearch\TypeOfElement)          Else            TitleColor = PBBElementNameColor          EndIf        EndIf        TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "Bold,ForeColor(" + Str(TitleColor) + ")", MovingPosStart, TitleBoldEnd)        If TitleDotPos > 1          TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(TitleColor) + ")", TitleBoldEnd, MovingPosEnd)          TitleStruct$ = LCase(StringField(Mid(State\SavedSearch\ElementName$, TitleDotPos + 1), 1, "("))          If TitleStruct$ <> "" And FindMapElement(PBBasicNativeTypes(), TitleStruct$) = 0            If ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Completed              TitleStructMod$ = LCase(State\SavedSearch\ModuleName$)              If TitleVarID > 0 And SelectPBBElement(TitleVarID) And FindString(ElementList()\VarDotType_LCase, "::")                TitleStructMod$ = StringField(ElementList()\VarDotType_LCase, 1, ":")              EndIf              TitleStructColor = ResolveProjectTokenColor(TitleStruct$, GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("NormalTextColor"),                                                          GetPBBNumParameter("PBBUnusedElementColor"), #PBBStructure, TitleStructMod$)              If TitleStructColor = -1 And TitleStructMod$ <> ""                TitleStructColor = ResolveProjectTokenColor(TitleStruct$, GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("NormalTextColor"),                                                            GetPBBNumParameter("PBBUnusedElementColor"), #PBBStructure)              EndIf            Else              ResolvedTitleStruct$ = ResolveStructureOrInterface(TitleStruct$, 0, 0, 0, #False, State\SavedSearch\ModuleName$,                                                                 State\SavedSearch\ElementFile$, State\SavedSearch\ElementPosition)              If Left(ResolvedTitleStruct$, Len(PBBTypeNames$(#PBBInterface))) = PBBTypeNames$(#PBBInterface)                TitleStructColor = ListOfAllElementsColor(#PBBInterface)              ElseIf ResolvedTitleStruct$ <> ""                TitleStructColor = ListOfAllElementsColor(#PBBStructure)              EndIf            EndIf            If TitleStructColor <> -1              TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "Underline(),ForeColor(" + Str(TitleStructColor) + ")",                                MovingPosStart + TitleDotPos, MovingPosStart + TitleDotPos + Len(TitleStruct$))            EndIf          EndIf        EndIf        MovingPosStart = MovingPosEnd + 1        ;        If State\SavedSearch\ElementSpecies$          MovingPosEnd + Len(State\SavedSearch\ElementSpecies$) + 1 + Len(State\SavedSearch\ElementSubSpecies$) + 1          TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("PureKeywordColor")) + ")",                            MovingPosStart, MovingPosEnd)          MovingPosStart = MovingPosEnd + 1        EndIf        ;        Colorize_REContent(FoundInFilesREGadget, #FoundInFilesPBBPanel,                           MovingPosStart, Len(State\REContentString\s) + 1,                           PBBElementNameColor, @State\REContentString, State\SavedSearch\ElementName$)        PrintedExpression$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("FoundListIntro") + #CR$        TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(PrintedExpression$ + #CR$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)        State\REContentString\s + PrintedExpression$        ;        PrintedExpression$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("MoreInfo") + #CR$        MovingPosStart = Len(State\REContentString\s)        State\REContentString\s + PrintedExpression$        MovingPosEnd = Len(State\REContentString\s) - 1        TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(PrintedExpression$ + #CR$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)        TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "Underline()", MovingPosStart, MovingPosEnd)        ;        PosInCode = FindString(State\REContentString\s, #CR$, 0)        TOM_SetParaStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "LeftIndent(40), FirstLineIndent(0)", PosInCode, #EndOfText)        ;        State\IsHeaderDisplayed = #True      EndIf      ;      If Right(State\RemainingString$, 2) = ", " And FastLeft(BatchListFoundInFiles$, 1) = #CR$        State\RemainingString$ = FastLeft(State\RemainingString$, Len(State\RemainingString$) - 2)      EndIf      If Status = #ExplorationState_Pending And FindString(BatchListFoundInFiles$, #CR$) = 0        State\RemainingString$ + BatchListFoundInFiles$        BatchListFoundInFiles$ = ""      Else        BatchListFoundInFiles$ = State\RemainingString$ + BatchListFoundInFiles$        State\RemainingString$ = ""        If Status = #ExplorationState_Pending          LastCRPos = ReverseFindString(BatchListFoundInFiles$, #CR$)          If (Len(BatchListFoundInFiles$) - LastCRPos) > 1            State\RemainingString$ = FastMid(BatchListFoundInFiles$, LastCRPos)            BatchListFoundInFiles$ = FastLeft(BatchListFoundInFiles$, LastCRPos - 1)          EndIf        EndIf        If Right(BatchListFoundInFiles$, 2) = ", "          BatchListFoundInFiles$ = FastLeft(BatchListFoundInFiles$, Len(BatchListFoundInFiles$) - 2)        EndIf      EndIf      ;      If BatchListFoundInFiles$        SendMessage_(GadgetID(FoundInFilesREGadget), #EM_GETSCROLLPOS, 0, @CurrentScrollPos)        If CurrentScrollPos\y <> LastAppliedScrollPos\y Or CurrentScrollPos\x <> LastAppliedScrollPos\x          UserHasScrolled = #True        EndIf        ;        StartPos = Len(State\REContentString\s) + 1        ;        TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(BatchListFoundInFiles$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)        ;        TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$, StartPos, #EndOfText)        ;        State\REContentString\s + LCase(BatchListFoundInFiles$)        ;        PosInCode = StartPos        Repeat          mp = PosInCode          While FastMid(State\REContentString\s, mp, 1) = #CR$ : mp + 1 : Wend          If mp <> PosInCode            TOM_SetParaStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "LeftIndent(0), FirstLineIndent(0)", mp, mp + 1)          EndIf          ;          PosInCode = FindString(State\REContentString\s, #CR$, mp)          If PosInCode = 0 : PosInCode = Len(State\REContentString\s) : EndIf          ;          If FastMid(State\REContentString\s, mp, 2) = PBB_Bullet$            TOM_SetParaStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "LeftIndent(10), FirstLineIndent(-5)", mp, PosInCode - 1)          EndIf        Until PosInCode = Len(State\REContentString\s)        ;        Colorize_REContent(FoundInFilesREGadget, #FoundInFilesPBBPanel, StartPos, 0, 0, @State\REContentString)        ;        SendMessage_(GadgetID(FoundInFilesREGadget), #EM_SETSCROLLPOS, 0, @CurrentScrollPos)        LastAppliedScrollPos\x = CurrentScrollPos\x        LastAppliedScrollPos\y = CurrentScrollPos\y      EndIf    EndIf    ;    If Status = #ExplorationState_Completed      ;      If State\IsHeaderDisplayed = #False        TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("ShouldSearchForSomething"), #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)      Else        If State\SavedSearch\OtherScopesCount > 0 And State\SavedSearch\SearchPurifiedOnly = #False          ; Build the target scope description (e.g., "Procedure ManagePBBBackgroundTasks()")          SpeciesLen = 0          If State\SavedSearch\DontCheckPosition = #False And State\SavedSearch\ParentTypeAndName$ <> ""            TargetScope$ = State\SavedSearch\ParentTypeAndName$            If State\SavedSearch\ModuleName$ <> ""              TargetScope$ + #Space$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("in") + #Space$ + PBBTypeNames$(#PBBModule) + #Space$ + State\SavedSearch\ModuleName$            EndIf          ElseIf State\SavedSearch\DontCheckPosition = #False And State\SavedSearch\ModuleName$ <> ""            TargetScope$ = PBBTypeNames$(#PBBModule) + #Space$ + State\SavedSearch\ModuleName$          Else            TargetScope$ = ComputeExpressionDetails(State\SavedSearch)            If State\SavedSearch\ElementSpecies$              SpeciesLen = Len(State\SavedSearch\ElementSpecies$) + 1 + Len(State\SavedSearch\ElementSubSpecies$)            EndIf          EndIf          If TargetScope$ = ""            TargetScope$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB(#OutOfElementsName)          EndIf          ;          ; 1. Insert and colorize the targeted scope notice          PrintedExpression$ = #CR$ + #CR$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("TargetedResultOn") + #Space$ + TargetScope$ + ". "          StartPos           = Len(State\REContentString\s) + 3 + Len(GetTextFromCatalogPB("TargetedResultOn")) + 1          MovingPosStart     = Len(State\REContentString\s) + 2          State\REContentString\s + LCase(PrintedExpression$)          TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(PrintedExpression$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)          TOM_SetParaStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "LeftIndent(0), FirstLineIndent(0)", MovingPosStart, #EndOfText)          TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$, MovingPosStart, #EndOfText)          ;          ; Colorize variable Species/SubSpecies (e.g., "Param Var") and advance StartPos past them          ; so "Var" is never mistaken for a project variable identifier by Colorize_REContent():          If SpeciesLen > 0            TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "ForeColor(" + Str(GetValueFromPB_PrefFile("PureKeywordColor")) + ")",                              StartPos - 1, StartPos - 1 + SpeciesLen)            StartPos + SpeciesLen + 1          EndIf          ;          Colorize_REContent(FoundInFilesREGadget, #FoundInFilesPBBPanel, StartPos, Len(State\REContentString\s),                             PBBElementNameColor, @State\REContentString, State\SavedSearch\ElementName$)          ;          ; 2. Insert and underline the interactive link ("See the other scope..." or "See the N other scopes...")          If State\SavedSearch\OtherScopesCount = 1            LinkText$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("SeeOneOtherScope")          Else            LinkText$ = ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("SeeOtherScopes"), "%1", Str(State\SavedSearch\OtherScopesCount))          EndIf          MovingPosStart = Len(State\REContentString\s)          State\REContentString\s + LinkText$ + #CR$          MovingPosEnd   = Len(State\REContentString\s) - 1          TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(LinkText$ + #CR$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)          TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "Underline()", MovingPosStart, MovingPosEnd)        EndIf        ;        If State\SavedSearch\MultipleResults >= #PBB_MaxNbrOfFound          ; Append a truncation notice when either candidate scopes or matched code occurrences reached #PBB_MaxNbrOfFound          PrintedExpression$ = #CR$          If State\SavedSearch\OtherScopesCount <= 0 Or State\SavedSearch\SearchPurifiedOnly            PrintedExpression$ + #CR$          EndIf          PrintedExpression$ + ReplaceString(GetTextFromCatalogPB("ResultsTruncated"), "%1", Str(#PBB_MaxNbrOfFound)) + #CR$          MovingPosStart = Len(State\REContentString\s) + 1          State\REContentString\s + LCase(PrintedExpression$)          TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ReplaceString(PrintedExpression$, #CR$, #CRLF$), #EndOfText)          TOM_SetParaStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, "LeftIndent(0), FirstLineIndent(0)", MovingPosStart, #EndOfText)          TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$, MovingPosStart, #EndOfText)        EndIf        ;        ; Append the final result count at the end of the first header line without shifting prior offsets        If State\EndTitleLinePos > 0          If State\FoundCount = 1            ResultCountText$ = " - " + GetTextFromCatalogPB("OneResultFound")          Else            ResultCountText$ = " - " + Str(State\FoundCount) + #Space$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("ResultsFound")          EndIf          TOM_InsertText(FoundInFilesREGadget, ResultCountText$, State\EndTitleLinePos, State\EndTitleLinePos)          TOM_SetFontStyles(FoundInFilesREGadget, PBBPanelsDefaultFontStyle$, State\EndTitleLinePos, State\EndTitleLinePos + Len(ResultCountText$))        EndIf      EndIf      ;      If Not UserHasScrolled And (State\scrollPos\x <> 0 Or State\scrollPos\y <> 0)        SendMessage_(GadgetID(FoundInFilesREGadget), #EM_SETSCROLLPOS, 0, @State\scrollPos)      EndIf      ;      PBB_SuspendRedraw(FoundInFilesREGadget, #False)      ReSizeREMenu()      ;      CompilerIf #PBBReport        If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming          ReapTimer(10)          DebugAllTimers()          OPDReport("FillFoundInREGadget has finished. Last slice time = " + Str(ElapsedMilliseconds() - SliceStartTime) + " ms")        ElseIf OPDMod & #OPDBuildOutExternalProcedureTiming          DebugAllTimers()        EndIf      CompilerEndIf      ;      PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish = #False      State\IsSearchActive = #False      ProcedureReturn #True    EndIf    ;    If PriorityMode <> #FinishCompletionNow      If (ElapsedMilliseconds() - SliceStartTime) >= 50        PBB_SuspendRedraw(FoundInFilesREGadget, #False)        CompilerIf #PBBReport          If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming            ReapTimer(10)            OPDReport("FillFoundInREGadget: interrupted by max duration. Last slice was " + Str(ElapsedMilliseconds() - SliceStartTime) + " ms")          EndIf        CompilerEndIf        ;        PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish = #True        ProcedureReturn #False      EndIf    EndIf    ;  ForEver  ;EndProcedure;; **********************************************************************************;;-                Memory synchronization & global cache reset;; **********************************************************************************;;Procedure UpdateAllFilesInMemory(TestOnly = #False)  ;  ; Role: Iterates through the list of project files and updates memory buffers if any have been modified on disk.  ; Parameters: TestOnly - If #True, only checks whether files need updating without modifying memory.  ; Prerequisites: PBBFicPrincipalPB$ must contain a valid main project file name or be empty for an empty project.  ; Output: Returns #True if a modification occurred (or is needed when TestOnly = #True), #False otherwise.  ;  Shared ExecuteSearch, RefreshEPanel  ;  Protected RetValue = #False  ;  ; --- Phase 1: Global Integrity Check ---  ForEach PBB_FileListing()    If FileSize(PBB_FileListing()\FileName$) < 1      ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_MustRestart      ProcedureReturn #True    EndIf  Next  ;  ; --- Phase 2: Cleanup or Partial Update ---  If ListSize(PBB_FileListing()) = 0 And PBBFicPrincipalPB$ <> ""    PBBFicPrincipalPB$ = ""    If GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget)      SetGadgetText(NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(#FilePBBPanel), "")      SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget, "")      SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, "")      If ExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch : ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch : EndIf      RefreshEPanel = #True    EndIf  ElseIf ListSize(PBB_FileListing()) > 0 And ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Completed    ForEach PBB_FileListing()      If UpdateOneFileInMemory(PBB_FileListing()\FileName$, TestOnly) <> #FileWasUpToDate        RetValue = #True        If ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_MustRestart          Break        EndIf      EndIf    Next  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn RetValueEndProcedure;Procedure   OpenFileWithPureBasicIDE(FNameWithoutPath$, LineNumber$)  ;  ; Role: Searches for FNameWithoutPath$ in PBB_FileListing() or checks if it is the current project file,  ; opens the target file in the PureBasic IDE at the specified line number, brings the IDE directly  ; underneath PBBrowser in the Z-order, and preserves keyboard focus on PBBrowser.  ;  Shared PBB_FileListing(), PBBCurrentProject$, PureBasicProgAddr$  ;  Protected FFile$ = GetFullPathFromFileName(FNameWithoutPath$, PBB_FileListing()), FParam$  Protected hIDE, hPBB, ProgID, IDEThread, MyThread, IDEPID.l  ;  If FFile$ = "" And FNameWithoutPath$ = GetFilePart(PBBCurrentProject$)    FFile$ = PBBCurrentProject$  EndIf  ;  If FFile$ <> ""    If FindString(FFile$, "\Temp\PureBasic_TempFile")      AlertInPBBWindow(GetTextFromCatalogPB("SaveFilePrompt"))      ProcedureReturn    EndIf    ;    FParam$ = #DOUBLEQUOTE$ + FFile$ + #DOUBLEQUOTE$    If LineNumber$      CompilerIf #PB_Compiler_OS = #PB_OS_Windows        FParam$ + " /L " + LineNumber$      CompilerElse        FParam$ + " -line " + LineNumber$      CompilerEndIf    EndIf    ;    If PureBasicProgAddr$      hIDE = GetPureBasicMainWindowNumber(PureBasicProgAddr$)      If hIDE        If IsIconic_(hIDE)          ShowWindow_(hIDE, #SW_RESTORE)        EndIf        GetWindowThreadProcessId_(hIDE, @IDEPID)        If IDEPID          AllowSetForegroundWindow_(IDEPID)        EndIf        ProgID = RunProgram(#DOUBLEQUOTE$ + PureBasicProgAddr$ + #DOUBLEQUOTE$, FParam$, GetPathPart(FFile$), #PB_Program_Open)        If ProgID          WaitProgram(ProgID, 500)          CloseProgram(ProgID)        EndIf        ;        ; Restore foreground focus to PBBrowser and stack the IDE directly underneath it        hPBB = WindowID(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)        If hPBB          IDEThread = GetWindowThreadProcessId_(GetForegroundWindow_(), 0)          MyThread  = GetCurrentThreadId_()          If IDEThread And IDEThread <> MyThread            AttachThreadInput_(MyThread, IDEThread, #True)            SetForegroundWindow_(hPBB)            AttachThreadInput_(MyThread, IDEThread, #False)          Else            SetForegroundWindow_(hPBB)          EndIf          ; Do not pass a TopMost hPBB as hWndInsertAfter, otherwise Windows promotes hIDE to TopMost as well          If GetGadgetState(GPBBGadgets\BStick)            SetWindowPos_(hIDE, #HWND_TOP, 0, 0, 0, 0, #SWP_NOMOVE | #SWP_NOSIZE | #SWP_NOACTIVATE)          Else            SetWindowPos_(hIDE, hPBB, 0, 0, 0, 0, #SWP_NOMOVE | #SWP_NOSIZE | #SWP_NOACTIVATE)          EndIf        EndIf      Else        RunProgram(#DOUBLEQUOTE$ + PureBasicProgAddr$ + #DOUBLEQUOTE$, FParam$, GetPathPart(FFile$))      EndIf    EndIf  EndIf  ;EndProcedure;Procedure   ResetPBBAnalysisCaches()  ;  ; Role: Centralizes the invalidation of all static analysis, scope, structure, and UI search caches.  ; Called both on full project re-explorations (via ClearAllElementsAndData()) and on partial file updates  ; (via UpdateOneFileInMemory()).  ;  Shared PBB_ModuleUsageEvents()  ;  ClearList(PBB_ModuleUsageEvents())  PBB_ModuleCacheState = 0  ResolveStructureOrInterface("")  GetStructureOrInterfaceNameFromVariable("", "", "", 0)  GetEncompassingLimitsAndName(0, "", 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, #True)  BuildLayout(0, "", 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, #PBB_Action_Reset)  CheckIfMacroOverridesNative("", "", 0)  OnePassSetElements_SegmentExam("")  FillFoundInREGadget(0, #WorkInBackGround, #True)EndProcedure;Procedure   ClearAllElementsAndData()  ;  ; Role: Resets the master ElementList(), clears the element, parameter, and content lists/maps,  ;       reinitializes the O(1) ID lookup array, zeroes out usage and panel completion states,  ;       and purges all static analysis caches via ResetPBBAnalysisCaches().  ;  Shared ElementContentListing()  Protected TypeOfElement  ;  ClearList(ElementList())  ClearList(ElementContentListing())  ClearMap(ElementMapIndex())  ClearMap(ParamMapIndex())  Dim ElementFixedIndexes.i(1000)  NextElementID        = 1  PBB_HasModules       = #False  PBB_HasUndefineMacro = #False  ;  For TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure To #EndEnumPBBElementTypes - 1    ListOfUsedElementsNbr(TypeOfElement) = 0    ListCompletion(TypeOfElement)        = #ListCompletion_UnPrinted  Next  ;  ; Invalidate any cached FixedID in search history since ElementFixedIndexes() was reset  ForEach ListOfSearches()    ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\FixedID = 0  Next  ;  OnePassSetElements(0, "", 0, #True)  ResetPBBAnalysisCaches()EndProcedure;; **********************************************************************************;;-                Hyperlink clicks, history & IDE navigation;; **********************************************************************************;Declare GUI_FR_SyncGadgetsWithSearch(*LastSearch.SearchDetails, RefreshScopes = #False);Define NextOrPreviewAsked;Procedure   WalkOverPages(NextOrPreviewAsked, *LastSearch.SearchDetails = 0)  ;  ; Role: Navigates backward or forward through the history of previously searched expressions  ; ('ListOfSearches()') when the user clicks the 'Previous' or 'Next' buttons in the  ; 'Details' or 'Found in...' panels, or projects the active search entry onto the newly  ; selected panel (when NextOrPreviewAsked = 0).  ; Synchronizes '*LastSearch' and the "LookUp (N)" button counter with the active history entry.  ;  Shared SearchNavigationIndex  ;  Protected mNavigationIndex = SearchNavigationIndex, ActivePanel = GetActivePBBPanel()  Protected *TargetSearch.SearchDetails = *LastSearch  ;  If ActivePanel = #DetailPBBPanel Or ActivePanel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel    If ListSize(ListOfSearches()) > 0      SearchNavigationIndex = min(max(SearchNavigationIndex + NextOrPreviewAsked, 1), ListSize(ListOfSearches()))      SelectElement(ListOfSearches(), SearchNavigationIndex - 1)      *TargetSearch = @ListOfSearches()\Search_Details      ;      SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, *TargetSearch\ElementName$)      SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\ExpressionDetails, ComputeExpressionDetails(*TargetSearch))      GUI_FR_SyncGadgetsWithSearch(*TargetSearch, Bool(mNavigationIndex <> SearchNavigationIndex))      ;      If *LastSearch        CopyStructure(*TargetSearch, *LastSearch, SearchDetails)      EndIf      SetSearchButtonState(#PBBSearchBtn_LookUp, Bool(*TargetSearch\MultipleResults > 1), *TargetSearch\MultipleResults)    EndIf    ;    If *TargetSearch      If ActivePanel = #DetailPBBPanel        FillDetailREGadget(*TargetSearch)      Else        FillFoundInREGadget(*TargetSearch)      EndIf    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn Bool(mNavigationIndex <> SearchNavigationIndex)EndProcedure;Procedure   WalkOverPannels(PStep, *LastSearch.SearchDetails = 0)  ;  ; Role: Switches sequentially from one panel to another in response to keyboard shortcuts,  ; forwarding '*LastSearch' to WalkOverPages() when landing on 'Details' or 'Found in...'.  ;  Shared RefreshEPanel  ;  Protected ActPannel  ;  ActPannel = GetActivePBBPanel()  If PStep = 1    If ActPannel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel      ActPannel = #FilePBBPanel    ElseIf ActPannel = #FilePBBPanel      ActPannel = #ProcPBBPanel    ElseIf ActPannel = #EndEnumPBBPanels - 1      ActPannel = #DetailPBBPanel    Else      ActPannel + 1    EndIf  Else    If ActPannel = #FilePBBPanel      ActPannel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel    ElseIf ActPannel = #DetailPBBPanel      ActPannel = #EndEnumPBBPanels - 1    ElseIf ActPannel = #ProcPBBPanel      ActPannel = #FilePBBPanel    Else      ActPannel - 1    EndIf  EndIf  SetActivePBBPanel(ActPannel)  ReSizeREMenu()  If ActPannel = #DetailPBBPanel Or ActPannel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel    WalkOverPages(0, *LastSearch)  EndIf  SetActiveGadget(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel())EndProcedure;Procedure.s GetImageNameFromSelectionPos(NoREGadget)  ;  ; Role: Examines the RTF content just before the start of the current selection  ; to determine if it contains the image marker located right before an image-button.  ;  Protected PosInText, pf, ExpressionUnderCursor$  Protected ImageButtonName$ ; Return value.  ;  ; Retrieve the cursor position in the text.  PosInText = TOM_GetRealPos(NoREGadget)  ;  If CharButtons ; CharButtons is a global variable set in 'PBBrowserDeclarations.pb'.    ; The program is running under Windows 7 or an earlier version.    ; The buttons are not displayed as images but as one or more characters.    If FindString(TOM_GetText(NoREGadget, "", max(0, PosInText - Len(#PBBLeftArrow$)), PosInText + Len(#PBBLeftArrow$)), #PBBLeftArrow$)      ProcedureReturn #PBBLeftArrowMarker$    ElseIf FindString(TOM_GetText(NoREGadget, "", max(0, PosInText - Len(#PBBRightArrow$)), PosInText + Len(#PBBRightArrow$)), #PBBRightArrow$)      ProcedureReturn #PBBRightArrowMarker$    EndIf  Else    ; Retrieve the RTF code of the previous 20 characters:    ExpressionUnderCursor$ = TOM_GetText(NoREGadget, "RTF", PosInText - 20, PosInText)    ;    PosInText = FindString(ExpressionUnderCursor$, #PBBRTFMarker$, 0)    If PosInText      ; A marker has been found. It is indeed a click on an image-button.      ; Extract the marker name to identify the button.      ImageButtonName$ = ""      PosInText + Len(#PBBRTFMarker$)      pf = FirstOccurrenceOfChar(ExpressionUnderCursor$, " }\", PosInText)      If pf = 0 : pf = Len(ExpressionUnderCursor$) + 1 : EndIf      ImageButtonName$  = FastMid(ExpressionUnderCursor$, PosInText, pf - PosInText)      ProcedureReturn ImageButtonName$    EndIf  EndIfEndProcedure;Procedure   MapDetailCodeClickToFilePos(*StrRef.String, ClickMin, EndIntroPos, FileName$, ElementStartingPos)  ;  ; Role: Maps a 0-based character offset (ClickMin) inside the code body of #DetailPBBPanel  ; back to its exact 1-based character position in the original source file (FileName$).  ; Since FillDetailREGadget() only strips leading spaces from each line after EndIntroPos,  ; counting line breaks (#CR$) via GetNoLineFromStrAndPos() and adding the column offset  ; from the first non-space character yields the exact token position in FileName$  ; even when identical tokens appear on the same line.  ;  Protected *FileString.String  Protected *Char.Character, *LimitChar.Character  Protected LineOffset, ColOffsetInTrimmedLine, FilePos, FileLen  ;  If *StrRef = 0 Or FileName$ = "" Or ElementStartingPos <= 0 Or ClickMin <= EndIntroPos Or ClickMin >= Len(*StrRef\s)    ProcedureReturn 0  EndIf  ;  *FileString = GetPointedCodeFromFile(FileName$)  If *FileString = 0 Or *FileString\s = ""    ProcedureReturn 0  EndIf  ;  ; 1. Count lines below EndIntroPos via GetNoLineFromStrAndPos() and measure the column offset on the clicked line  LineOffset = GetNoLineFromStrAndPos(*StrRef, ClickMin) - GetNoLineFromStrAndPos(*StrRef, EndIntroPos + 1)  *LimitChar = PosToChar(@*StrRef\s, EndIntroPos + 2)  *Char      = PosToChar(@*StrRef\s, ClickMin)  While *Char >= *LimitChar And *Char\c <> #CR    ColOffsetInTrimmedLine + 1    *Char - SizeOf(Character)  Wend  ;  ; 2. Advance by the same number of lines from ElementStartingPos in the source file buffer  FilePos = ElementStartingPos  FileLen = Len(*FileString\s)  While LineOffset > 0 And FilePos <= FileLen    FilePos = FindString(*FileString\s, #CR$, FilePos)    If FilePos = 0      ProcedureReturn 0    EndIf    FilePos + 1    LineOffset - 1  Wend  ;  ; 3. Skip leading spaces on the target file line to align with the trimmed line in DetailREGadget  If FilePos <= FileLen    *Char = PosToChar(@*FileString\s, FilePos)    While *Char\c = #Space      GoNextChar(*Char)      FilePos + 1    Wend  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn FilePos + ColOffsetInTrimmedLineEndProcedure;Procedure   ClickOverREGadget(Button, *SearchParam.SearchDetails)  ;  ; ROLE & 4-STAGE ARCHITECTURE:  ; 1. Target Extraction:  ;    Detects history navigation image buttons or extracts the underlined token boundaries  ;    (ExpressionUnderCursor$), its preceding character (pChar), and its full line context.  ; 2. Direct UI Actions:  ;    Immediately processes clicks on source/binary files, line numbers "[123]", and custom UI  ;    links ("MoreInfo", "SeeVariablesList", "SeeOneOtherScope" / "SeeOtherScopes").  ; 3. Contextual Enrichment by Panel:  ;    - #DetailPBBPanel: queries the pre-populated DetailPanelLinks() table first to retrieve  ;      the exact resolved element or local variable scope in O(1), falling back to context  ;      scanning only if no link entry matches.  ;    - #ListPBBPanel (e.g., #VariablePBBPanel): extracts Species/SubSpecies hierarchy headers  ;      and requests interactive popup disambiguation (#PBBUserWillChoose) when multiple scopes exist.  ;    - #FoundInFilesPBBPanel: extracts container types (Procedure, Structure, Module) and  ;      enclosing module names from the clicked line.  ; 4. Final Dispatch:  ;    Opens PureBasic CHM help (or Google fallback) for native functions/keywords, or switches  ;    to #DetailPBBPanel (left click) / #FoundInFilesPBBPanel (right click, or left click on  ;    formal parameters and implicit variables) and triggers search.  ;  Shared NextOrPreviewAsked     ; For navigation in the search history.  Shared ExecuteSearch          ; To trigger a search if needed.  Shared VList.VariableListings ; Shared with FillDetailREGadget().  ;  Protected StrRef.String, txtrange.CHARRANGE, ZeroScroll.POINT, ExpressionUnderCursor$  Protected *pTextFont.ITextFont2  Protected *pTextRange.ITextRange2  Protected PageAddr$, NoLine$, FNameWithoutPath$, ImageButtonName$  Protected NoREGadget, Panel, pl, TypeOfElement, PosInText, Underlined, pChar  Protected pf, PosAfter, ct, ClickedFilePos, FoundInDetailLinks  Protected LineStartPos, LineEndPos, ClickedLine$, PrecedingWord$, ModPos, ModName$  Protected PBB_Bullet$ = GetPBBStringParameter("PBB_Bullet") + #NonBreakableSpace$  Protected FFile$, FPath$  ;  NoREGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()  If NoREGadget = 0    ProcedureReturn  EndIf  ;  ; ======================================================================  ; STAGE 1: TARGET EXTRACTION (IMAGE BUTTONS OR UNDERLINED TEXT)  ; ======================================================================  StrRef\s = ReplaceString(GetGadgetText(NoREGadget), #LF$, "")  TOM_GetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, @txtrange.CHARRANGE)  Underlined = FindString(TOM_GetFontStyles(NoREGadget), "Underline")  ;  If Underlined = 0 And txtrange\cpMax - txtrange\cpMin <= 1    ; Check if the user clicked on a history navigation arrow button    ImageButtonName$ = GetImageNameFromSelectionPos(NoREGadget)    If ImageButtonName$      If ImageButtonName$ = #PBBLeftArrowMarker$        NextOrPreviewAsked = -1      ElseIf ImageButtonName$ = #PBBRightArrowMarker$        NextOrPreviewAsked = 1      EndIf      TOM_SetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, txtrange\cpMin, txtrange\cpMin)      WalkOverPages(NextOrPreviewAsked, *SearchParam)    EndIf    ProcedureReturn  ElseIf Underlined = 0    ProcedureReturn  EndIf  ;  ; Expand selection left and right to capture the entire underlined link on the current line  Repeat    txtrange\cpMin - 1    *pTextRange = TOM_GetTextRangeObj(NoREGadget, txtrange\cpMin, txtrange\cpMin + 1)    If *pTextRange      *pTextRange\GetChar(@pChar)      If *pTextRange\GetFont(@*pTextFont) = #S_OK        *pTextFont\GetUnderline(@pl)        *pTextFont\Release()      EndIf      *pTextRange\Release()    EndIf  Until txtrange\cpMin <= -1 Or pl = #TomNone Or pChar = #CR  txtrange\cpMin + 1  ;  Repeat    *pTextRange = TOM_GetTextRangeObj(NoREGadget, txtrange\cpMax, txtrange\cpMax + 1)    If *pTextRange      *pTextRange\GetChar(@pChar)      If *pTextRange\GetFont(@*pTextFont) = #S_OK        *pTextFont\GetUnderline(@pl)        *pTextFont\Release()        If pl <> #TomNone          txtrange\cpMax + 1        EndIf      EndIf      *pTextRange\Release()    EndIf  Until txtrange\cpMax >= Len(StrRef\s) Or pl = #TomNone Or pChar = #CR  ;  TOM_SetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, txtrange\cpMin, txtrange\cpMax)  ExpressionUnderCursor$ = TOM_GetText(NoREGadget)  If ExpressionUnderCursor$ = ""    ProcedureReturn  EndIf  ;  ; Retrieve the character immediately preceding the underlined expression  pChar = 0  If txtrange\cpMin > 0    *pTextRange = TOM_GetTextRangeObj(NoREGadget, txtrange\cpMin - 1, txtrange\cpMin)    If *pTextRange      *pTextRange\GetChar(@pChar)      *pTextRange\Release()    EndIf  EndIf  ;  Panel = GetActivePBBPanel()  If Panel >= #ProcPBBPanel    ; Handle Line-1 'All / Unused' filter toggle across all element list panels    LineEndPos = FindString(StrRef\s, #CR$)    If LineEndPos = 0 Or txtrange\cpMin < LineEndPos - 1      TypeOfElement = TypeElementOfPBBPanel(Panel)      ListUnusedOnly(TypeOfElement) = Bool(ListUnusedOnly(TypeOfElement) = #False)      TOM_SetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, 0, 0)      SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #EM_SETSCROLLPOS, 0, @ZeroScroll)      FillElementREGadget(TypeOfElement)      ProcedureReturn    EndIf    ;    ; Handle collapsible '►'/'▼' Species and SubSpecies headers in the Variables panel    If Panel = #VariablePBBPanel And       (Left(ExpressionUnderCursor$, 1) = #PBBFoldClosed$ Or Left(ExpressionUnderCursor$, 1) = #PBBFoldOpen$)      ModName$ = LCase(Trim(Mid(ExpressionUnderCursor$, 2)))      If pChar = ' '        LineStartPos = txtrange\cpMin + 1        FastFindPrecReturn(StrRef\s, LineStartPos)        While LineStartPos > 1          LineEndPos   = LineStartPos          LineStartPos - 1          FastFindPrecReturn(StrRef\s, LineStartPos)          ClickedLine$ = FastMid(StrRef\s, LineStartPos + 1, LineEndPos - LineStartPos - 1)          If Left(ClickedLine$, 1) = #PBBFoldClosed$ Or Left(ClickedLine$, 1) = #PBBFoldOpen$            ModName$ = LCase(StringField(Mid(ClickedLine$, 3), 1, " ")) + "/" + ModName$            Break          EndIf        Wend      EndIf      VarPanelExpanded(ModName$) = Bool(VarPanelExpanded(ModName$) = #False)      TOM_SetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, 0, 0)      FillElementREGadget(#PBBVariable)      ProcedureReturn    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ; Apply visual wave-underline feedback to the clicked link  SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #EM_SETREADONLY, #False, 0)  TOM_SetFontStyles(NoREGadget, "Underline(Wave)")  SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #EM_SETREADONLY, #True, 0)  ;  ; ======================================================================  ; STAGE 2: DIRECT UI ACTIONS (FILES, LINE NUMBERS, CUSTOM LINKS)  ; ======================================================================  ; 2A. Source file link  If Left(ExpressionUnderCursor$, 1) <> #DOUBLEQUOTE$ And FindString(ExpressionUnderCursor$, ".") And     (GetFullPathFromFileName(ExpressionUnderCursor$, PBB_FileListing()) <> "" Or ExpressionUnderCursor$ = GetFilePart(PBBCurrentProject$))    NoLine$ = ""    If Panel = #DetailPBBPanel Or Panel = #FilePBBPanel      NoLine$ = FindNoLine(StrRef\s, txtrange\cpMax + 1)    EndIf    OpenFileWithPureBasicIDE(ExpressionUnderCursor$, NoLine$)    ProcedureReturn  EndIf  ;  ; 2B. Binary file link  If Left(ExpressionUnderCursor$, 1) <> #DOUBLEQUOTE$ And     FindString(ExpressionUnderCursor$, ".") And     FindString(ExpressionUnderCursor$, "..") = 0    FFile$ = GetFullPathFromFileName(ExpressionUnderCursor$, PBB_BinaryFileListing())    If FFile$      FPath$ = #DOUBLEQUOTE$ + GetPathPart(FFile$) + #DOUBLEQUOTE$      OpenFolderIfNotOpen(FPath$)      ProcedureReturn    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ; 2C. Interactive custom UI links  If ExpressionUnderCursor$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("MoreInfo")    AlertInPBBWindow(GetTextFromCatalogPB("HelpClickInstruction"))    ProcedureReturn    ;  ElseIf ExpressionUnderCursor$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("SeeVariablesList")    AlertInPBBWindow(VList\CompleteList, VList\ProcedureName + ": variables", 1, 0, 1, 500, "100,250")    ProcedureReturn    ;  ElseIf ExpressionUnderCursor$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("SeeOneOtherScope") Or         FindString(ExpressionUnderCursor$, StringField(GetTextFromCatalogPB("SeeOtherScopes"), 1, "%1"))    TOM_SetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, 0, 0)    pl = *SearchParam\SearchInCom    pf = *SearchParam\SearchInQuotes    PrepareSearchDetailsElement(*SearchParam, GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget))    *SearchParam\DontCheckPosition = #True    *SearchParam\VarDotType$       = ""    *SearchParam\HasParentheses    = -1    *SearchParam\SearchInCom       = pl    *SearchParam\SearchInQuotes    = pf    ExecuteSearch = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact    ProcedureReturn    ;  EndIf  ;  ; 2D. Line number link "[123]" in #FoundInFilesPBBPanel  If Panel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel And Val(ExpressionUnderCursor$) > 0    NoLine$   = ExpressionUnderCursor$    pf        = ReverseFindString(StrRef\s, #NonBreakableSpace$ + #CR$, txtrange\cpMin)    PosInText = pf    FastFindPrecReturn(StrRef\s, PosInText)    PosInText + 1    FNameWithoutPath$ = Mid(StrRef\s, PosInText, pf - PosInText)    OpenFileWithPureBasicIDE(FNameWithoutPath$, NoLine$)    ProcedureReturn    ;  EndIf  ;  ; ======================================================================  ; STAGE 3: CONTEXTUAL ENRICHMENT OF *SearchParam BY PANEL  ; ======================================================================  ; 3.0. Fast-path O(1) lookup in DetailPanelLinks() when clicking in #DetailPBBPanel  ;{  If Panel = #DetailPBBPanel    ForEach DetailPanelLinks()      If DetailPanelLinks()\StartOffset <= txtrange\cpMin And DetailPanelLinks()\EndOffset >= txtrange\cpMax        CopyStructure(@DetailPanelLinks()\TargetDetails, *SearchParam, SearchDetails)        TypeOfElement = *SearchParam\TypeOfElement        If DetailPanelLinks()\ForceUserChoice          ExecuteSearch = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact        EndIf        FoundInDetailLinks = #True        Break      EndIf    Next  EndIf  ;  If FoundInDetailLinks = #False    ModName$ = ""    If Panel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel And pChar = '.' And *SearchParam\TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable      If ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Completed And ResolveSearchDetailsElement(*SearchParam) And         FindString(ElementList()\VarDotType_LCase, "::")        ModName$ = StringField(ElementList()\VarDotType_LCase, 1, ":")      Else        ModName$ = *SearchParam\ModuleName$      EndIf    EndIf    PrepareSearchDetailsElement(*SearchParam, ExpressionUnderCursor$)    If ModName$ <> ""      *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = ModName$    EndIf    StrRef\s = ReplaceString(StrRef\s, #NonBreakableSpace$, " ")    StrRef\s = ReplaceString(StrRef\s, #SpecialSpace$, " ")    ;    ; Extract explicit 'ModuleName::' prefix if present immediately before the clicked token    If txtrange\cpMin >= 2 And FastMid(StrRef\s, txtrange\cpMin - 1, 2) = "::"      pf        = txtrange\cpMin - 2      PosInText = pf      While PosInText > 0 And IsPBSeparator(Asc(FastMid(StrRef\s, PosInText, 1))) = #False        PosInText - 1      Wend      *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = FastMid(StrRef\s, PosInText + 1, pf - PosInText)    EndIf    ;    ; If the clicked token itself is immediately followed by '::', it is a Module identifier    If FastMid(StrRef\s, txtrange\cpMax + 1, 2) = "::"      TypeOfElement            = #PBBModule      *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = ""    Else      TypeOfElement = TypeElementOfPBBPanel(Panel)    EndIf    ;}    If Panel = #VariablePBBPanel And TypeOfElement <> #PBBModule And pChar <> '.'      ; 3A. Click inside the Variables list panel: scan upward for enclosing '▼ SubSpecies' and '▼ Species' headers      ;{      LineStartPos = txtrange\cpMin + 1      FastFindPrecReturn(StrRef\s, LineStartPos)      While LineStartPos > 1        LineEndPos   = LineStartPos        LineStartPos - 1        FastFindPrecReturn(StrRef\s, LineStartPos)        ClickedLine$ = FastMid(StrRef\s, LineStartPos + 1, LineEndPos - LineStartPos - 1)        If *SearchParam\ElementSubSpecies$ = "" And Left(ClickedLine$, 3) = "  " + #PBBFoldOpen$          *SearchParam\ElementSubSpecies$ = StringField(Mid(ClickedLine$, 5), 1, " ")        ElseIf Left(ClickedLine$, 1) = #PBBFoldOpen$          *SearchParam\ElementSpecies$ = StringField(Mid(ClickedLine$, 3), 1, " ")          Break        EndIf      Wend      *SearchParam\TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable      ExecuteSearch = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact      ;}      ;    ElseIf Panel = #DetailPBBPanel And DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos > 0 And txtrange\cpMin >= DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos      ; 3B. Fallback click inside the source code body of #DetailPBBPanel: map to file position and run GetInfosFromContext()      ;{      ClickedFilePos = MapDetailCodeClickToFilePos(StrRef, txtrange\cpMin, DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos,                                                   DetailPanelContext\FileName$, DetailPanelContext\ElementStartingPos)      If ClickedFilePos > 0        TypeOfElement = GetInfosFromContext(*SearchParam, DetailPanelContext\FileName$, ClickedFilePos)      EndIf      If TypeOfElement <= #PBBNoType Or TypeOfElement = #PBBNotAnElement        TypeOfElement = GetInfosFromData(*SearchParam, #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact)      EndIf      ;}    ElseIf Panel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel Or Panel = #DetailPBBPanel Or (Panel = #VariablePBBPanel And pChar = '.')      ; 3C. Click in #FoundInFilesPBBPanel, '.Type' in #VariablePBBPanel, or fallback in the intro header of #DetailPBBPanel      ;{      LineStartPos = txtrange\cpMin + 1      FastFindPrecReturn(StrRef\s, LineStartPos)      LineStartPos + 1      LineEndPos = FindString(StrRef\s, #CR$, txtrange\cpMin + 1)      If LineEndPos = 0 : LineEndPos = Len(StrRef\s) + 1 : EndIf      ClickedLine$ = FastMid(StrRef\s, LineStartPos, LineEndPos - LineStartPos)      ;      ; Check if the word immediately preceding the clicked token is a container type keyword (Procedure, Structure, Module...)      pf = txtrange\cpMin      While pf > 0 And FastMid(StrRef\s, pf, 1) = " " : pf - 1 : Wend      PosInText = pf      If PosInText > 1        While PosInText > 0 And IsPBSeparator(Asc(FastMid(StrRef\s, PosInText, 1))) = #False : PosInText - 1 : Wend        PosInText + 1        PrecedingWord$ = FastMid(StrRef\s, PosInText, pf + 1 - PosInText)        If PrecedingWord$ = "DeclareModule"          TypeOfElement = #PBBModule        ElseIf PrecedingWord$ = "ImportC"          TypeOfElement = #PBBImport        ElseIf PrecedingWord$          For ct = #PBBProcedure To #EndEnumPBBTypes - 1            If PBBTypeNames$(ct) = PrecedingWord$              TypeOfElement = ct              Break            EndIf          Next        EndIf      EndIf      ;      ; Extract enclosing module name when the clicked line mentions "Module <Name>" or "DeclareModule <Name>"      If *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = "" And TypeOfElement <> #PBBModule        ModPos = FindString(ClickedLine$, PBBTypeNames$(#PBBModule) + " ")        If ModPos > 0          ModPos + Len(PBBTypeNames$(#PBBModule) + " ")          ModName$ = StringField(Mid(ClickedLine$, ModPos), 1, " ")          ModName$ = Trim(ModName$, ".")          If ModName$ <> "" And LCase(ModName$) <> LCase(ExpressionUnderCursor$)            *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = ModName$          EndIf        EndIf      EndIf      ;      ; Detect clicks on the "CalledProcedures" / "CalledMacros" lines or on Unused/Unprotected local variables in #DetailPBBPanel intro      If Panel = #DetailPBBPanel And TypeOfElement = #PBBNotAnElement        If DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBNativeFunction Or DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBBasicKeyword          TypeOfElement = DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement        ElseIf FindString(ClickedLine$, GetTextFromCatalogPB("CalledProcedures"))          TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure        ElseIf FindString(ClickedLine$, GetTextFromCatalogPB("CalledMacros"))          TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro        ElseIf (DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure Or DetailPanelContext\TypeOfElement = #PBBMacro) And               ( (VList\Unused <> "" And FindString(ClickedLine$, StringField(VList\Unused, 1, " "))) Or                 (VList\Unprotected <> "" And FindString(ClickedLine$, StringField(VList\Unprotected, 1, " "))) )          TypeOfElement                      = #PBBVariable          *SearchParam\ElementFile$          = DetailPanelContext\FileName$          *SearchParam\StartingContextLimit  = DetailPanelContext\ElementStartingPos          *SearchParam\EndingContextLimit    = DetailPanelContext\ElementEndingPos        EndIf      EndIf      ;      If TypeOfElement = #PBBNotAnElement Or (TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable And pChar = '.')        If Panel = #VariablePBBPanel And pChar = '.' And *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = ""          ModPos = FindString(ClickedLine$, "::")          If ModPos > 0 And ModPos < (txtrange\cpMin - LineStartPos + 2)            *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = Trim(Left(ClickedLine$, ModPos - 1))          EndIf          If FindElementInList(PurifyElementName(Left(ClickedLine$, txtrange\cpMin - LineStartPos + 1)), #PBBVariable,                               0, "", 0, -1, "", 0, GetModuleID(*SearchParam\ModuleName$)) And             FindString(ElementList()\VarDotType_LCase, "::")            *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = StringField(ElementList()\VarDotType_LCase, 1, ":")          EndIf        EndIf        If FindStructureOrInterfaceID(QualifyWithModule(*SearchParam\ModuleName$, *SearchParam\ElementPurifiedName$)) Or           (pChar = '.' And *SearchParam\ModuleName$ <> "" And FindStructureOrInterfaceID(*SearchParam\ElementPurifiedName$))          TypeOfElement            = ElementList()\Type          *SearchParam\ModuleName$ = GetEnclosingModuleName(ElementList()\EnclosingModuleID)        EndIf        If TypeOfElement <= #PBBNoType Or TypeOfElement = #PBBNotAnElement          TypeOfElement = GetInfosFromData(*SearchParam, #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact)        EndIf      EndIf      ;}    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ; ======================================================================  ; STAGE 4: FINAL DISPATCH (HELP FILE OR PANEL SWITCH & SEARCH)  ; ======================================================================  ;{  If TypeOfElement = #PBBNativeFunction Or TypeOfElement = #PBBBasicKeyword    TOM_SetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, 0, 0)    FFile$ = GetPathPart(PureBasicProgAddr$) + "PureBasic.chm"    If FileSize(FFile$) > 2 And FindMapElement(PBHelpPaths(), PurifyElementName(ExpressionUnderCursor$)) And PBHelpPaths() <> ""      PageAddr$ = FFile$ + "::/" + PBHelpPaths()      RunProgram("hh.exe", #DOUBLEQUOTE$ + PageAddr$ + #DOUBLEQUOTE$, GetPathPart(PureBasicProgAddr$))    Else      RunProgram("https://www.google.com/search?q=purebasic+" + PurifyElementName(ExpressionUnderCursor$))    EndIf    ;  ElseIf TypeOfElement <> #PBBNoType And (Panel >= #ProcPBBPanel Or Panel = #DetailPBBPanel Or Panel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel)    If Button = #WM_LBUTTONUP      SetActivePBBPanel(#DetailPBBPanel)    Else      SetActivePBBPanel(#FoundInFilesPBBPanel)    EndIf    If FoundInDetailLinks And *SearchParam\ElementName$ <> ""      SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, *SearchParam\ElementName$)    Else      SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, ExpressionUnderCursor$)    EndIf    *SearchParam\TypeOfElement = TypeOfElement    If ExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch      ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch    EndIf  EndIf  ;}EndProcedure;; **********************************************************************************;;-                     Main window GUI layout & theming;; **********************************************************************************;Procedure GUI_UpdatePBBMenus()  ;  ; Role: Builds or refreshes the RichEdit hamburger popup menu and the main window tools/preferences popup menu.  ;  If IsMenu(GPBBGadgets\REMenu)    FreeMenu(GPBBGadgets\REMenu)  EndIf  GPBBGadgets\REMenu = CreatePopupMenu(#PB_Any)  MenuItem(#REM_ZoomIn,       GetTextFromCatalogPB("ZoomIn")       + #TAB$ + "CTRL + '+'")  MenuItem(#REM_ZoomOut,      GetTextFromCatalogPB("ZoomOut")      + #TAB$ + "CTRL + '-'")  MenuItem(#REM_ZoomReset,    GetTextFromCatalogPB("ZoomReset")    + #TAB$ + "CTRL + 0")  MenuBar()  MenuItem(#REM_FindInPannel, GetTextFromCatalogPB("FindInPannel") + #TAB$ + "CTRL + F")  MenuBar()  MenuItem(#REM_CopyAll,      GetTextFromCatalogPB("CopyAll"))  MenuItem(#REM_SaveAsText,   GetTextFromCatalogPB("SaveAsText")   + #TAB$ + "CTRL + S")  MenuItem(#REM_SaveAsRTF,    GetTextFromCatalogPB("SaveAsRTF")    + #TAB$ + "CTRL + R")  ;  ApplyThemesToMenu(GPBBGadgets\REMenu)  ;  ; Build the main window menu managed by PBBrowserMainProc()  ;  Protected MenuLine$  ;  If IsMenu(GPBBGadgets\Menu)    FreeMenu(GPBBGadgets\Menu)  EndIf  GPBBGadgets\Menu = CreatePopupMenu(#PB_Any)  MenuItem(#PBBMenu_THAT, GetTextFromCatalogPB("OpenTHATWindow") + #TAB$ + "CTRL + I")  MenuBar()  MenuItem(#PBBMenu_Prefs, GetTextFromCatalogPB("Preferences"))  MenuBar()  ForEach CommandList()    If CommandList()\CommandDontShow = 0      MenuLine$ = GetTranslatedCommandName(CommandList()\CommandNo)      If CommandList()\CommandShortCut        MenuLine$ + #TAB$ + ComputeShortcutString(CommandList()\CommandShortCut)      EndIf      MenuItem(CommandList()\CommandNo + #PBBMenu_CommandOffset, MenuLine$)    EndIf    If CommandList()\CommandShortCut      AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, CommandList()\CommandShortCut, CommandList()\CommandNo + #PBBMenu_CommandOffset)    EndIf  Next  ApplyThemesToMenu(GPBBGadgets\Menu)EndProcedure;Procedure GUI_SetPBBGadgetsTitles()  ;  ; Role: Sets or updates all UI gadget labels, button captions, tooltips, and tab titles  ; according to the currently active language catalog.  ;  Shared PBBCustomLinks$ ; List of clickable links in the displayed texts.  PBBCustomLinks$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("MoreInfo") + #CR$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("SeeVariablesList") + #CR$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("SeeOtherScopes") + #CR$  ;  Protected txa$, Panel  ;  SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\AdrTitle, GetTextFromCatalogPB("MainFileLabel"))  SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\BChangeAdresse, GetTextFromCatalogPB("Open"))  SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpressionTitle, GetTextFromCatalogPB("Expression"))  ; Refresh the search button label according to its current mode (#PBBSearchBtn_Search or #PBBSearchBtn_LookUp) and count  SetSearchButtonState()  txa$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("SearchInstructions")  RemoveBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\Tooltip, GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget)  AddBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\Tooltip, GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, txa$)  RemoveBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\Tooltip, GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression)  AddBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\Tooltip, GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression, txa$)  txa$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("ToolTip+")  RemoveBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\Tooltip, GPBBGadgets\BSearchPlus)  AddBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\Tooltip, GPBBGadgets\BSearchPlus, txa$)  SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\TProgressBar, GetTextFromCatalogPB("Exploration"))  SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\BStats, GetTextFromCatalogPB("Statistics"))  RemoveBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\Tooltip, GPBBGadgets\BRefresh)  AddBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\Tooltip, GPBBGadgets\BRefresh, GetTextFromCatalogPB("RefreshEx"))  SetGadgetItemText(NoGadgetPBBPanel(#FilePBBPanel), NoPBBPanel(#FilePBBPanel), GetTextFromCatalogPB(PBBPanelNames$(#FilePBBPanel)))  SetGadgetItemText(NoGadgetPBBPanel(#ListPBBPanel), NoPBBPanel(#ListPBBPanel), GetTextFromCatalogPB(PBBPanelNames$(#ListPBBPanel)))  For Panel = #ProcPBBPanel To #EndEnumPBBPanels - 1    SetGadgetItemText(GPBBGadgets\ListsPGadget, NoPBBPanel(Panel), GetTextFromCatalogPB(PBBPanelNames$(Panel)))  Next  SetGadgetItemText(NoGadgetPBBPanel(#DetailPBBPanel), NoPBBPanel(#DetailPBBPanel), GetTextFromCatalogPB(PBBPanelNames$(#DetailPBBPanel)))  SetGadgetItemText(NoGadgetPBBPanel(#FoundInFilesPBBPanel), NoPBBPanel(#FoundInFilesPBBPanel), GetTextFromCatalogPB(PBBPanelNames$(#FoundInFilesPBBPanel)))  ;  SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\BStick, GetTextFromCatalogPB("AlwaysOnTop"))  SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\BAbout, GetTextFromCatalogPB("About"))  SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\BQuit , GetTextFromCatalogPB("Quit"))  ;  GUI_UpdatePBBMenus()  ;EndProcedure;Procedure GUI_ColorizeAndSetFontsOfGadgets()  ;  ; Role: Applies the active color theme and font settings to the main window and all its child gadgets.  ;  Protected *GadgetAdress = @GPBBGadgets\AdrTitle, GadgetID  Protected TitleColor    = GetPBBNumParameter("PBBTitleColor")  ;  SetWindowColor(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, InterfaceColorPresets()\BackGroundColor)  Repeat    GadgetID = PeekI(*GadgetAdress)    If GadgetID = GPBBGadgets\AdrTitle Or GadgetID = GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpressionTitle Or GadgetID = GPBBGadgets\ExpressionDetails      SetGadgetColorEx(GadgetID, #PB_Gadget_FrontColor, TitleColor)    Else      SetGadgetColorEx(GadgetID, #PB_Gadget_FrontColor, InterfaceColorPresets()\TextColor, 1)    EndIf    SetGadgetColorEx(GadgetID, #PB_Gadget_BackColor, InterfaceColorPresets()\BackGroundColor, 1)    ;    If GadgetID = GPBBGadgets\BRefresh      SetGadgetFont(GadgetID, PBBBRefreshFont)    ElseIf GadgetID = GPBBGadgets\AdrTitle Or GadgetID = GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpressionTitle      SetGadgetFont(GadgetID, PBBTitleFont)    Else      SetGadgetFont(GadgetID, PBBAllGadgetsFont)    EndIf    If GadgetID = GPBBGadgets\GLine      RepaintCanvasSeparator(GPBBGadgets\GLine, CalculateBorderColor(InterfaceColorPresets()\TextColor, InterfaceColorPresets()\BackGroundColor))    EndIf    *GadgetAdress + SizeOf(Integer)  Until *GadgetAdress > @GPBBGadgets\BREMenu  ;  SetGadgetFont(GPBBGadgets\TProgressBar, PBBProgressLegendFont)  SetGadgetColorEx(GPBBGadgets\TProgressBar, #PB_Gadget_FrontColor, TitleColor)  SetGadgetColorEx(GPBBGadgets\EProgressBar, #PB_Gadget_FrontColor, TitleColor)EndProcedure;Procedure GUI_ResizePBBGadgets()  ;  ; Role: Sizes and repositions all gadgets in the main window based on the current window dimensions.  ;  ; This procedure is only called in two situations: when the window is created,  ; and during a #PB_Event_SizeWindow event.  ; The 'GPBBGadgets' structure containing all the gadget numbers is a global variable.  ;  ; Calculation variables for resizing:  Protected MainPanelGadgetWidth, MainPanelGadgetHeight, ResultInsideHeightDecal, ResultInsideWidthDecal  Protected REGadgetsHeight, REGadgetsWidth, TypeOfElement  ;  Protected BWidth = 70  Protected ExternalMargin = 6  Protected SpaceInterFields = 4  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - GadgetX(GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget) - BWidth - ExternalMargin - SpaceInterFields, #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BChangeAdresse, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - BWidth - ExternalMargin, #PB_Ignore, BWidth, #PB_Ignore)  ;  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - GadgetX(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget) - BWidth - ExternalMargin - SpaceInterFields, #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - BWidth - ExternalMargin, #PB_Ignore, BWidth, #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BSearchPlus, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - GadgetHeight(GPBBGadgets\BSearchPlus) - ExternalMargin, #PB_Ignore, GadgetHeight(GPBBGadgets\BSearchPlus), #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\ExpressionDetails, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\BSearchPlus) - (3 * SpaceInterFields), #PB_Ignore)  ;  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\GLine, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - ExternalMargin * 2 - 2, #PB_Ignore)  RepaintCanvasSeparator(GPBBGadgets\GLine, CalculateBorderColor(InterfaceColorPresets()\TextColor, InterfaceColorPresets()\BackGroundColor))  ;  MainPanelGadgetHeight = (WindowHeight(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - GadgetY(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget) - 27)  MainPanelGadgetWidth = (WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - 2 * ExternalMargin + 1)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, MainPanelGadgetWidth, MainPanelGadgetHeight)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\ListsPGadget, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, MainPanelGadgetWidth - 7, MainPanelGadgetHeight - 29)  ;  Protected PBarWidth         = WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) / 8  Protected TProgressBarWidth = GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\TProgressBar)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\EProgressBar, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - PBarWidth - ExternalMargin - 1, #PB_Ignore, PBarWidth, #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\TProgressBar, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - TProgressBarWidth - ExternalMargin, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore)  ;  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BStats, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - BWidth - ExternalMargin, #PB_Ignore, BWidth, #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BRefresh, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - BWidth - ExternalMargin - 21 - SpaceInterFields, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore)  ;  ResultInsideHeightDecal = 30  ResultInsideWidthDecal = 8  REGadgetsHeight = MainPanelGadgetHeight - ResultInsideHeightDecal  REGadgetsWidth = MainPanelGadgetWidth - ResultInsideWidthDecal  For TypeOfElement = 0 To #EndEnumPBBPanels - 1    If TypeOfElement = #ProcPBBPanel      REGadgetsWidth - 7      REGadgetsHeight - 29    EndIf    If IsGadget(NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(TypeOfElement))      ResizeGadget(NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(TypeOfElement), #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore, REGadgetsWidth, REGadgetsHeight)    EndIf  Next  ;  ReSizeREMenu()  ;  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BStick, #PB_Ignore, WindowHeight(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - 26, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BAbout, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\BQuit) - GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\BAbout) - ExternalMargin - SpaceInterFields, WindowHeight(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - 26, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BLanguage, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\BQuit) - GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\BAbout) - GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\BLanguage) - ExternalMargin - SpaceInterFields * 2, WindowHeight(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - 26, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore)  ResizeGadget(GPBBGadgets\BQuit, WindowWidth(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - GadgetWidth(GPBBGadgets\BQuit) - ExternalMargin, WindowHeight(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) - 26, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore)  ;  ; Redraw the WhiteBox with the new window dimensions:  GPBBGadgets\IWhiteOver = WhiteBoxOverWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)  ;EndProcedure;Procedure GUI_OpenPBBMainWindow(WSticky)  ;  ; Role: Opens the PBBrowser main window, creates all its gadgets, and registers keyboard shortcuts.  ;  Protected VPos, Panel, SubPanel  ;  GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow = OpenWindowFromPrefCoordonnates(PBBrowserPrefile$, "PureBasic Browser " + PBB_NumVersion$, 430, 400, #PB_Window_Invisible | #PB_Window_MinimizeGadget | #PB_Window_MaximizeGadget | #PB_Window_SystemMenu | #PB_Window_SizeGadget | #PB_Window_TitleBar)  ;  If IsWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)    ;    GetColorThemesFromPreferences(PBBrowserPrefile$)    SetWindowColor(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, InterfaceColorPresets()\BackGroundColor)    ApplyDarkModeToWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)    ;    WindowBounds(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, 430, 400, #PB_Ignore, #PB_Ignore)    StickyWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, WSticky)    BindEvent(#PB_Event_SizeWindow, @GUI_ResizePBBGadgets(), GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)    ;________________________________________________________    ;    ;     Creation of the gadgets in the main window    ;________________________________________________________    ;    ; In the following, many gadget dimensions are simply set to '1',    ; because the GUI_ResizePBBGadgets() procedure will resize them anyway.    ;    Protected ExternalMargin = 6    Protected UpMargin = 5    Protected TWidth = 115    ;    GPBBGadgets\AdrTitle = TextGadget(#PB_Any, ExternalMargin, UpMargin + 2, TWidth, 18, "")    GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget = StringGadget(#PB_Any, TWidth + 1 + ExternalMargin, UpMargin + 1, 1, 20, "", #PB_String_ReadOnly)    ;    GPBBGadgets\BChangeAdresse = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, 1, UpMargin, 1, 22, "")    ;    VPos = UpMargin + 20 + 5    ;    GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpressionTitle = TextGadget(#PB_Any, ExternalMargin, VPos + 2, TWidth, 20, "")    ;        GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget = StringGadget(#PB_Any, TWidth + 1 + ExternalMargin, VPos + 1, 1, 20, "")    ;    GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, 1, VPos, 1, 22, "")    ;    GPBBGadgets\Tooltip = InitBalloonToolTip(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)    ;    VPos + 21    ;    GPBBGadgets\ExpressionDetails = TextGadget(#PB_Any, ExternalMargin, VPos + 2, 1, 16, "", #PB_Text_Center)    GPBBGadgets\BSearchPlus = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, 1, VPos + 1, 1, 19, "+")    ;    VPos + 21    ;    ; Horizontal line of separation:    GPBBGadgets\GLine = CanvasGadget(#PB_Any, ExternalMargin, VPos, 1, 1)    ;    VPos + 5    ;    GPBBGadgets\TProgressBar = TextGadget(#PB_Any, 1, VPos - 1, 150, 15, "", #PB_Text_Right)    GPBBGadgets\EProgressBar = ProgressBarGadget(#PB_Any, 1, VPos + 14, 1, 8, 0, 100, #PB_ProgressBar_Smooth)    GPBBGadgets\BStats = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, 1, VPos, 70, 22, "")    HideGadgetEx(GPBBGadgets\BStats, #True)    ;    GPBBGadgets\BRefresh = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, 1, VPos, 22, 22, #RefreshSymbol$) ; "⟳"    HideGadgetEx(GPBBGadgets\BRefresh, #True)    ;    ; The creation of the panels for the PanelGadgets uses the arrays created in PBBrowserDeclarations.pb.    ; For each panel:    ; PBBPanelNames$() contains the name of the panel. This array has been updated in PBBrowserDeclarations.pb.    ; NoPBBPanel() will contain the panel number in its PanelGadget.    ;   For all panels of 'MainPanelGadget', we have NoPBBPanel(x) = x, but for the panels    ;   of 'ListsPGadget', for example, NoPBBPanel(#ProcPBBPanel) = 0, even though #ProcPBBPanel = 4.    ; NoGadgetPBBPanel() will contain the gadget number of the PanelGadget containing the panel,    ;   that is, 'MainPanelGadget' or 'ListsPGadget'.    ; NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel() will contain the number of the RichEdit gadget (EditorGadget) that will be created in the panel.    ; TypeElementOfPBBPanel(): in the case where the panel is a list panel of elements (procedures, structures, etc.),    ;   this array contains the corresponding element type (#PBBProcedure, #PBBStructure, #PBBMacro, etc.).    ; TypeElementOfPBBPanel() has been initialized in PBBrowserDeclarations.pb.    ;    GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget = PanelGadget(#PB_Any, ExternalMargin, VPos, 1, 1)      For Panel = #FilePBBPanel To #FoundInFilesPBBPanel        AddGadgetItem(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget, -1, "")        NoGadgetPBBPanel(Panel) = GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget        NoPBBPanel(Panel)       = Panel        If Panel = #ListPBBPanel          GPBBGadgets\ListsPGadget = PanelGadget(#PB_Any, 0, 0, 1, 1)            For SubPanel = #ProcPBBPanel To #EndEnumPBBPanels - 1              AddGadgetItem(GPBBGadgets\ListsPGadget, -1, "")              NoGadgetPBBPanel(SubPanel)     = GPBBGadgets\ListsPGadget              NoPBBPanel(SubPanel)           = SubPanel - #ProcPBBPanel              NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(SubPanel) = EditorGadget(#PB_Any, 0, 0, 1, 1)              SetREGadgetParam(NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(SubPanel))            Next          CloseGadgetList()        Else          NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(Panel) = EditorGadget(#PB_Any, 0, 0, 1, 1)          SetREGadgetParam(NoREGadgetOfPBBPanel(Panel))        EndIf      Next    CloseGadgetList()    ;    ; Clip overlapping top-level sibling controls (BStats, BRefresh, ProgressBar, BREMenu) out of MainPanelGadget's paint DC    SetWindowLongPtr_(GadgetID(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget), #GWL_STYLE,                      GetWindowLongPtr_(GadgetID(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget), #GWL_STYLE) | #WS_CLIPSIBLINGS)    SetWindowPos_(GadgetID(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget), 0, 0, 0, 0, 0,                  #SWP_NOMOVE | #SWP_NOSIZE | #SWP_NOZORDER | #SWP_FRAMECHANGED)    ;    GPBBGadgets\BREMenu = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, 1, 1, 20, 19, #HamburgerMenuSymbol$) ; "☰"    SetWindowPos_(GadgetID(GPBBGadgets\BREMenu), #HWND_TOP, 0, 0, 0, 0, #SWP_NOMOVE | #SWP_NOSIZE)    ;    GPBBGadgets\BStick = CheckBoxGadget(#PB_Any, ExternalMargin, 1, 100, 22, "")    SetGadgetState(GPBBGadgets\BStick, WSticky)    GPBBGadgets\BLanguage = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, ExternalMargin + 120 + 5, 1, 70, 22, "Language")    ;    GPBBGadgets\BAbout = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, 1, 1, 150, 22, "")    SetGadgetFont(GPBBGadgets\BAbout, PBBAllGadgetsFont)    GPBBGadgets\BQuit = ButtonGadget(#PB_Any, 1, 1, 60, 22, "")    ;    GUI_ResizePBBGadgets()    ;    ; Main window shortcuts.    ; The constants corresponding to these shortcuts are defined in 'PBBrowserDeclarations.pb'.    ;    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Return,                  #PBBMenu_Return)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Escape,                  #PBBMenu_Escape)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Tab,                     #PBBMenu_NextPanel)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Tab | #PB_Shortcut_Shift, #PBBMenu_PreviousPanel)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Up,                      #PBBMenu_Up)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Down,                    #PBBMenu_Down)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_PageUp,                  #PBBMenu_PageUp)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_PageDown,                #PBBMenu_PageDown)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Right,                   #PBBMenu_NextPage)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Left,                    #PBBMenu_PreviousPage)    ;    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_V, #PBBMenu_Paste)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_Q, #PBBMenu_Find)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_I, #PBBMenu_THAT)    ;    ; Hamburger menu shortcuts.    ; The constants corresponding to this menu are defined in 'PBBrowserDeclarations.pb'.    ;    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_Add,      #REM_ZoomIn)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #VK_OEM_PLUS,          #REM_ZoomIn)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_Subtract, #REM_ZoomOut)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #VK_OEM_MINUS,         #REM_ZoomOut)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_0,        #REM_ZoomReset)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_F,        #REM_FindInPannel)    ;    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_S,        #REM_SaveAsText)    AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Control | #PB_Shortcut_R,        #REM_SaveAsRTF)    ;    ; Create a semi-transparent white rectangle that will overlay the content of the window    ; when we want to show that the window is inactive.    GPBBGadgets\IWhiteOver = WhiteBoxOverWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)    ;    GUI_SetPBBGadgetsTitles()    ;    GUI_ColorizeAndSetFontsOfGadgets()    ;    ; The window was invisible until now, because we created it with #PB_Window_Invisible.    ; We make it visible now.    HideWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #False)    ;    ProcedureReturn #True  EndIfEndProcedure;; **********************************************************************************;;-               Background scheduler, IPC & main event loop;; **********************************************************************************;Define PBB_LastEventTime, StatReport$;Enumeration ExplorationUIStates  #ExpUI_Hidden  #ExpUI_Running  #ExpUI_CompletedEndEnumeration;Procedure SetExplorationUIState(UIState)  ;  ; Role: Synchronizes visibility of the exploration progress bar and the Statistics/Refresh buttons,  ;       skipping redundant Win32 visibility updates when the state is unchanged.  ;  Static CurrentUIState = -1  ;  If UIState = CurrentUIState    ProcedureReturn  EndIf  CurrentUIState = UIState  HideGadgetEx(GPBBGadgets\EProgressBar, Bool(UIState <> #ExpUI_Running))  HideGadgetEx(GPBBGadgets\TProgressBar, Bool(UIState <> #ExpUI_Running))  HideGadgetEx(GPBBGadgets\BStats,       Bool(UIState <> #ExpUI_Completed))  HideGadgetEx(GPBBGadgets\BRefresh,     Bool(UIState <> #ExpUI_Completed))EndProcedure;Procedure PBBUpdateMainFile(NewSFile$ = "", Refresh = 0, KeepHistory = #False)  ;  ; Role: Updates the project dependency tree and (re)starts deep exploration when needed.  ;  Shared ExecuteSearch, SearchNavigationIndex  Protected ProjectStructureChanged  ;  PBBFicPrincipalPB$ = SetListOfFiles(NewSFile$, #WorkInBackGround, @ProjectStructureChanged)  ;  If PBBFicPrincipalPB$ = "" Or ListSize(PBB_FileListing()) = 0    ClearList(PBB_FileListing())    ClearList(PBB_BinaryFileListing())    ClearList(PBB_CompilationSequence())    ClearList(ListOfSearches())    SearchNavigationIndex = 0    SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, "")  EndIf  ;  If ProjectStructureChanged Or Refresh    If KeepHistory = #False      ClearList(ListOfSearches())      ClearMap(VarPanelExpanded())      SearchNavigationIndex = 0      If OpenPreferencesWithPatience(PBBrowserPrefile$)        WritePreferenceString("FicPrincipalPB", PBBFicPrincipalPB$)        ClosePreferences()      EndIf    EndIf    If ProjectStructureChanged Or KeepHistory = #False      FillFileREGadget()    EndIf    If FileSize(PBBFicPrincipalPB$) > 2      SetExplorationUIState(#ExpUI_Running)      SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\BChangeAdresse, GetTextFromCatalogPB("Change"))      ClearAllElementsAndData()      ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Pending    Else      SetExplorationUIState(#ExpUI_Hidden)      SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\BChangeAdresse, GetTextFromCatalogPB("Open"))    EndIf  Else    UpdateAllFilesInMemory()  EndIfEndProcedure;Global PendingIDESearch.SearchDetails, PendingIDEExecuteSearch;Procedure ManagePBBBackgroundTasks(BackgroundTasksCompletion = 0, *LastSearch.SearchDetails = 0)  ;  ; Role: Cooperative background task scheduler called on each cycle of the main loop in 'PBBrowserMainProc()'.  ; Alternates bounded CPU time slices between OnePassSetElements() (AST indexing and usage propagation)  ; and FillFoundInREGadget() (incremental 'Found in...' population), suspending work for 20 ms on user activity.  ;  Shared RefreshEPanel, PBB_LastEventTime, ExecuteSearch, SearchNavigationIndex, StatReport$, PBBRichEditMessage  ;  Static LastTimeForExplorationEnding  Static StarttTimeForBackgroundExploration  Static TotOutTime  Static TaskTurn.b  Static WasExploring.b  ;  Protected Result, EventID  Protected RunGadgetThisTurn.b  ;  Enumeration PBB_BackgroundTasksState    #BackgroundTasksCompleted = 0    #BackgroundTasksUncompleted    #BackgroundExplorationHasPriority  EndEnumeration  ;  If FileSize(PBBFicPrincipalPB$) < 1 Or ListSize(PBB_FileListing()) = 0    SetExplorationUIState(#ExpUI_Hidden)    WasExploring = #False    ProcedureReturn 0  ElseIf PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish Or ExplorationState <> #ExplorationState_Completed    If BackgroundTasksCompletion <> #BackgroundExplorationHasPriority      BackgroundTasksCompletion = #BackgroundTasksUncompleted    EndIf  Else    ProcedureReturn 0  EndIf  ;  ; Poll the event queue without blocking and classify events explicitly by family  ; (avoiding unguarded EventType()/EventGadget() calls, which retain stale values on raw OS messages  ; such as #WM_PAINT, #WM_TIMER, or #WM_SYSTIMER and would falsely reset PBB_LastEventTime):  EventID = WindowEvent()  If PBBRichEditMessage Or EventID = #PB_Event_CloseWindow Or EventID = #PB_Event_Menu Or     (EventID >= #WM_KEYFIRST And EventID <= #WM_KEYLAST) Or     (EventID = #PB_Event_Gadget And EventGadget() <> GPBBGadgets\EProgressBar And EventGadget() <> GPBBGadgets\TProgressBar)    ; 1. Discrete user actions (RichEdit click, window close, menu/shortcut, keyboard, or user gadget):    ;    record activity timestamp and return EventID immediately to PBBrowserMainProc() so EventGadget()    ;    and EventType() cannot be overwritten by SetGadgetState(EProgressBar) during a work slice.    PBB_LastEventTime = ElapsedMilliseconds()    If BackgroundTasksCompletion <> #BackgroundExplorationHasPriority      ProcedureReturn EventID    EndIf  ElseIf (EventID >= #WM_MOUSEFIRST And EventID <= #WM_MOUSELAST) Or         EventID = #WM_NCLBUTTONDOWN Or EventID = #WM_VSCROLL    ; 2. Continuous mouse, title-bar drag, or RichEdit scrollbar activity:    ;    arm the 20 ms cooldown below to keep UI scrolling/dragging responsive without aborting priority tasks.    PBB_LastEventTime = ElapsedMilliseconds()  EndIf  ;  If (ElapsedMilliseconds() - PBB_LastEventTime) > 20 Or BackgroundTasksCompletion = #BackgroundExplorationHasPriority    If ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_MustRestart      ; Purge stale in-memory buffers whose disk timestamp changed so SetListOfFiles() reloads them fresh      ForEach PBB_FileListing()        If GetFileDate(PBB_FileListing()\FileName$, #PB_Date_Modified) <> PBB_FileListing()\FileLastMod          DeleteElement(PBB_FileListing())        EndIf      Next      PBBUpdateMainFile(PBBFicPrincipalPB$, #True, #True)      WasExploring = #False    EndIf    ;    If ExplorationState <> #ExplorationState_Completed And WasExploring = #False      LastTimeForExplorationEnding       = ElapsedMilliseconds()      StarttTimeForBackgroundExploration = LastTimeForExplorationEnding      TotOutTime                         = 0      WasExploring                       = #True    EndIf    ;    ; Arbitrate execution turn between UI gadget filling and AST background exploration    If PBBFillFoundInREGadgetMustFinish      If ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Completed        RunGadgetThisTurn = #True      ElseIf BackgroundTasksCompletion <> #BackgroundExplorationHasPriority        RunGadgetThisTurn = TaskTurn        TaskTurn          = Bool(TaskTurn = 0)      EndIf    EndIf    ;    If RunGadgetThisTurn      FillFoundInREGadget(0)    Else      StarttTimeForBackgroundExploration + ElapsedMilliseconds() - LastTimeForExplorationEnding      TotOutTime                         + ElapsedMilliseconds() - LastTimeForExplorationEnding      ;      Result = OnePassSetElements(Bool(BackgroundTasksCompletion = #BackgroundExplorationHasPriority) * #FinishCompletionNow)      If Result = #ExplorationState_Completed        ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_Completed        WasExploring     = #False        ;        StatReport$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("ExploringDuration")  + " : " + FormatNumber(ElapsedMilliseconds() - StarttTimeForBackgroundExploration, 0, ".", ",") + " ms." + #CR$        StatReport$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("EventManagement")    + " : " + FormatNumber(TotOutTime, 0, ".", ",") + " ms." + #CR$        StatReport$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("TotalExploringTime") + " : " + FormatNumber(ElapsedMilliseconds() - StarttTimeForBackgroundExploration + TotOutTime, 0, ".", ",") + " ms." + #CR$ + #CR$        ;        SetExplorationUIState(#ExpUI_Completed)        ;        ; Replay the initial IDE search with full AST visibility, or perform a standard post-exploration refresh        If PendingIDEExecuteSearch <> #PBBNoSearch          If *LastSearch            If ListSize(ListOfSearches()) > 0 And SearchNavigationIndex = ListSize(ListOfSearches())              LastElement(ListOfSearches())              If ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\ElementPurifiedName$ = PendingIDESearch\ElementPurifiedName$                DeleteElement(ListOfSearches())                SearchNavigationIndex = ListSize(ListOfSearches())              EndIf            EndIf            CopyStructure(@PendingIDESearch, *LastSearch, SearchDetails)          EndIf          ExecuteSearch           = PendingIDEExecuteSearch          PendingIDEExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch        Else          ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch        EndIf        RefreshEPanel = #True        ;      ElseIf Result = #ExplorationState_Error        Alert("Unexpected program error in 'OnePassSetElements()'.")        ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_MustRestart        WasExploring     = #False        ProcedureReturn      Else        LastTimeForExplorationEnding = ElapsedMilliseconds()      EndIf    EndIf  EndIf  ;  ProcedureReturn EventIDEndProcedure;Procedure PrepareIDESearch(*SearchParam.SearchDetails, IsColdStart = #False)  ;  ; Role: Initializes '*SearchParam', 'ExecuteSearch', and the active panel from IDE  ; startup or pipe arguments ('PBUnderCursor$', 'PBBEditorSourceFile$', 'PBUnderCursorPos').  ; Captures a clean snapshot in 'PendingIDESearch' whenever AST exploration is still in progress  ; so 'ManagePBBBackgroundTasks()' replays the exact IDE resolution once ElementList() is complete.  ;  Shared ExecuteSearch  Protected ActivePanel  ;  PendingIDEExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch  ;  If PBUnderCursor$    PrepareSearchDetailsElement(*SearchParam, PBUnderCursor$)    GetInfosFromContext(*SearchParam, PBBEditorSourceFile$, PBUnderCursorPos)    SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, *SearchParam\ElementName$)    ;    If IsSearchDetailsCompleted(*SearchParam, #False)      ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch | #PBBSearchFromIDE    Else      ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch | #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchFromIDE    EndIf    ;    If ExplorationState <> #ExplorationState_Completed      CopyStructure(*SearchParam, @PendingIDESearch, SearchDetails)      PendingIDEExecuteSearch = ExecuteSearch      If *SearchParam\SearchInCom = #False And *SearchParam\SearchInQuotes = #False        ExecuteSearch & ~#PBBUserWillChoose      EndIf    EndIf    ;    ActivePanel = GetActivePBBPanel()    If IsColdStart Or (ActivePanel <> #FoundInFilesPBBPanel And ActivePanel <> #DetailPBBPanel)      SetActivePBBPanel(#FoundInFilesPBBPanel)    EndIf    SetActiveGadget(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel())  Else    SetActivePBBPanel(#FilePBBPanel)    If IsColdStart      SetActiveGadget(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget)    Else      SetActiveGadget(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel())    EndIf  EndIfEndProcedure;Procedure ManagePipeMessages(*SearchParam.SearchDetails)  ;  ; Role: Polls the named pipe for incoming connections from secondary PBBrowser instances,  ;       always brings the main window to the foreground on connection, updates known paths  ;       when provided, and triggers PrepareIDESearch() only when cursor info or a new main file arrives.  ;  Shared PBB_LastEventTime  Protected NewArgument$, NewProgAddr$, NewMainFile$  Protected PipeConnected, MainFileChanged  ;  NewArgument$ = ListenForPipeMessages(@PipeConnected)  If PipeConnected    CompilerIf #PBBReport      If OPDMod & #OPDFillFoundInTiming        OPDReport("**** Data received from IDE ****")      EndIf    CompilerEndIf    ;    ; Always bring PBBrowser to the foreground, even if launched without arguments    If GetWindowState(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow) = #PB_Window_Minimize      SetWindowState(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Window_Normal)    EndIf    SetForegroundWindow_(WindowID(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow))    SetFocus_(WindowID(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow))    BringWindowToTop_(WindowID(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow))    PBB_LastEventTime = ElapsedMilliseconds()    ;    If NewArgument$ <> ""      NewProgAddr$ = StringField(NewArgument$, 1, #CR$)      If NewProgAddr$ <> ""        PureBasicProgAddr$ = NewProgAddr$        If OpenPreferencesWithPatience(PBBrowserPrefile$)          WritePreferenceString("PureBasicProgAdr", PureBasicProgAddr$)          ClosePreferences()        EndIf      EndIf      ;      NewMainFile$ = StringField(NewArgument$, 3, #CR$)      If NewMainFile$ <> ""        MainFileChanged      = Bool(LCase(NewMainFile$) <> LCase(PBBFicPrincipalPB$))        PBBEditorSourceFile$ = NewMainFile$        PBBUpdateMainFile(PBBEditorSourceFile$)      EndIf      ;      NewProgAddr$ = StringField(NewArgument$, 2, #CR$)      If NewProgAddr$ <> "" Or Val(StringField(NewArgument$, 4, #CR$)) > 0 Or MainFileChanged        PBUnderCursor$   = NewProgAddr$        PBUnderCursorPos = Val(StringField(NewArgument$, 4, #CR$))        PrepareIDESearch(*SearchParam, #False)      EndIf    EndIf  EndIfEndProcedure;; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;                 ---- External dialogs & code tools includes ----; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------; Included here so they have access to all core engines and UI helpers defined above:;XIncludeFile("PBB_SearchReplaceWindow.pb");XIncludeFile "PBB_NativeTools.pb"XIncludeFile "PBB_CustomTools.pb"XIncludeFile "PBB_SignatureTool.pb"XIncludeFile "PBB_CodeFlattener.pb";; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;                           ---- Main event loop ----; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------;Procedure PBBrowserMainProc(WSticky = #PB_Default)  ;  ; Role: Runs the main event loop to process user interactions within the PBBrowser main window.  ; The loop also includes calls to:  ; - ManagePBBBackgroundTasks() to handle background data updates and post-exploration IDE replays,  ; - ManagePipeMessages() to retrieve parameters sent to PBBrowser in real time by the PureBasic IDE,  ; - UpdateAllFilesInMemory() to account for any changes in the user's project files.  ;  Shared RefreshEPanel             ; When this variable is non-zero, it triggers a refresh of the display for certain panels.                                   ; This is managed by the ManagePBBBackgroundTasks() procedure, which can set it to #True.  ;  Shared PBBRichEditMessage, PBBREGadgetID, RangeOfClic.CHARRANGE ; To handle clicks on pseudo-links. These variables are updated                                                                  ; by the PBBRichEditCallback() procedure.  ;  Shared ExecuteSearch             ; This variable tells PBBrowserMainProc that a new search should be started                                   ; and how this search must be performed.                                   ; It is shared by ManagePBBBackgroundTasks(), ManagePipeMessages(),                                   ; ClickOverREGadget(), and many other functions.  ;  Shared SearchNavigationIndex     ; Holds the current 1-based position in ListOfSearches().  ;  Shared StatReport$               ; Holds statistics on the exploration of the code.  ;  Shared SearchMenuChoices()       ; Populated by GetInfosFromData(), this list will contain a selection of items                                   ; corresponding to the data being searched for.  ;  Protected TFileLength, TLines, StatReport2$ ; Used for statistics display.  ;  Protected EventID, EventGadget, EventMenu, QuitAll, NoREGadget, ActPannel ; For event handling.  ;  Protected PBB_LastUpdateTime ; Used to measure the time since the last check of the files.  ;  ; Other variables:  Protected TypeOfElement, SExpression$, StrRef.String, pd, pf, LineCtx, NbrOfElements  Protected FileName$, NFile$  Protected LastSearch.SearchDetails, txtrange.CHARRANGE, scrollPos.POINT  Protected SearchFieldHasFocus, IsFromScopeSelection, IsFromFRCheckboxToggle, IsFromFRWindow  Protected KeepSearchFieldFocus, SearchResult, IsDirectUserSearch, IsCurrentHistoryMatch  ;  PrepareSearchDetailsElement(LastSearch, "")  ;  If WSticky = #PB_Default And OpenPreferencesWithPatience(PBBrowserPrefile$)    WSticky = ReadPreferenceLong("WSticky", 1)    ClosePreferences()  EndIf  ;  If GUI_OpenPBBMainWindow(WSticky)    ;    If PBUnderCursor$ = ""      SetActiveGadget(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget)      SearchFieldHasFocus = #True    EndIf    ;    PBBUpdateMainFile(PBBFicPrincipalPB$)    ;________________________________________________________    ;    ;     Initializing searches and exploration    ;    PrepareIDESearch(@LastSearch, #True)    ;    If PBBFirstLaunch      ; Paint the main window immediately and prompt once to open the Help and Tools window      PBBFirstLaunch = 0      UpdateWindow_(WindowID(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow))      If AlertInPBBWindow(GetTextFromCatalogPB("WantToSeeHelp"), "", 1, 0, 0, 0, "", #AW_YesOrNo_YesByDefault) = #PB_MessageRequester_Yes        DisablePBBWindow()        THATProc()        GUI_UpdatePBBMenus()        EnablePBBWindow()      EndIf    EndIf    ;    Repeat      ;      ; Ensure that clicks on PBBrowser gadgets are properly transmitted when the window      ; was inactive at the time of the click:      TransfertClickToGadget()      ;      EventID = ManagePBBBackgroundTasks(0, @LastSearch)      If EventID = 0        EventID = WaitWindowEvent(200)        ;        ; Every half-second, check if a file has been modified,        ; in order to update our data and display:        If (EventID = 0 Or EventID = #WM_TIMER) And (ElapsedMilliseconds() - PBB_LastUpdateTime) > 500          PBB_LastUpdateTime = ElapsedMilliseconds()          UpdateAllFilesInMemory()        EndIf      EndIf      ;      ; In each cycle, check if data has been received      ; from another instance:      ManagePipeMessages(LastSearch)      ;      ; Dispatch events belonging to the Find/Replace dialog first      IsFromScopeSelection   = Bool(EventID = #PB_Event_Menu And EventMenu() >= #PBBMenu_SearchResultsOffset And                                    EventMenu() < (#PBBMenu_SearchResultsOffset + 100))      IsFromFRCheckboxToggle = #False      IsFromFRWindow         = GUI_FR_HandleEvent(EventID, @LastSearch)      If IsFromFRWindow        If EventID = #PB_Event_Gadget          If EventGadget() = FR_Gadgets\Scopes            IsFromScopeSelection = #True          ElseIf EventGadget() = FR_Gadgets\IgnoreComments Or EventGadget() = FR_Gadgets\IgnoreStrings            IsFromFRCheckboxToggle = #True          EndIf        EndIf        EventID = 0      EndIf      ;      If EventWindow() <> GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow        EventID = 0      EndIf      ;      If EventWindow() = GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow Or PBBRichEditMessage Or ExecuteSearch Or RefreshEPanel        ;        EventGadget = 0        ;        If EventID = #PB_Event_CloseWindow          QuitAll = 1        ElseIf EventID = #PB_Event_Menu          ;          EventMenu = EventMenu()          ;          If EventMenu = #PBBMenu_Return ; Press Return.            EventID = #PB_Event_Gadget            EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_Escape ; Press Escape.            QuitAll = 1          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_Paste ; Press CTRL V.            If GetActiveGadget() = GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget              SendMessage_(GadgetID(GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget), #WM_PASTE, 0, 0)            Else              PendingIDEExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch              ExecuteSearch           = #PBBNoSearch              FillFoundInREGadget(0, #WorkInBackGround, #True)              If GetActiveGadget() <> GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget                SendMessage_(GadgetID(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget), #EM_SETSEL, 0, -1)              EndIf              SendMessage_(GadgetID(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget), #WM_PASTE, 0, 0)              If GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget) <> ""                SetSearchButtonState(#PBBSearchBtn_Search, #True)                EventID     = #PB_Event_Gadget                EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression              EndIf            EndIf          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_Find ; Press CTRL Q.            ActPannel    = GetActivePBBPanel()            NoREGadget   = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()            SExpression$ = ""            If NoREGadget And (ActPannel = #DetailPBBPanel Or ActPannel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel)              TOM_GetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, @txtrange)              If txtrange\cpMax > txtrange\cpMin                SExpression$ = ReplaceString(TOM_GetText(NoREGadget), #LF$, "")                ; Strip leading and trailing whitespace or line breaks while keeping selection offsets aligned                While SExpression$ <> ""                  pd = Asc(Left(SExpression$, 1))                  If pd = #Space Or pd = #NonBreakableSpace Or pd = #CR                    SExpression$ = Mid(SExpression$, 2)                    txtrange\cpMin + 1                  Else                    Break                  EndIf                Wend                While SExpression$ <> ""                  pd = Asc(Right(SExpression$, 1))                  If pd = #Space Or pd = #NonBreakableSpace Or pd = #CR                    SExpression$ = Left(SExpression$, Len(SExpression$) - 1)                    txtrange\cpMax - 1                  Else                    Break                  EndIf                Wend              EndIf            EndIf            ;            If SExpression$ <> ""              PrepareSearchDetailsElement(LastSearch, SExpression$)              LineCtx = #CodeCtx_Code              If ActPannel = #DetailPBBPanel                ; 1. Fast-path O(1) resolution via pre-populated DetailPanelLinks() (never matches comments or quotes)                If LastSearch\NotAnElement = #False                  ForEach DetailPanelLinks()                    If DetailPanelLinks()\StartOffset = txtrange\cpMin And                       (DetailPanelLinks()\EndOffset = txtrange\cpMax Or                        (DetailPanelLinks()\EndOffset = txtrange\cpMax + 2 And                         DetailPanelLinks()\TargetDetails\ElementPurifiedName$ = LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$))                      CopyStructure(@DetailPanelLinks()\TargetDetails, @LastSearch, SearchDetails)                      If DetailPanelLinks()\ForceUserChoice                        ExecuteSearch = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact                      Else                        ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch                      EndIf                      Break                    EndIf                  Next                EndIf                ;                ; 2. Detect comment/quote context on the declaration header or code body, or resolve code context                If ExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch                  StrRef\s = ReplaceString(GetGadgetText(NoREGadget), #LF$, "")                  pf       = FindString(StrRef\s, #CR$)                  If DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos > 0 And                     (txtrange\cpMin >= DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos Or                      (DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID > 0 And (pf = 0 Or txtrange\cpMin < pf - 1)))                    LineCtx = CheckCodeLineContext(@StrRef, txtrange\cpMin + 1, #True)                  EndIf                  ;                  If LineCtx = #CodeCtx_Comment                    LastSearch\SearchInCom    = #True                    ExecuteSearch             = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact                  ElseIf LineCtx = #CodeCtx_Quote                    LastSearch\SearchInQuotes = #True                    ExecuteSearch             = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact                  ElseIf LastSearch\NotAnElement = #False                    If txtrange\cpMin < DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos                      If SelectPBBElement(DetailPanelContext\ElementFixedID) And                         ElementList()\PurifiedName = LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$                        FillSearchDetailsFromElement(@ElementList(), @LastSearch)                        ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch                      EndIf                    ElseIf DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos > 0 And IsFileInMemory(DetailPanelContext\FileName$)                      pd = MapDetailCodeClickToFilePos(StrRef, txtrange\cpMin, DetailPanelContext\EndIntroPos,                                                       DetailPanelContext\FileName$, DetailPanelContext\ElementStartingPos)                      pf = Len(LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$)                      ; Verify full token boundaries in the file buffer so partial substrings are not auto-expanded by BuildLayout()                      If pd > 0 And                         FastMid(PBB_FileListing()\FileLCaseContentInList\s, pd, pf) = LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$ And                         (pd = 1 Or (FastMid(PBB_FileListing()\FileLCaseContentInList\s, pd - 1, 1) <> "#" And                                     IsPBSeparator(Asc(FastMid(PBB_FileListing()\FileLCaseContentInList\s, pd - 1, 1))))) And                         IsPBSeparator(Asc(FastMid(PBB_FileListing()\FileLCaseContentInList\s, pd + pf, 1)))                        GetInfosFromContext(LastSearch, DetailPanelContext\FileName$, pd)                        If IsSearchDetailsCompleted(LastSearch, #True) And LastSearch\TypeOfElement <> #PBBNotAnElement                          ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch                        EndIf                      EndIf                    EndIf                  EndIf                EndIf              ElseIf ActPannel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel                ; Check if the selected text in FoundInFiles belongs to a ';' comment marker or '"..."' string marker                StrRef\s = ReplaceString(GetGadgetText(NoREGadget), #LF$, "")                pd       = txtrange\cpMin                While pd > 0                  pf = Asc(FastMid(StrRef\s, pd, 1))                  If pf = #Space Or pf = #NonBreakableSpace Or pf = '('                    pd - 1                  Else                    Break                  EndIf                Wend                If pd >= 1 And FastMid(StrRef\s, pd, 1) = ";"                  LastSearch\SearchInCom    = #True                  ExecuteSearch             = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact                ElseIf pd >= 5 And FastMid(StrRef\s, pd - 4, 5) = #DOUBLEQUOTE$ + "..." + #DOUBLEQUOTE$                  LastSearch\SearchInQuotes = #True                  ExecuteSearch             = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact                EndIf              EndIf              ;              SetActivePBBPanel(#FoundInFilesPBBPanel)              If ExecuteSearch <> #PBBNoSearch                SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, LastSearch\ElementName$)              Else                ; Normal code selection in FoundInFiles, partial substring, or complex expression: run a direct user search                SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, SExpression$)                SetSearchButtonState(#PBBSearchBtn_Search, #True)                EventID     = #PB_Event_Gadget                EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression              EndIf            Else              ; No text selected: focus the search input field (automatically arming Search mode and selecting its text)              SetActiveGadget(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget)            EndIf          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_THAT ; Press CTRL I or select from the menu.            DisablePBBWindow()            ; Open 'Help and Tools'.            THATProc()            ; Refresh the menu.            GUI_UpdatePBBMenus()            EnablePBBWindow()            ;            ; Navigation commands:            ;          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_Prefs            DisablePBBWindow()            PBBSetParameters()            EnablePBBWindow()            GUI_ColorizeAndSetFontsOfGadgets()            GUI_FR_ColorizeAndSetFontsOfGadgets()            RefreshEPanel = #True            If ExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch : ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch : EndIf            ;          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_NextPanel            WalkOverPannels(1, LastSearch)          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_PreviousPanel            WalkOverPannels(-1, LastSearch)          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_PageUp            NoREGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()            SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #WM_VSCROLL, #SB_PAGEUP, 0)          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_PageDown            NoREGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()            SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #WM_VSCROLL, #SB_PAGEDOWN, 0)          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_Up            NoREGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()            SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #WM_VSCROLL, #SB_LINEUP, 0)          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_Down            NoREGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()            SendMessage_(GadgetID(NoREGadget), #WM_VSCROLL, #SB_LINEDOWN, 0)          ElseIf EventMenu = #PBBMenu_NextPage Or EventMenu = #PBBMenu_PreviousPage            pd        = 1 - 2 * Bool(EventMenu = #PBBMenu_PreviousPage)            ActPannel = GetActivePBBPanel()            If (ActPannel <> #DetailPBBPanel And ActPannel <> #FoundInFilesPBBPanel) Or WalkOverPages(pd, LastSearch) = #False              WalkOverPannels(pd, LastSearch)            EndIf            ;          ElseIf EventMenu >= #PBBMenu_SearchResultsOffset And EventMenu < (#PBBMenu_SearchResultsOffset + 100)            SelectSearchScopeChoice(EventMenu - #PBBMenu_SearchResultsOffset, @LastSearch, #True)            ;            ; Tool commands:            ;          ElseIf EventMenu >= #PBBMenu_CommandOffset And EventMenu < (#PBBMenu_CommandOffset + 100)            ExecCommandFromPBBWindow(EventMenu - #PBBMenu_CommandOffset)            ;            ; Hamburger menu commands:            ;          ElseIf EventMenu = #REM_ZoomIn            RE_AdjustZoom(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel(), 10)            ReSizeREMenu()          ElseIf EventMenu = #REM_ZoomOut            RE_AdjustZoom(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel(), -10)            ReSizeREMenu()          ElseIf EventMenu = #REM_ZoomReset            RE_AdjustZoom(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel(), 0)            ReSizeREMenu()          ElseIf EventMenu = #REM_FindInPannel            RE_FindReplace(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel(), 0, GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)          ElseIf EventMenu = #REM_CopyAll            TOM_Copy(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel(), 0, #EndOfText)          ElseIf EventMenu = #REM_SaveAsText            NFile$ = SaveFileRequester(GetTextFromCatalogPB("SaveAs"), "", GetTextFromCatalogPB("TextFile"), 1)            If NFile$              NFile$ = ChangeFileExtension(NFile$, "txt")              RE_SaveContent(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel(), NFile$, #SF_TEXT)            EndIf          ElseIf EventMenu = #REM_SaveAsRTF            NFile$ = SaveFileRequester(GetTextFromCatalogPB("SaveAs"), "", GetTextFromCatalogPB("RTFFile"), 1)            If NFile$              NFile$ = ChangeFileExtension(NFile$, "RTF")              RE_SaveContent(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel(), NFile$, #SF_RTF, 1)            EndIf          EndIf        ElseIf EventID = #PB_Event_Gadget          EventGadget = EventGadget()          ;          If SearchNavigationIndex > 0 And SearchNavigationIndex <= ListSize(ListOfSearches()) And EventGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()            ActPannel = GetActivePBBPanel()            If ActPannel = #DetailPBBPanel Or ActPannel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel              SelectElement(ListOfSearches(), SearchNavigationIndex - 1)              SendMessage_(GadgetID(EventGadget), #EM_GETSCROLLPOS, 0, @scrollPos)              If ActPannel = #DetailPBBPanel                ListOfSearches()\Search_DetailScrollPos = scrollPos              Else                ListOfSearches()\Search_FoundInScrollPos = scrollPos              EndIf            EndIf          EndIf        EndIf        ;        ; Repositioning the hamburger button for REGadgets.        ;        If EventID = #WM_LBUTTONDOWN Or EventID = #WM_LBUTTONUP          ReSizeREMenu()        EndIf        ;        ; Handling clicks on pseudo-links.        ;        ; (PBBRichEditMessage and PBBREGadgetID are updated by the PBBRichEditCallback() procedure).        ;        If PBBRichEditMessage = #WM_LBUTTONUP Or PBBRichEditMessage = #WM_RBUTTONUP ; Click inside one of the RichEditGadgets.          ;          NoREGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()          If NoREGadget And GadgetID(NoREGadget) = PBBREGadgetID            ClickOverREGadget(PBBRichEditMessage, LastSearch)          EndIf          PBBRichEditMessage = 0        ElseIf PBBRichEditMessage = #WM_LBUTTONDBLCLK          PBBRichEditMessage = 0          ; The user double-clicked inside the content of a RichEdit Gadget,          ; which likely resulted in selecting a portion of text.          ; Check if the double-click occurred in the 'Details' panel or in the 'Found in...' panel.          If GetActivePBBPanel() = #DetailPBBPanel Or GetActivePBBPanel() = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel            NoREGadget = GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel()            ;            ; First, check if the double-click occurred on an image-button.            ; This can happen if the user clicks too frantically            ; on the [<] or [>] buttons.            If GetImageNameFromSelectionPos(NoREGadget) = ""              ;              ; Now check if it might be useful to expand the selection,              ; because by default, the selection made by Windows during              ; a double-click in a RichEdit control stops at the underscore ('_')              ; and does not include the '$' and '#' characters that are part of identifier names.              ;              ; Retrieve the text from the gadget:              StrRef\s = ReplaceString(GetGadgetText(NoREGadget), #LF$, "")              ;              ; Get the position of the last click recorded by PBBRichEditCallback:              pd = RangeOfClic\cpMin + 1              pf = RangeOfClic\cpMax + 1              ;              ; Expand the selection until a separator is found on both sides.              While pd And (IsPBSeparator(Asc(FastMid(StrRef\s, pd, 1))) = #False Or FastMid(StrRef\s, pd, 1) = "*" Or FastMid(StrRef\s, pd, 1) = "#") : pd - 1 : Wend              pd + 1              While pf <= Len(StrRef\s) And IsPBSeparator(Asc(FastMid(StrRef\s, pf, 1))) = #False : pf + 1 : Wend              ; Apply the expanded selection in the text.              TOM_SetSelectionPos(NoREGadget, pd - 1, pf - 1)            EndIf          EndIf        EndIf        ;        ; Handling classic gadgets.        ;        If EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BQuit          QuitAll = 1        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BStick          StickyWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, GetGadgetState(GPBBGadgets\BStick))          If OpenPreferencesWithPatience(PBBrowserPrefile$) ; PBBrowserPrefile$ is a global variable.            WritePreferenceLong("WSticky", GetGadgetState(GPBBGadgets\BStick))            ClosePreferences()          EndIf          ;        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BStats          ;          ; ---- Display statistics ----          ;          TFileLength = 0          TLines = 0          ;          ForEach PBB_FileListing()            TFileLength + FileSize(PBB_FileListing()\FileName$)            TLines + CountString(PBB_FileListing()\FileContentInList\s, #CR$)          Next          StatReport2$ = GetTextFromCatalogPB("TFileLength")      + " : " + FormatNumber(TFileLength, 0, ".", ",") + " bytes / "          StatReport2$ + FormatNumber(TLines, 0, ".", ",") + " " + GetTextFromCatalogPB("Lines") + "." + #CR$ + #CR$          StatReport2$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB("ElementUsedOrNot") + #CR$          ;          ; Add the number of existing and used elements:          For TypeOfElement = #PBBProcedure To #EndEnumPBBElementTypes - 1            NbrOfElements = 0            ForEach ElementList()              If ElementList()\Type = TypeOfElement                NbrOfElements + 1              EndIf            Next            StatReport2$ + GetTextFromCatalogPB(PBBTypeNames$(TypeOfElement)) + ": " +                           Str(NbrOfElements) + " / " + Str(ListOfUsedElementsNbr(TypeOfElement)) + "." + #CR$          Next          ;          AlertInPBBWindow(StatReport$ + StatReport2$, GetTextFromCatalogPB("Statistics"))          ;        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BRefresh          ; Trigger a complete tree, DeadZone, and AST element rebuild via ManagePBBBackgroundTasks():          ExplorationState = #ExplorationState_MustRestart          Continue          ;        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BAbout          ;          ; Display 'Help and Tools' menu.          ;          DisplayPopupMenu(GPBBGadgets\Menu, WindowID(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow))          ;        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BLanguage          ;          ; Language choice:          ;          If OpenPreferencesWithPatience(PBBrowserPrefile$)            PBBLanguageFolder$ = ReadPreferenceString("PBBLanguageFolder", "")            ClosePreferences()          Else            Alert("Error while opening preference file.")            End          EndIf          ;          DisablePBBWindow()          ;          PBBLanguageFolder$ = ChooseLanguage(MyAppDataFolder$ + "Catalogs\", PBBLanguageFolder$)          If OpenPreferencesWithPatience(PBBrowserPrefile$)            WritePreferenceString("PBBLanguageFolder", PBBLanguageFolder$)            ClosePreferences()          EndIf          ;          EnablePBBWindow()          ;          GetTextFromCatalog("", PBBLanguageFolder$ + "PBBrowser.catalog")          GUI_SetPBBGadgetsTitles()          If FR_Gadgets\Window >= 0 And IsWindow(FR_Gadgets\Window)            GUI_FR_SetGadgetsTitles()          EndIf          RefreshEPanel = #True          If ExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch : ExecuteSearch = #PBBRefreshSearch : EndIf          ;        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BSearchPlus          GUI_FR_OpenWindow(GetGadgetState(GPBBGadgets\BStick), WindowID(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow), @LastSearch)          ;        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BREMenu          ;          ; Display the hamburger menu for REGadgets.          ;          DisplayPopupMenu(GPBBGadgets\REMenu, WindowID(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow))          ;        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget And (GetActivePBBPanel() = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel Or GetActivePBBPanel() = #DetailPBBPanel) And EventType() = #PB_EventType_Change          ; While navigating inside the panels, the user just triggered the display          ; of the "Details" panel or the "Found in..." panel.          ; Project the active search entry onto the newly selected panel ('Details' or 'Found in...')          ; without re-running GetInfosFromData() or overwriting multi-scope popup selections.          WalkOverPages(0, LastSearch)          ;        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BChangeAdresse          FileName$ = OpenFileRequester(GetTextFromCatalogPB("SelectMainFile"), PBBFicPrincipalPB$, "PureBasic (pb,pbi,pbp)|*.pb;*.pbi;*pbp", 1)          ; The user just changed the address of the main file.          If FileName$            SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, "")            SetActivePBBPanel(#FilePBBPanel)            PBBUpdateMainFile(FileName$)          EndIf        ElseIf EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget Or EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget          Select EventType()            Case #PB_EventType_Focus              If GetActiveGadget() = EventGadget                ; Disable Left/Right page navigation shortcuts while editing inside a StringGadget                RemoveKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Right)                RemoveKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Left)                If EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget And SearchFieldHasFocus = #False                  ; Newly acquired focus (excluding Alt+Tab return while already editing): arm "Search" mode and select all                  SearchFieldHasFocus = #True                  SetSearchButtonState(#PBBSearchBtn_Search, Bool(GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget) <> ""))                  PostMessage_(GadgetID(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget), #EM_SETSEL, 0, -1)                EndIf              EndIf            Case #PB_EventType_LostFocus              If GetActiveGadget() <> GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget And GetActiveGadget() <> GPBBGadgets\Adr_gadget                AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Right, #PBBMenu_NextPage)                AddKeyboardShortcut(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow, #PB_Shortcut_Left, #PBBMenu_PreviousPage)              EndIf              If EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget And GetActiveWindow() <> -1                ; Focus moved to another PBBrowser gadget or dialog (not an external Alt+Tab deactivation)                SearchFieldHasFocus = #False              EndIf            Case #PB_EventType_Change              ; Only switch to "Search" mode when the user actively edits the focused search field              ; (ignores programmatic SetGadgetText() updates), and cancel any deferred IDE replay.              If EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget And SearchFieldHasFocus And                 GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget) <> LastSearch\ElementName$                PendingIDEExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch                SetSearchButtonState(#PBBSearchBtn_Search, Bool(GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget) <> ""))              EndIf          EndSelect        EndIf        ;        If (EventID = #PB_Event_Gadget And EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression) Or (ExecuteSearch <> #PBBNoSearch)          ;          ; Determine whether the user is actively focused inside SearchedExpression_gadget during a passive refresh          KeepSearchFieldFocus = Bool(SearchFieldHasFocus And GetActiveGadget() = GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget And                                      (EventID <> #PB_Event_Gadget Or EventGadget <> GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression) And                                      IsFromScopeSelection = #False And IsFromFRWindow = #False And                                      (ExecuteSearch & (#PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchFromIDE)) = 0)          ;          ; Cancel any deferred pre-exploration IDE replay if the user initiated a manual search in the meantime          If (ExecuteSearch & #PBBSearchFromIDE) = 0 And KeepSearchFieldFocus = #False            PendingIDEExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch          EndIf          ;          If KeepSearchFieldFocus            ; Never submit half-typed text on passive background refreshes; refresh LastSearch in place only if untouched            If LastSearch\ElementName$ <> "" And GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget) = LastSearch\ElementName$              SExpression$ = LastSearch\ElementName$            Else              SExpression$ = ""            EndIf          Else            SExpression$ = GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget)          EndIf          ;          If SExpression$            SearchResult       = #PBBNotFound            IsDirectUserSearch = Bool(ExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch)            ;            ; -------------------------------------------------------------------            ; 1. SYNCHRONIZATION            ; -------------------------------------------------------------------            ; Synchronize in-memory file buffers with disk state before AST evaluation            CompilerIf #PBBReport              If OPDMod & #OPDFollowSearchAndIdentification                OPDReport("Entering search section / UpdateAllFilesInMemory")              EndIf            CompilerEndIf            UpdateAllFilesInMemory()            ;            ; -------------------------------------------------------------------            ; 2. SEARCH RESOLUTION & DISPATCH            ; -------------------------------------------------------------------            ;            If ExecuteSearch & #PBBSearchRawText              ; Raw text mode bypasses semantic AST resolution entirely.              ; Purified matching scans literal occurrences across all project sequences.              LastSearch\SearchPurifiedOnly = #True              SearchResult = #PBBNativeFunction            ElseIf IsFromScopeSelection              ; Candidate traits were already copied from SearchMenuChoices() into LastSearch              ; by SelectSearchScopeChoice(): bypass GetInfosFromData() to preserve the exact user choice.              SearchResult = LastSearch\TypeOfElement              SetSearchButtonState(#PBBSearchBtn_LookUp, Bool(LastSearch\MultipleResults > 1), LastSearch\MultipleResults)            Else              ; Semantic resolution path (AST element matching)              If IsDirectUserSearch                ; Triggered directly by the search button or Return key:                ExecuteSearch = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchExact                If GetGadgetData(GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression) = #PBBSearchBtn_LookUp                  ; Button is in "LookUp" ("Voir") mode: relax constraints while preserving comment/string flags                  pd = LastSearch\SearchInCom                  pf = LastSearch\SearchInQuotes                  PrepareSearchDetailsElement(LastSearch, SExpression$)                  LastSearch\DontCheckPosition = #True                  LastSearch\VarDotType$       = ""                  LastSearch\HasParentheses    = -1                  LastSearch\SearchInCom       = pd                  LastSearch\SearchInQuotes    = pf                Else                  PrepareSearchDetailsElement(LastSearch, SExpression$)                EndIf              EndIf              ;              ; When the search was triggered outside the Find/Replace window (IDE pipe, panel click,              ; CTRL+Q, or main Search button), synchronize FR_Gadgets before GetInfosFromData()              ; so SelectSearchScopeChoice() reads the updated expression if multiple scopes match:              If IsFromFRWindow = #False And FR_Gadgets\Window >= 0 And IsWindow(FR_Gadgets\Window)                GUI_FR_SyncGadgetsWithSearch(@LastSearch)              EndIf              ;              If IsDirectUserSearch                CompilerIf #PBBReport                  If OPDMod & #OPDFollowSearchAndIdentification                    OPDReport("From user (exact): " + SExpression$)                  EndIf                CompilerEndIf                SearchResult = GetInfosFromData(LastSearch, ExecuteSearch)                ;                ; If exact search found nothing, strip any dotType/parentheses and retry with #PBBJoker$ before and after                If SearchResult = #PBBNotFound And LastSearch\NotAnElement = #False And LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$ <> ""                  SExpression$ = StringField(StringField(Trim(SExpression$, #PBBJoker$), 1, "("), 1, ".")                  SExpression$ = #PBBJoker$ + SExpression$ + #PBBJoker$                  pd = LastSearch\SearchInCom                  pf = LastSearch\SearchInQuotes                  PrepareSearchDetailsElement(LastSearch, SExpression$)                  If GetGadgetData(GPBBGadgets\BSearchExpression) = #PBBSearchBtn_LookUp                    LastSearch\DontCheckPosition = #True                    LastSearch\HasParentheses    = -1                    LastSearch\SearchInCom       = pd                    LastSearch\SearchInQuotes    = pf                  EndIf                  CompilerIf #PBBReport                    If OPDMod & #OPDFollowSearchAndIdentification                      OPDReport("From user (joker fallback): " + LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$)                    EndIf                  CompilerEndIf                  SearchResult = GetInfosFromData(LastSearch, ExecuteSearch)                EndIf              Else                IsCurrentHistoryMatch = #False                If (ExecuteSearch & #PBBRefreshSearch) And                   (ExecuteSearch & (#PBBSearchFromIDE | #PBBUserWillChoose)) = 0 And                   LastSearch\SearchPurifiedOnly = #False And                   SearchNavigationIndex > 0 And SearchNavigationIndex <= ListSize(ListOfSearches())                  SelectElement(ListOfSearches(), SearchNavigationIndex - 1)                  IsCurrentHistoryMatch = Bool(ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\ElementPurifiedName$ = LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$ And                                               ListOfSearches()\Search_Details\DontCheckPosition = LastSearch\DontCheckPosition)                EndIf                SearchResult = GetInfosFromData(LastSearch, ExecuteSearch)                ;                ; Re-evaluate or synchronize the active history entry during passive refreshes                If IsCurrentHistoryMatch                  SelectElement(ListOfSearches(), SearchNavigationIndex - 1)                  If SearchResult = #PBBNotFound                    ; Initial constrained lookup failed after a file edit; relax search constraints while keeping comment/string flags                    CompilerIf #PBBReport                      If OPDMod & #OPDFollowSearchAndIdentification                        OPDReport("First search has no result. Retrying with relaxed constraints: " + SExpression$)                      EndIf                    CompilerEndIf                    ExecuteSearch = #PBBUserWillChoose | #PBBSearchPrefix                    pd = LastSearch\SearchInCom                    pf = LastSearch\SearchInQuotes                    PrepareSearchDetailsElement(LastSearch, SExpression$)                    LastSearch\SearchInCom    = pd                    LastSearch\SearchInQuotes = pf                    SearchResult = GetInfosFromData(LastSearch, ExecuteSearch)                  ElseIf SearchResult > 0                    CopyStructure(@LastSearch, @ListOfSearches()\Search_Details, SearchDetails)                  EndIf                EndIf              EndIf              ;              If SearchResult > 0                ; Unambiguous match (or auto-selected 'All' scope) established; clear interactive selection requirement                CompilerIf #PBBReport                  If OPDMod & #OPDFollowSearchAndIdentification                    OPDReport("One result with GetInfosFromData: " + LastSearch\ElementName$ + " " + LastSearch\ElementSpecies$ + " " + LastSearch\ElementSubSpecies$)                  EndIf                CompilerEndIf                ExecuteSearch = ExecuteSearch & ~#PBBUserWillChoose              EndIf            EndIf            ;            ; -------------------------------------------------------------------            ; 3. INTERACTIVE DISAMBIGUATION SHORT-CIRCUIT            ; -------------------------------------------------------------------            ; When GetInfosFromData opens the popup menu, SearchResult returns #PBBNoType.            ; Execution halts immediately to await user selection without altering UI views.            If SearchResult <> #PBBNoType              ;              ; -----------------------------------------------------------------              ; 4. UI PROJECTION & RESULT RENDERING              ; -----------------------------------------------------------------              If SearchResult = #PBBNotFound                ; No indexed project element matched: if GetInfosFromContext() already resolved a dead-zone element,                ; preserve its typed scope; otherwise fall back to raw text across code, dead zones, comments, and strings:                LastSearch\SearchInDeadZones = #True                If LastSearch\InDeadZone = #False Or LastSearch\TypeOfElement <= #PBBNoType Or LastSearch\TypeOfElement = #PBBNotAnElement                  LastSearch\SearchPurifiedOnly = #True                  If IsFromFRCheckboxToggle = #False                    LastSearch\SearchInCom    = #True                    LastSearch\SearchInQuotes = #True                  EndIf                EndIf              ElseIf IsFromFRWindow And FR_Gadgets\Window >= 0 And IsWindow(FR_Gadgets\Window)                LastSearch\SearchInCom        = Bool(GetGadgetState(FR_Gadgets\IgnoreComments) = 0)                LastSearch\SearchInQuotes     = Bool(GetGadgetState(FR_Gadgets\IgnoreStrings) = 0)              EndIf              ;              If (ExecuteSearch & #PBBSearchRawText) = 0 And IsFromScopeSelection = #False                If (ExecuteSearch & #PBBUserWillChoose) = 0 And SearchResult <> #PBBNotFound                  SExpression$ = LastSearch\ElementName$                EndIf                LastSearch\ElementName$         = SExpression$                LastSearch\ElementPurifiedName$ = PurifyForSearch(SExpression$)              EndIf              ;              If KeepSearchFieldFocus = #False                SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget, LastSearch\ElementName$)              EndIf              SetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\ExpressionDetails, ComputeExpressionDetails(LastSearch))              If IsFromFRWindow = #False Or (SearchResult = #PBBNotFound And IsFromFRCheckboxToggle = #False)                GUI_FR_SyncGadgetsWithSearch(@LastSearch)              EndIf              ;              If (ExecuteSearch & #PBBSearchRawText) = 0 And                 LastSearch\SearchPurifiedOnly = #False And                 (LastSearch\DontCheckPosition = #False Or                  (LastSearch\TypeOfElement = #PBBVariable And LastSearch\ElementSpecies$ = "Shared" And                   LastSearch\ParentTypeAndName$ <> "AllModules")) And                 LastSearch\ElementSpecies$ <> "Param" And                 GetActivePBBPanel() = #DetailPBBPanel                FillDetailREGadget(LastSearch)              Else                If KeepSearchFieldFocus = #False And (SExpression$ Or (ExecuteSearch & #PBBSearchRawText))                  SetActivePBBPanel(#FoundInFilesPBBPanel)                EndIf                FillFoundInREGadget(LastSearch)              EndIf              ;            EndIf            ;            ; Move keyboard focus to the active RichEdit gadget once a deliberate search or lookup is triggered,            ; while preserving focus inside SearchedExpression_gadget across passive background refreshes:            If KeepSearchFieldFocus              SetSearchButtonState(#PBBSearchBtn_Search, Bool(GetGadgetText(GPBBGadgets\SearchedExpression_gadget) <> ""))            Else              SearchFieldHasFocus = #False              SetActiveGadget(GetREGadgetNbrFromActivePBBPanel())            EndIf          EndIf          ;          ; Always reset ExecuteSearch unconditionally (including when the popup menu is open          ; with SearchResult = #PBBNoType) so the search block does not re-trigger in a loop.          ExecuteSearch = #PBBNoSearch        EndIf        ;        ; Centralized panel invalidation and lazy list rendering (placed at the end of the cycle        ; so RefreshEPanel requests from background tasks, menus, gadgets, or UpdateAllFilesInMemory()        ; are all processed in a single pass right before RefreshEPanel is cleared):        If RefreshEPanel          For TypeOfElement = 0 To #EndEnumPBBElementTypes - 1            ListCompletion(TypeOfElement) = #ListCompletion_UnPrinted          Next          If ListSize(PBB_FileListing()) > 0            FillFileREGadget()          EndIf          ActPannel = GetActivePBBPanel()          If LastSearch\ElementName$ = "" And (ActPannel = #DetailPBBPanel Or ActPannel = #FoundInFilesPBBPanel)            WalkOverPages(0, LastSearch)          EndIf        EndIf        ;        If GetGadgetState(GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget) = #ListPBBPanel And FileSize(PBBFicPrincipalPB$) > 2          If RefreshEPanel Or             (EventID = #PB_Event_Menu And (EventMenu = #PBBMenu_NextPanel Or EventMenu = #PBBMenu_PreviousPanel Or                                            EventMenu = #PBBMenu_NextPage  Or EventMenu = #PBBMenu_PreviousPage)) Or             (EventID = #PB_Event_Gadget And EventType() = #PB_EventType_Change And              (EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\ListsPGadget Or EventGadget = GPBBGadgets\MainPanelGadget))            TypeOfElement = TypeElementOfPBBPanel(GetActivePBBPanel())            If ExplorationState < #ExplorationState_Completed              ; Complete AST indexing with top priority before rendering an element list              ManagePBBBackgroundTasks(#BackgroundExplorationHasPriority, @LastSearch)            EndIf            If ListCompletion(TypeOfElement) < #ListCompletion_Printed              FillElementREGadget(TypeOfElement)              ; Drain raw OS paint messages generated by populating the RichEdit to avoid background slowdowns              While WindowEvent() : Wend            EndIf          EndIf        EndIf      EndIf      RefreshEPanel = #False    Until QuitAll    ;    If FR_Gadgets\Window >= 0 And IsWindow(FR_Gadgets\Window)      RecordWindowDimInPref(PBBrowserPrefile$, FR_Gadgets\Window, "_FR_Window")      CloseWindow(FR_Gadgets\Window)    EndIf    If IsWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)      RecordWindowDimInPref(PBBrowserPrefile$, GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)      CloseWindow(GPBBGadgets\PBBWindow)    EndIf  EndIf  ClearKeyboardBuffer(0)  ;  ; Ensure the clipboard content remains available after the program ends:  OleFlushClipboard_()  ;EndProcedure;PBBrowserMainProc();; IDE Options = PureBasic 6.41 (Windows - x64); CursorPosition = 50; FirstLine = 1285; Folding = AAQAAAAABAAE9; Optimizer; EnableXP; DPIAware; UseIcon = PBBrowser resources\Images\PBBrowserLogo.ico; Executable = PBBrowser.exe; DisablePurifier = 32,32,64,32